ade and those who listen want the power to fight them.":"E acima de tudo, Wade e aqueles que os ouvem querem o poder para combat\u00ea-los.","And now they are very blatantly telling us to meet the quota.":"E agora eles est\u00e3o nos dizendo descaradamente para cumprir a cota.","And one more thing...":"E mais uma coisa...","And out of all the options, you should only think about the one person you want to protect.":"E dentre todas as op\u00e7\u00f5es, voc\u00ea deve pensar apenas na pessoa que deseja proteger.","And the master of nightmares.":"E o mestre dos pesadelos.","And the resurrection of the ancient gods is just around the corner. There is no time.":"E a ressurrei\u00e7\u00e3o dos deuses antigos est\u00e1 chegando. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 tempo.","And then the monsters appeared. Now it may seem like they are looking down on them by calling them fish, but that is something only people who have not fought in person say.":"E ent\u00e3o os monstros apareceram. Agora pode parecer que eles os est\u00e3o desprezando ao cham\u00e1-los de peixes, mas isso \u00e9 algo que s\u00f3 pessoas que n\u00e3o lutaram pessoalmente dizem.","And then they say they don't like war, they're pure cowards...":"E depois dizem que n\u00e3o gostam de guerra, s\u00e3o puros covardes...","And they don't ask for broken items.":"E eles n\u00e3o pedem itens quebrados.","And unless you know what this guy is after... you have to keep his return in mind too!":"E a menos que voc\u00ea saiba o que esse cara est\u00e1 procurando... voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m deve manter o retorno dele em mente!","And when that time comes... I'll really... live for my dreams.":"E quando essa hora chegar... eu realmente... viverei pelos meus sonhos.","And when you're among them":"E quando voc\u00ea est\u00e1 entre eles","And when you're among them;It sounds more powerful;The sound of my pulse...":"E quando voc\u00ea est\u00e1 entre eles;Parece mais poderoso;O som do meu pulso...","And yet, the Congress is treating him as a hero w