lready made a mistake once.":"Porque j\u00e1 cometi um erro uma vez.","Because I am already immune to this barrier. It's my first time going with someone else. Even though it's annoying, there's nothing I can do about it.":"Porque j\u00e1 estou imune a essa barreira. \u00c9 a primeira vez que vou com outra pessoa. Mesmo que seja irritante, n\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada que eu possa fazer a respeito.","Because I couldn't control it.":"Porque eu n\u00e3o conseguia controlar isso.","Because I don":"Porque eu n\u00e3o","Because I don't want to become a god of destruction like the master of nightmares.":"Porque n\u00e3o quero me tornar um deus da destrui\u00e7\u00e3o como o mestre dos pesadelos.","Because I don't want to let you go, I'm going to fight you with all my might this time.":"Porque n\u00e3o quero deixar voc\u00ea ir, vou lutar com voc\u00ea com todas as minhas for\u00e7as desta vez.","Because I don\u2019t want to go back to being the fool I used to be who couldn\u2019t even count.":"Porque n\u00e3o quero voltar a ser o idiota que costumava ser e que nem sabia contar.","Because I just lost to a human being, I'm in a really bad mood, right?":"Porque acabei de perder para um ser humano, estou de muito mau humor, certo?","Because I knew that the Relics of the Advent could control spirits..?":"Porque eu sabia que as Rel\u00edquias do Advento poderiam controlar os esp\u00edritos..?","Because I know it":"Porque eu sei disso","Because I know it\u2019s a lie. Despite that mistake, everyone believed in me, relied on me... and forgave me.":"Porque eu sei que \u00e9 mentira. Apesar desse erro, todos acreditaram em mim, confiaram em mim... e me perdoaram.","Because I need Ren more than such a monstrous weapon.":"Porque eu preciso de Ren mais do que de uma arma t\u00e3o monstruosa.","Because I promised... with Tiana... with Chris, with Alex.":"Porque eu prometi... com Tiana... com Chris, com Alex.","Because I'm a mercenary... I like to work diligently to organize my thoughts.":"Porque sou um mercen\u00e1rio... gosto de trabalhar diligentemente para organizar meus pensamentos.","Because I'm busy.":"Porque estou ocupado.","Because I'm hungry... my recovery is so slow...":"Porque estou com fome... minha recupera\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 t\u00e3o lenta...","Because I... can't do that.":"Porque eu... n\u00e3o posso fazer isso.","Because everyone will come back.":"Porque todo mundo vai voltar.","Because for everyone to survive, a few people have to die. Because that is a noble sacrifice?":"Porque para que todos sobrevivam, algumas pessoas t\u00eam que morrer. Porque esse \u00e9 um sacrif\u00edcio nobre?","Because future movement is more important than that place.":"Porque o movimento futuro \u00e9 mais importante que aquele lugar.","Because he didn't want it anymore.":"Porque ele n\u00e3o queria mais.","Because he was the closest successor...":"Porque ele era o sucessor mais pr\u00f3ximo...","Because he, an ordinary human being, did not have the power to defy the Advent.":"Porque ele, um ser humano comum, n\u00e3o tinha o poder de desafiar o Advento.","Because in the end, you will end up going in droves. If Eileen is like that, she probably won't be able to have a proper conversation anyway...":"Porque no final voc\u00ea vai acabar indo em massa. Se Eileen for assim, ela provavelmente n\u00e3o conseguir\u00e1 ter uma conversa adequada de qualquer maneira...","Because it":"Porque isso","Because it doesn't help...":"Porque isso n\u00e3o ajuda...","Because it is a poor village, there is nothing else to give. That's a trinket I used, and I'll lend it to you.":"Por ser uma aldeia pobre, n\u00e3o h\u00e1 mais nada para dar. Essa \u00e9 uma bugiganga que usei e vou emprestar para voc\u00ea.","Because it was something I was tired of doing during my mercenary days.":"Porque era algo que eu estava cansado de fazer durante meus dias de mercen\u00e1rio.","Because it's better to die.":"Porque \u00e9 melhor morrer.","Because it's better to go alone than to carry a bunch of luggage...":"Porque \u00e9 melhor ir sozinho do que carregar muita bagagem...","Because it's necessary information.":"Porque s\u00e3o informa\u00e7\u00f5es necess\u00e1rias.","Because it's not mine.":"Porque n\u00e3o \u00e9 meu.","Because it's still alive and well.":"Porque ainda est\u00e1 vivo e bem.","Because it\u2019s raining right now":"Porque est\u00e1 chovendo agora","Because life is just torture...":"Porque a vida \u00e9 apenas uma tortura...","Because not all successors are qualified to become the masters of God.":"Porque nem todos os sucessores est\u00e3o qualificados para se tornarem mestres de Deus.","Because now you just look like a stooge for the Wade family.":"Porque agora voc\u00ea parece um fantoche da fam\u00edlia Wade.","Because of me,":"Por minha causa,","Because of me,;What Schurz lost...":"Por minha causa,;O que Schurz perdeu...","Because of personal circumstances. I'm not that free.":"Por causa de circunst\u00e2ncias pessoais. Eu n\u00e3o sou t\u00e3o livre.","Because of the fight five years ago, the seal was weakened. That's why ancient species began to appear.":"Por causa da luta de cinco anos atr\u00e1s, o selo ficou enfraquecido. \u00c9 por isso que esp\u00e9cies antigas come\u00e7aram a aparecer.","Because of the magic barrier, the boat cannot float.)":"Por causa da barreira m\u00e1gica, o barco n\u00e3o pode flutuar.)","Because of this power, Revan was able to find a warm haven and have the power to confront those who heard him.":"Por causa desse poder, Revan conseguiu encontrar um ref\u00fagio acolhedor e ter o poder de confrontar aqueles que o ouviam.","Because peace in this village is my greatest wish.":"Porque a paz nesta aldeia \u00e9 o meu maior desejo.","Because people from various islands gather on a ferry, you can hear news from other islands.":"Como pessoas de v\u00e1rias ilhas se re\u00fanem numa balsa, voc\u00ea pode ouvir not\u00edcias de outras ilhas.","Because that's fine too.":"Porque tudo bem tamb\u00e9m.","Because that's what I wanted most... If you're a successor, you'd know.":"Porque era isso que eu mais queria... Se voc\u00ea fosse um sucessor, voc\u00ea saberia.","Because the black soldiers make me really uncomfortable... I don't like the village being this bloody.":"Porque os soldados negros me deixam muito desconfort\u00e1vel... N\u00e3o gosto que a vila seja t\u00e3o sangrenta.","Because the last cells of }Ellen{ were dying.":"Porque as \u00faltimas c\u00e9lulas de }Ellen{ estavam morrendo.","Because the necessary materials can be obtained only through disassembly. Is it possible?":"Porque os materiais necess\u00e1rios s\u00f3 podem ser obtidos atrav\u00e9s da desmontagem. \u00c9 poss\u00edvel?","Because there are people":"Porque h\u00e1 pessoas","Because there is a real reason.":"Porque h\u00e1 uma raz\u00e3o real.","Because there was an accident. Is there Kaz?":"Porque houve um acidente. Existe Kaz?","Because there's nothing left but this.":"Porque n\u00e3o resta mais nada al\u00e9m disso.","Because we are working hard to provide nutrition. That's my ability.":"Porque estamos trabalhando muito para fornecer nutri\u00e7\u00e3o. Essa \u00e9 a minha habilidade.","Because we share the same life...":"Porque compartilhamos a mesma vida...","Because you are not alone. So it's imperfect, but that's what makes it bearable.":"Porque voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 sozinho. Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 imperfeito, mas \u00e9 isso que o torna suport\u00e1vel.","Becoming bait for that guy, I've already done it several times. I will definitely go alive.":"Virar isca para aquele cara, j\u00e1 fiz isso diversas vezes. Eu definitivamente irei vivo.","Beelzebub Circlet":"C\u00edrculo de Belzebu","Beelzebub CircletL0":"C\u00edrculo de BelzebuL0","Beelzebub Cold":"Frio de Belzebu","Beelzebub Cold4A":"Belzebu Cold4A","Beelzebub Dagger":"Adaga de Belzebu","Beelzebub Greatsword":"Espada Grande de Belzebu","Beelzebub Greatswordh":"Espada Grande de Belzebu","Beelzebub Halberd":"Alabarda de Belzebu","Beel