im.":"Ele me pediu para enviar para ele.","He became so strong that the listeners could not control him.":"Ele se tornou t\u00e3o forte que os ouvintes n\u00e3o conseguiram control\u00e1-lo.","He did as Tyr said.":"Ele fez o que Tyr disse.","He died because I couldn't protect him.. Is this enough?":"Ele morreu porque eu n\u00e3o pude proteg\u00ea-lo.. Isso \u00e9 suficiente?","He doesn't have a bad haircut, but the young guy is useful...":"Ele n\u00e3o tem um corte de cabelo feio, mas o jovem \u00e9 \u00fatil...","He escaped like nothing happened.. I can't believe a guy like that is an enemy..":"Ele escapou como se nada tivesse acontecido.. N\u00e3o acredito que um cara assim seja um inimigo..","He even has a strange tattoo.":"Ele at\u00e9 tem uma tatuagem estranha.","He hid it on a cliff on the north coast and said he was going to Irem.":"Ele o escondeu em um penhasco no litoral norte e disse que estava indo para Irem.","He is a precious friend. We got through the worst times together...":"Ele \u00e9 um amigo precioso. Passamos pelos piores momentos juntos...","He is a risk factor":"Ele \u00e9 um fator de risco","He is also a successor":"Ele tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 um sucessor","He is constantly looking for and doing anything that can hurt the Wade family.":"Ele est\u00e1 constantemente procurando e fazendo qualquer coisa que possa prejudicar a fam\u00edlia Wade.","He is the ancient god of }Neved{.":"Ele \u00e9 o antigo deus de }Neved{.","He is the one with the strongest weapon.":"Ele \u00e9 quem tem a arma mais forte.","He is the true enemy who destroyed our }Enest family{ and your }Bane family{.":"Ele \u00e9 o verdadeiro inimigo que destruiu nossa }fam\u00edlia Enest{ e sua }fam\u00edlia Bane{.","He just seems like a skilled grave robber.":"Ele parece apenas um ladr\u00e3o de t\u00famulos habilidoso.","He looks a lot like Ren...":"Ele se parece muito com Ren...","He looks like a low-level civil servant.. I'll give him a little nudge.":"Ele parece um funcion\u00e1rio p\u00fablico de baixo escal\u00e3o. Vou dar-lhe uma pequena cutucada.","He might be wanted...":"Ele pode ser procurado...","He must have fallen on the street at night. What are ghosts in this world these days?":"Ele deve ter ca\u00eddo na rua \u00e0 noite. O que s\u00e3o fantasmas neste mundo hoje em dia?","He said he could protect his own body. Calm down.":"Ele disse que poderia proteger seu pr\u00f3prio corpo. Acalmar.","He said he is a god because he is not a being that we can control with our own hands.":"Ele disse que \u00e9 um deus porque n\u00e3o \u00e9 um ser que possamos controlar com nossas pr\u00f3prias m\u00e3os.","He said he was very disappointed because they didn't enjoy it together until the end. Kkkkkkk..":"Ele disse que ficou muito decepcionado porque eles n\u00e3o curtiram juntos at\u00e9 o final. Kkkkkk..","He said he would exchange it for spore leaves.":"Ele disse que iria troc\u00e1-lo por folhas de esporos.","He said it's hard to just keep sleeping.":"Ele disse que \u00e9 dif\u00edcil continuar dormindo.","He said there was something we could do to seal the Old God. Where is the Guardian?":"Ele disse que havia algo que poder\u00edamos fazer para selar o Deus Antigo. Onde est\u00e1 o Guardi\u00e3o?","He seems like a heartless guy...":"Ele parece um cara sem cora\u00e7\u00e3o...","He seems like a pretty famous wanted man, seeing as they don't even let him out on deck.":"Ele parece um homem procurado muito famoso, j\u00e1 que nem o deixam sair no conv\u00e9s.","He seems uneasy because of the black robes.":"Ele parece desconfort\u00e1vel por causa das vestes pretas.","He showed up after 5 years, said what he had to say, and ran away.":"Ele apareceu depois de 5 anos, disse o que tinha a dizer e fugiu.","He talked about the non-human power that the Wade family was hiding... and said that we should find the person behind it and take revenge together.":"Ele falou sobre o poder n\u00e3o-humano que a fam\u00edlia Wade estava escondendo... e disse que dever\u00edamos encontrar a pessoa por tr\u00e1s disso e nos vingarmos juntos.","He tells you to get topaz.":"Ele diz para voc\u00ea pegar top\u00e1zio.","He told me the story of Lurain.){":"Ele me contou a hist\u00f3ria de Lurain.){","He told me to protect the village... and I followed the trail to the east... alone...":"Ele me disse para proteger a aldeia... e eu segui a trilha para o leste... sozinho...","He told the story about the house on 17th Street.){":"Ele contou a hist\u00f3ria da casa na Rua 17.){","He was a cripple like me, but one day he suddenly became fine. Moreover, it even causes a miracle.":"Ele era um aleijado como eu, mas um dia de repente ficou bom. Al\u00e9m disso, causa at\u00e9 um milagre.","He was a former soldier who risked his life in a war with his ancestors... It's strange.":"Ele era um ex-soldado que arriscou a vida numa guerra com seus ancestrais... \u00c9 estranho.","He was a high-ranking officer who betrayed the regular army during the Holy Land War. He was a first-level wanted man whom the Wade family was desperately trying to catch.":"Ele era um oficial de alta patente que traiu o ex\u00e9rcito regular durante a Guerra da Terra Santa. Ele era um homem procurado de primeiro n\u00edvel que a fam\u00edlia Wade tentava desesperadamente capturar.","He was truly a great human being.":"Ele era realmente um grande ser humano.","He's a mercenary, tsk tsk... he still looks young.":"Ele \u00e9 um mercen\u00e1rio, tsk tsk... ele ainda parece jovem.","He's a traitor who can't be taken out or taken away.":"Ele \u00e9 um traidor que n\u00e3o pode ser eliminado ou levado embora.","He's always doubted":"Ele sempre duvidou","He's much more mature and cool than I thought. I'm glad to meet a good successor!":"Ele \u00e9 muito mais maduro e legal do que eu pensava. Estou feliz por conhecer um bom sucessor!","He's obsessed with studying the magic of the Seonju species and its origins.":"Ele est\u00e1 obcecado em estudar a magia da esp\u00e9cie Seonju e suas origens.","He's one of the precious people I couldn't protect. Is this enough?":"Ele \u00e9 uma das pessoas preciosas que n\u00e3o pude proteger. Isso \u00e9 suficiente?","He's the one the Wade family hasn't caught in five years. It would be faster to wait for it to approach first.":"Ele \u00e9 aquele que a fam\u00edlia Wade n\u00e3o pega h\u00e1 cinco anos. Seria mais r\u00e1pido esperar que ele se aproximasse primeiro.","He's the one who has to settle the score somehow. Because conversation doesn't work.":"\u00c9 ele quem tem que acertar as contas de alguma forma. Porque a conversa n\u00e3o funciona.","He... used all of us to perfect the spirit...":"Ele... usou todos n\u00f3s para aperfei\u00e7oar o esp\u00edrito...","Heading Home":"Indo para casa","Heading HomeuUntil I hear from Kaz":"Indo para casa at\u00e9 eu ter not\u00edcias de Kaz","Heading HomeuUntil I hear from Kaz;Building trust among mercenaries;I think we should continue.;Let":"Indo para casa at\u00e9 eu ter not\u00edcias de Kaz;Construindo confian\u00e7a entre mercen\u00e1rios;Acho que dever\u00edamos continuar.;Deixe","Health+#1":"Sa\u00fade+#1","Health: Max HP/HP recovery speed/physical defense/magic defense":"Sa\u00fade: Velocidade m\u00e1xima de recupera\u00e7\u00e3o de HP/HP/defesa f\u00edsica/defesa m\u00e1gica","Heavy":"Pesado","Heavy Guard Robot":"Rob\u00f4 de Guarda Pesada","Heavy single hits are more effective than rapid hits against high DEF foes.":"Golpes \u00fanicos pesados s\u00e3o mais eficazes do que golpes r\u00e1pidos contra inimigos com alta DEF.","Heck, what... are you the bait again? It seems like you don't get tired of failing over and over again.":"Caramba, o que... voc\u00ea \u00e9 a isca de novo? Parece que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o se cansa de falhar repetidamente.","Hede gloves":"Hede luvas","Hee.. I need to cheer up, right? still. Besides Rufus, there are still three left.":"Hee.. Preciso me animar, certo? ainda. Al\u00e9m de Rufus, ainda restam tr\u00eas.","Hehe, I broke three pi