 about the new world.":"Por\u00e9m, depois de ouvir as leis do Advento, sua vida ser\u00e1 novamente repleta de alegria devido \u00e0 excita\u00e7\u00e3o com o novo mundo.","However, all the precious books have disappeared, and the frozen sea is full of monsters, so you can't go there.":"Por\u00e9m, todos os livros preciosos desapareceram e o mar congelado est\u00e1 cheio de monstros, ent\u00e3o voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pode ir at\u00e9 l\u00e1.","However, both because I have become cautious about the revolution... and because I suddenly disappeared... there is something a little unclear these days.":"No entanto, tanto porque me tornei cauteloso em rela\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 revolu\u00e7\u00e3o... como porque desapareci repentinamente... h\u00e1 algo um pouco obscuro nestes dias.","However, if Mr. Schurz continues to help Mr. Kaz, my path to success could be in danger if I explain it too hastily.":"No entanto, se o Sr. Schurz continuar a ajudar o Sr. Kaz, meu caminho para o sucesso poder\u00e1 estar em perigo se eu explicar isso precipitadamente.","However, if you register, you can always check item information in the <Encyclopedia{.":"No entanto, se voc\u00ea se registrar, poder\u00e1 sempre verificar as informa\u00e7\u00f5es do item na <Enciclop\u00e9dia{.","However, it is broken and cannot be used as is.":"No entanto, est\u00e1 quebrado e n\u00e3o pode ser usado como est\u00e1.","However, it is broken and cannot be used as is.J":"No entanto, est\u00e1 quebrado e n\u00e3o pode ser usado como est\u00e1.J","However, it is said that the god had a bad personality and ended up fighting with the creatures and was eventually sealed.":"Por\u00e9m, diz-se que o deus tinha uma personalidade ruim e acabou brigando com as criaturas e acabou sendo selado.","However, neither Advent nor the Ancient Gods had the power to revive the dead.":"No entanto, nem o Advento nem os Deuses Antigos tinham o poder de reviver os mortos.","However, several people from our guild did not return. Because 