da humanidade,","I am the last survivor of the Bane family.":"Sou o \u00faltimo sobrevivente da fam\u00edlia Bane.","I am the master of this world...":"Eu sou o mestre deste mundo...","I am the owner of the building. That guy...":"Eu sou o dono do pr\u00e9dio. Esse cara...","I am your creator,":"Eu sou seu criador,","I am your master...":"Eu sou seu mestre...","I am }Evelyn{.. a successor like you, and a member of the revolutionary army }Revan{.":"Eu sou }Evelyn{.. uma sucessora como voc\u00ea e membro do ex\u00e9rcito revolucion\u00e1rio }Revan{.","I am }Theodor{.. a successor like you, and a member of the revolutionary army }Revan{.":"Eu sou }Theodor{.. um sucessor como voc\u00ea e membro do ex\u00e9rcito revolucion\u00e1rio }Revan{.","I am... Schurz. How did you know I was a mercenary?":"Eu sou... Schurz. Como voc\u00ea sabia que eu era um mercen\u00e1rio?","I am... Tyr. Call me Tyr.":"Eu sou... Tyr. Me chame de Tyr.","I ask":"eu pergunto","I ask.":"Eu pergunto.","I asked the man outside to examine the habitat to see if there was anything I could use as medicine.":"Pedi ao homem l\u00e1 fora que examinasse o habitat para ver se havia algo que eu pudesse usar como rem\u00e9dio.","I asked to check the security device.":"Pedi para verificar o dispositivo de seguran\u00e7a.","I asked what the research was about and he said you knew?":"Perguntei sobre o que era a pesquisa e ele disse que voc\u00ea sabia?","I assure you. When the redevelopment is over, the people there will become debtors just like me.":"Eu garanto a voc\u00ea. Quando a reconstru\u00e7\u00e3o terminar, as pessoas de l\u00e1 se tornar\u00e3o devedoras como eu.","I became more confident.":"Fiquei mais confiante.","I became unemployed.":"Fiquei desempregado.","I believe in humans. You will discover for yourself the true reason for your existence.":"Eu acredito em humanos. Voc\u00ea descobrir\u00e1 por si mesmo a verdadeira raz\u00e3o da sua exist\u00eancia.","I believe in you, Schurz. }See you again in Rockville{.":"Eu acredito em voc\u00ea, Schurz. }Vejo voc\u00ea novamente em Rockville{.","I believe so too.":"Eu tamb\u00e9m acredito.","I bet you have it.":"Aposto que voc\u00ea tem.","I came all the way here, carrying you on my back. It's called }ren{.":"Vim at\u00e9 aqui, carregando voc\u00ea nas costas. Chama-se }ren{.","I came because I have something to tell you.":"Vim porque tenho algo para lhe contar.","I came here because I heard the road was opened... but this is not a place for people. I need to get out quickly.":"Vim aqui porque ouvi que a estrada estava aberta... mas este n\u00e3o \u00e9 um lugar para pessoas. Preciso sair rapidamente.","I came here on purpose because I was curious about that.":"Vim aqui de prop\u00f3sito porque estava curioso sobre isso.","I came here to take control of the Ark when Alex failed. So that the Adventists no longer run amok...":"Vim aqui para assumir o controle da Arca quando Alex falhou. Para que os Adventistas n\u00e3o fiquem mais descontrolados...","I came to prevent Tyr from joining the rebels, but I was reunited with the heir I had missed.":"Vim para impedir que Tyr se juntasse aos rebeldes, mas me reencontrei com o herdeiro que havia perdido.","I came to say my last goodbye.":"Vim dizer meu \u00faltimo adeus.","I can":"Eu posso","I can accommodate at least one person comfortably with my abilities. First, I want to make Eileen feel comfortable.":"Posso acomodar pelo menos uma pessoa confortavelmente com minhas habilidades. Primeiro, quero fazer com que Eileen se sinta confort\u00e1vel.","I can already feel him restoring his body again...){":"J\u00e1 posso senti-lo restaurando seu corpo novamente...){","I can escape from the boring farm work.. Heh heh!":"Eu posso escapar do chato trabalho agr\u00edcola.. Heh heh!","I can give you a simple recovery.":"Posso lhe dar uma recupera\u00e7\u00e3o simples.","I can hear it from inside. Like instinct...":"Eu posso ouvir isso de dentro. Como instinto...","I can hear it. The spirits are also reacting.":"Eu posso ouvir isso. Os esp\u00edritos tamb\u00e9m est\u00e3o reagindo.","I can make it for you as long as you bring the ingredients.":"Posso fazer isso para voc\u00ea, desde que traga os ingredientes.","I can no longer wander around without reason or purpose. If you don't find the answer here, you must act with the determination that you will never find it again.":"N\u00e3o posso mais vagar sem raz\u00e3o ou prop\u00f3sito. Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o encontrar a resposta aqui, voc\u00ea deve agir com a determina\u00e7\u00e3o de que nunca mais a encontrar\u00e1.","I can only":"Eu s\u00f3 posso","I can only;It's just an accessory to a weapon...":"Eu s\u00f3 posso;\u00c9 apenas um acess\u00f3rio de uma arma...","I can protect you to some extent. Within the barrier... even the lord of nightmares can't do anything clumsy.":"Posso proteg\u00ea-lo at\u00e9 certo ponto. Dentro da barreira... mesmo o senhor dos pesadelos n\u00e3o consegue fazer nada desajeitado.","I can repair weapons, but that's it.":"Posso consertar armas, mas \u00e9 isso.","I can sense from here that Sister Luraine is having a hard time, so if we don't hurry...!":"Posso sentir daqui que a Irm\u00e3 Luraine est\u00e1 passando por momentos dif\u00edceis, ent\u00e3o se n\u00e3o nos apressarmos...!","I can understand Nebed, and I can also get to know the guardian...":"Posso entender Nebed e tamb\u00e9m posso conhecer o guardi\u00e3o...","I can withstand it too... There's no way Shuu or Ren can't withstand it.":"Eu posso suportar isso tamb\u00e9m... N\u00e3o tem como Shuu ou Ren n\u00e3o aguentarem.","I can't afford to go around like that.":"N\u00e3o posso me dar ao luxo de andar por a\u00ed assim.","I can't be crushed to death":"Eu n\u00e3o posso ser esmagado at\u00e9 a morte","I can't bear it anymore...":"Eu n\u00e3o aguento mais...","I can't do it. If you tear it up, you won't be able to get a refund. Take it for yourself.":"Eu n\u00e3o posso fazer isso. Se voc\u00ea rasg\u00e1-lo, n\u00e3o poder\u00e1 obter reembolso. Pegue voc\u00ea mesmo.","I can't explain it in words. But I promise you.":"N\u00e3o consigo explicar em palavras. Mas eu prometo a voc\u00ea.","I can't get over it.":"Eu n\u00e3o consigo superar isso.","I can't give up here. I want to reveal the truth.":"Eu n\u00e3o posso desistir aqui. Eu quero revelar a verdade.","I can't go to the haunted house in the northwest anymore.":"N\u00e3o posso mais ir para a casa mal-assombrada no noroeste.","I can't go to the place written in the letter alone...":"N\u00e3o posso ir sozinho ao lugar escrito na carta...","I can't hear anything...? Jeonum..?":"N\u00e3o consigo ouvir nada...? Jeonum..?","I can't help but believe it...!":"N\u00e3o posso deixar de acreditar...!","I can't love.":"Eu n\u00e3o posso amar.","I can't love. Race is not such a low barrier.":"Eu n\u00e3o posso amar. A ra\u00e7a n\u00e3o \u00e9 uma barreira t\u00e3o baixa.","I can't say that it doesn't happen...":"N\u00e3o posso dizer que isso n\u00e3o aconte\u00e7a...","I can't shake the suspicion that there was another ulterior motive behind the expedition itself.":"N\u00e3o consigo afastar a suspeita de que havia outro motivo oculto por tr\u00e1s da expedi\u00e7\u00e3o em si.","I can't sleep because of nightmares":"N\u00e3o consigo dormir por causa de pesadelos","I can't trust you just by listening to Tyr's words.":"N\u00e3o posso confiar em voc\u00ea apenas ouvindo as palavras de Tyr.","I can't understand it...":"Eu n\u00e3o consigo entender isso...","I can't.":"Eu n\u00e3o posso.","I can\u2019t say I saw it in person...){":"N\u00e3o posso dizer que vi pessoalmente...){","I care a lot even if I don't show it...){":"Eu me importo muito, mesmo que n\u00e3o demonstre...){","I caught almost everything... I won't miss it!":"Peguei quase tudo... n\u00e3o vou perder!","I chose this guild based on a recommendation from a regular customer, so please be trustworthy.":"Eu escolhi esta guilda com base na recomenda\u00e7\u00e3o de um cliente regular, ent\u00e3o, por favor, seja confi\u00e1vel.","I combined the information Jake and I have gathered so far with the story told by Mr. Schurz.":"Combinei as informa\u00e7\u00f5es que Jake e eu coletamos at\u00e9 agora com a hist\u00f3ria contada pelo Sr. Schurz.","I come in and out quite often. There...":"Entro e saio com bastante frequ\u00eancia. L\u00e1...","I could make other potions with this...":"Eu poderia fazer outras po\u00e7\u00f5es com isso...","I couldn't ask Ren when he was there, but I found a picture like this.":"N\u00e3o pude perguntar ao Ren quando ele esteve l\u00e1, mas encontrei uma foto como esta.","I couldn't help it. The security card could no longer be used, and more than anything, the alert level had risen significantly.":"Eu n\u00e3o pude evitar. O cart\u00e3o de seguran\u00e7a n\u00e3o podia mais ser usado e, mais do que tudo, o n\u00edvel de alerta aumentou significativamente.","I couldn't let you die from my spirit.":"Eu n\u00e3o poderia deixar voc\u00ea morrer do meu esp\u00edrito.","I couldn't understand a single word of what was being said.":"Eu n\u00e3o conseguia entender uma \u00fanica palavra do que estava sendo dito.","I created a nickname.":"Criei um apelido.","I created a nickname.%":"Eu criei um apelido.%","I decline.":"Eu recuso.","I did so many bad things...":"Eu fiz tantas coisas ruins...","I did... I...":"Eu fiz... eu...","I didn't ask for your name?":"Eu n\u00e3o perguntei seu nome?","I didn't believe it at first, but... There is a tunnel in the northwest that collapsed due to the earthquake, and someone has been living there for a few months.":"A princ\u00edpio n\u00e3o acreditei, mas... H\u00e1 um t\u00fanel no noroeste que desabou devido ao terremoto, e algu\u00e9m mora l\u00e1 h\u00e1 alguns meses.","I didn't come here to fight. I hope you aren't on guard.":"Eu n\u00e3o vim aqui para lutar. Espero que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o esteja em guarda.","I didn't come to fight.":"Eu n\u00e3o vim para lutar.","I didn't do my best...but I guess I can't stop him.":"N\u00e3o fiz o meu melhor... mas acho que n\u00e3o posso impedi-lo.","I didn't do that on purpose either.":"Eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o fiz isso de prop\u00f3sito.","I didn't figure that out. The other successors also seemed to know nothing about the spirit's purpose or origin.":"Eu n\u00e3o descobri isso. Os outros sucessores tamb\u00e9m pareciam n\u00e3o saber nada sobre o prop\u00f3sito ou a origem do esp\u00edrito.","I didn't get angry. How does it feel to be a successor?":"Eu n\u00e3o fiquei com raiva. Qual \u00e9 a sensa\u00e7\u00e3o de ser um sucessor?","I didn't know I would be the first.":"Eu n\u00e3o sabia que seria o primeiro.","I didn't know it could go this fast. I guess you're a much more capable mercenary than I thought.":"Eu n\u00e3o sabia que poderia acontecer t\u00e3o r\u00e1pido. Acho que voc\u00ea \u00e9 um mercen\u00e1rio muito mais capaz do que eu pensava.","I didn't know that the first heir to come to my resting place would be you, Schurz, who I didn't even invite.":"Eu n\u00e3o sabia que o primeiro herdeiro a vir ao meu local de descanso seria voc\u00ea, Schurz, que eu nem convidei.","I didn't know the mining union would do something like this...":"Eu n\u00e3o sabia que o sindicato dos mineiros faria algo assim...","I didn't look well either.":"Eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o parecia bem.","I didn't say a word like that.":"Eu n\u00e3o disse uma palavra dessas.","I didn't secretly burn it. Fortunately, I found it first...":"Eu n\u00e3o o queimei secretamente. Felizmente, encontrei primeiro...","I didn't think it would still be open... Okay, I succeeded in getting in...){":"N\u00e3o pensei que ainda estaria aberto... Ok, consegui entrar...){","I didn't want to spend it like that. I guess this is the human emotion you were talking about?":"Eu n\u00e3o queria gastar assim. Eu acho que essa \u00e9 a emo\u00e7\u00e3o humana da qual voc\u00ea estava falando?","I do a lot of different things, but among them, I am in charge of collecting equipment.":"Fa\u00e7o muitas coisas diferentes, mas entre elas sou respons\u00e1vel pela coleta de equipamentos.","I do go to Rockville, though.":"Eu vou para Rockville, no entanto.","I do not have enough":"eu n\u00e3o tenho o suficiente","I do not have enough;money.":"eu n\u00e3o tenho o suficiente;dinheiro.","I do work here. However, I'm the type of person who gets a bit absorbed in my own research.":"Eu trabalho aqui. No entanto, sou o tipo de pessoa que fica um pouco absorto em minha pr\u00f3pria pesquisa.","I don":"eu n\u00e3o","I don't care anymore if that girl was Ellen or if I had my memories manipulated by the listeners.":"N\u00e3o me importo mais se aquela garota era Ellen ou se tive minhas mem\u00f3rias manipuladas pelos ouvintes.","I don't care. As long as Ren doesn't miss you.":"Eu n\u00e3o ligo. Contanto que Ren n\u00e3o sinta sua falta.","I don't care. If we want to travel together, it would be more convenient that way.":"Eu n\u00e3o ligo. Se quisermos viajar juntos, seria mais conveniente assim.","I don't care..!":"Eu n\u00e3o ligo..!","I don't even contain my body anymore":"Eu nem contenho mais meu corpo","I don't even have money to buy ingredients for dinner today, so what kind of guts does that guy have to open a restaurant?":"Eu nem tenho dinheiro para comprar ingredientes para o jantar hoje, ent\u00e3o que coragem esse cara tem para abrir um restaurante?","I don't even know what it means.":"Eu nem sei o que isso significa.","I don't have enough strength. Not yet...":"Eu n\u00e3o tenho for\u00e7a suficiente. Ainda n\u00e3o...","I don't have much to say... Would you like to at least tell me and Enya's love story?":"N\u00e3o tenho muito o que dizer... Voc\u00ea gostaria de pelo menos contar a hist\u00f3ria de amor entre mim e Enya?","I don't have time anymore.":"Eu n\u00e3o tenho mais tempo.","I don't have time to explain in detail. Now... there are people whose lives come and go.":"N\u00e3o tenho tempo para explicar em detalhes. Agora... h\u00e1 pessoas cujas vidas v\u00e3o e v\u00eam.","I don't know about their identities. But... I found out that there was someone behind the Wade family.":"N\u00e3o sei sobre suas identidades. Mas... descobri que havia algu\u00e9m por tr\u00e1s da fam\u00edlia Wade.","I don't know anything like that right now.":"Eu n\u00e3o sei de nada parecido agora.","I don't know anything..! I don't remember anything, without Chris I...!":"Eu n\u00e3o sei de nada..! N\u00e3o me lembro de nada, sem o Chris eu...!","I don't know because so many people come and go these days due to redevelopment and all.":"N\u00e3o sei porque muitas pessoas v\u00eam e v\u00e3o hoje em dia devido \u00e0 reforma e tudo mais.","I don't know either. If you want to get an answer... you have no choice but to find Crad.":"Eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o sei. Se voc\u00ea quiser obter uma resposta... voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tem escolha a n\u00e3o ser encontrar Crad.","I don't know either. It was only you here. You... were causing a ruckus.":"Eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o sei. Foi s\u00f3 voc\u00ea aqui. Voc\u00ea... estava causando uma confus\u00e3o.","I don't know either. What is a spirit and why am I in this form?":"Eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o sei. O que \u00e9 um esp\u00edrito e por que estou nesta forma?","I don't know how many there are, but I'll keep searching. Until you become the final winner...":"N\u00e3o sei quantos s\u00e3o, mas continuarei pesquisando. At\u00e9 voc\u00ea se tornar o vencedor final...","I don't know how much longer it will be... I guess I shouldn't cause trouble in the village.":"N\u00e3o sei quanto tempo vai demorar... Acho que n\u00e3o devo causar problemas na aldeia.","I don't know how skilled you are, but...":"N\u00e3o sei qu\u00e3o habilidoso voc\u00ea \u00e9, mas...","I don't know if I'll ever come back to the shrine of the Seonju sect.":"N\u00e3o sei se algum dia voltarei ao santu\u00e1rio da seita Seonju.","I don't know if I'll ever go to the shrine again, but I'll give it a try.":"N\u00e3o sei se voltarei ao santu\u00e1rio, mas vou tentar.","I don't know if it looks like this":"n\u00e3o sei se \u00e9 assim","I don't know if it will work out as well as I thought, but it wouldn't be a bad idea to try.":"N\u00e3o sei se vai funcionar t\u00e3o bem quanto pensei, mas n\u00e3o seria uma m\u00e1 ideia tentar.","I don't know if they will give me money, but I know someone who is looking for help.":"N\u00e3o sei se v\u00e3o me dar dinheiro, mas conhe\u00e7o algu\u00e9m que est\u00e1 procurando ajuda.","I don't know if they're looking for a successor or Tyr, but they could be helpful to us.":"N\u00e3o sei se est\u00e3o procurando um sucessor ou Tyr, mas podem ser \u00fateis para n\u00f3s.","I don't know if this makes sense, but...":"N\u00e3o sei se isso faz sentido, mas...","I don't know much about humans.":"N\u00e3o sei muito sobre humanos.","I don't know what I heard, but I think I heard some pretty exaggerated rumors.":"N\u00e3o sei o que ouvi, mas acho que ouvi alguns rumores bastante exagerados.","I don't know what I'm doing...":"Eu n\u00e3o sei o que estou fazendo...","I don't know what force makes the corpses move.":"N\u00e3o sei que for\u00e7a faz os cad\u00e1veres se moverem.","I don't know what the Wade family believes and why they are ignoring him...":"N\u00e3o sei no que a fam\u00edlia Wade acredita e por que o est\u00e3o ignorando...","I don't know what the woman herself thinks, but that's the way it is.":"N\u00e3o sei o que a pr\u00f3pria mulher pensa, mas \u00e9 assim que as coisas s\u00e3o.","I don't know what you're hearing, but they're probably the ones behind the Wade family that Kaz and I were trying to find.":"N\u00e3o sei o que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 ouvindo, mas provavelmente s\u00e3o eles que est\u00e3o por tr\u00e1s da fam\u00edlia Wade que Kaz e eu est\u00e1vamos tentando encontrar.","I don't know what you're talking about.":"N\u00e3o sei do que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 falando.","I don't know what's going on, but if it's not my fault and it's urgent for the Wade family...":"N\u00e3o sei o que est\u00e1 acontecendo, mas se n\u00e3o for minha culpa e for urgente para a fam\u00edlia Wade...","I don't know where or how many listeners there are. First of all, they say that the Black Army is made up entirely of people who listen.":"N\u00e3o sei onde ou quantos ouvintes existem. Em primeiro lugar, dizem que o Ex\u00e9rcito Negro \u00e9 composto inteiramente por pessoas que ouvem.","I don't know why I want to protect you, but...":"N\u00e3o sei por que quero proteger voc\u00ea, mas...","I don't know why you're interested in this, but... let's see. If you really want to try it...":"N\u00e3o sei por que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 interessado nisso, mas... vamos ver. Se voc\u00ea realmente quiser experimentar...","I don't know why, but even animals and monsters are afraid of those flames.":"N\u00e3o sei porqu\u00ea, mas at\u00e9 os animais e monstros t\u00eam medo dessas chamas.","I don't know! Kkeukkeuk, now that you've caught one, you'll know, right?":"N\u00e3o sei! Kkeukkeuk, agora que voc\u00ea pegou um, voc\u00ea vai saber, certo?","I don't know.":"N\u00e3o sei.","I don't know. I want to know too.":"N\u00e3o sei. Eu tamb\u00e9m quero saber.","I don't know. Of course you can't trust me. Because I am just a fool who has abandoned even the greatest purpose of life.":"N\u00e3o sei. Claro que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pode confiar em mim. Porque sou apenas um tolo que abandonou at\u00e9 mesmo o maior prop\u00f3sito da vida.","I don't know. Since Adventist's technology is not of this world... there is a possibility.":"N\u00e3o sei. Como a tecnologia adventista n\u00e3o \u00e9 deste mundo... existe uma possibilidade.","I don't know...":"Eu n\u00e3o sei...","I don't know... I don't know.":"N\u00e3o sei... n\u00e3o sei.","I don't know... I... I just... for now.":"N\u00e3o sei... eu... eu s\u00f3... por enquanto.","I don't like being in debt. But now it seems like my guild has been destroyed...":"N\u00e3o gosto de ficar endividado. Mas agora parece que minha guilda foi destru\u00edda...","I don't like it":"eu n\u00e3o gosto disso","I don't like it anymore, I don't want it anymore... I don't like scary things anymore!!":"N\u00e3o gosto mais, n\u00e3o quero mais... n\u00e3o gosto mais de coisas assustadoras!!","I don't like it because it feels like something is watching us, but...":"N\u00e3o gosto porque parece que algo est\u00e1 nos observando, mas...","I don't like not knowing anything like this.":"N\u00e3o gosto de n\u00e3o saber nada assim.","I don't like that! Having to kill someone without even knowing what happens...":"Eu n\u00e3o gosto disso! Ter que matar algu\u00e9m sem nem saber o que acontece...","I don't like the idea of you guys continuing to do whatever your original owner wants.":"N\u00e3o gosto da ideia de voc\u00eas continuarem a fazer o que o seu dono original quer.","I don't look like someone who would wander around a place like this without anything they want.":"N\u00e3o pare\u00e7o algu\u00e9m que vagaria por um lugar como esse sem nada que quisesse.","I don't need to be inside you...":"Eu n\u00e3o preciso estar dentro de voc\u00ea...","I don't receive it.":"Eu n\u00e3o recebo isso.","I don't remember.":"Eu n\u00e3o me lembro.","I don't think I can expect it.":"Eu n\u00e3o acho que posso esperar isso.","I don't think I can hang out for that long...){":"Acho que n\u00e3o conseguirei sair por tanto tempo...){","I don't think I can relax until I deal with him completely.":"Acho que n\u00e3o posso relaxar at\u00e9 lidar com ele completamente.","I don't think I'll be able to use the boat for a while, so if I need to go to another island, I'll use Graham's boat.":"Acho que n\u00e3o poderei usar o barco por um tempo, ent\u00e3o se precisar ir para outra ilha, usarei o barco do Graham.","I don't think it has anything to do with the Advent of Nebed. That suspicious group.":"N\u00e3o creio que tenha alguma coisa a ver com o Advento de Nebed. Esse grupo suspeito.","I don't think it'll be very useful.":"N\u00e3o creio que ser\u00e1 muito \u00fatil.","I don't think it's a bad thing to say.":"N\u00e3o acho que seja uma coisa ruim de se dizer.","I don't think it's a desirable change...":"N\u00e3o acho que seja uma mudan\u00e7a desej\u00e1vel...","I don't think it's a normal illness. I think it has something to do with spirits, but we'll have to wait and see.":"N\u00e3o acho que seja uma doen\u00e7a normal. Acho que tem algo a ver com esp\u00edritos, mas teremos que esperar para ver.","I don't think it's just motion sickness.":"N\u00e3o acho que seja apenas enj\u00f4o.","I don't think so. People get used to reality too easily...":"Eu n\u00e3o acho. As pessoas se acostumam com a realidade com muita facilidade...","I don't think so...":"Acho que n\u00e3o...","I don't think so...){":"Acho que n\u00e3o...){","I don't think there was a path like this...":"Acho que n\u00e3o existia um caminho assim...","I don't think there's a need to give the killer a proper fight.":"N\u00e3o creio que haja necessidade de dar ao assassino uma luta adequada.","I don't think there's anywhere in Central that will publish this, so I'll have to look for a newspaper or publisher in another province.":"N\u00e3o creio que haja nenhum lugar na Central que publique isso, ent\u00e3o terei que procurar um jornal ou editora em outra prov\u00edncia.","I don't think these are common earrings.":"N\u00e3o creio que sejam brincos comuns.","I don't think we can talk about Eileen together anyway, so let's get to the point.":"De qualquer forma, n\u00e3o acho que possamos conversar sobre Eileen juntos, ent\u00e3o vamos direto ao ponto.","I don't think we'll be satisfied if you run away like this.":"N\u00e3o acho que ficaremos satisfeitos se voc\u00ea fugir assim.","I don't trust you, but let's believe...){":"N\u00e3o confio em voc\u00ea, mas vamos acreditar...){","I don't understand what you were fighting over here with Alex.":"N\u00e3o entendo por que voc\u00ea estava brigando aqui com Alex.","I don't understand why so much money is being spent on something like this.":"N\u00e3o entendo por que tanto dinheiro est\u00e1 sendo gasto em algo assim.","I don't want that, so please run away.":"Eu n\u00e3o quero isso, ent\u00e3o por favor fuja.","I don't want that.":"Eu n\u00e3o quero isso.","I don't want the spirit to be completed.":"N\u00e3o quero que o esp\u00edrito se complete.","I don't want to do that.":"Eu n\u00e3o quero fazer isso.","I don't want to go":"eu n\u00e3o quero ir","I don\u2019t have enough money..":"Eu n\u00e3o tenho dinheiro suficiente..","I don\u2019t know anymore.){":"N\u00e3o sei mais.){","I don\u2019t know if you felt it, but monsters around the world are evolving abnormally.":"N\u00e3o sei se voc\u00ea sentiu isso, mas os monstros ao redor do mundo est\u00e3o evoluindo de forma anormal.","I don\u2019t know what resonance is, but it\u2019s nearby.":"N\u00e3o sei o que \u00e9 resson\u00e2ncia, mas est\u00e1 pr\u00f3ximo.","I don\u2019t know.. I feel dizzy.. and I feel weak..":"N\u00e3o sei.. sinto tonturas.. e sinto-me fraco..","I don\u2019t know.. I guess it\u2019s just like Eileen\u2019s time..":"N\u00e3o sei.. Acho que \u00e9 como na \u00e9poca da Eileen..","I don\u2019t like it..":"eu n\u00e3o gosto disso..","I don\u2019t like this.. This is not the power I wanted..":"Eu n\u00e3o gosto disso.. Este n\u00e3o \u00e9 o poder que eu queria..","I don\u2019t remember taking the photo or the background at all.":"N\u00e3o me lembro de tirar a foto ou o fundo.","I don\u2019t think they came because of us, but it\u2019s still a pain.":"N\u00e3o acho que eles vieram por nossa causa, mas ainda \u00e9 uma dor.","I don\u2019t think we\u2019ve found Rufus yet..)":"Acho que ainda n\u00e3o encontramos Rufus..)","I feel a bit more energetic now.":"Sinto-me um pouco mais en\u00e9rgico agora.","I feel a little downcast...){":"Sinto-me um pouco desanimado...){","I feel a spirit that wasn't there before. But seeing that it was a bit weak, it seemed like it was inside a building.":"Sinto um esp\u00edrito que n\u00e3o existia antes. Mas vendo que estava um pouco fraco, parecia que estava dentro de um pr\u00e9dio.","I feel it, the successor...":"Eu sinto isso, o sucessor...","I feel it.":"Eu sinto isso.","I feel it.. Go?":"Eu sinto isso.. Vai?","I feel like I can reach it...":"sinto que posso alcan\u00e7\u00e1-lo...","I feel like I need it for some reason. Please help Evelyn or Theo.":"Sinto que preciso disso por algum motivo. Por favor ajude Evelyn ou Theo.","I feel like more than 75% of the time I don't want to go.":"Sinto que h\u00e1 mais de 75% of na hora em que n\u00e3o quero ir.","I feel like something scary happened here...":"Sinto que algo assustador aconteceu aqui...","I feel like that.":"Eu me sinto assim.","I feel like you're hiding something. I want to see it in person.":"Sinto que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 escondendo alguma coisa. Quero ver pessoalmente.","I feel so.. nostalgic. Those eyes... that name...":"Eu me sinto t\u00e3o... nost\u00e1lgico. Aqueles olhos... esse nome...","I fell asleep first. I think it would be difficult to talk about it together.":"Adormeci primeiro. Acho que seria dif\u00edcil conversarmos sobre isso juntos.","I felt a bit uncomfortable because it was the place where the rebellion took place, but since it had already been suppressed, I thought it wouldn't be a big deal.":"Fiquei um pouco incomodado porque foi o local onde aconteceu a rebeli\u00e3o, mas como j\u00e1 havia sido reprimida, pensei que n\u00e3o seria grande coisa.","I felt like there were two successors in the village, so of course I thought it was Theodore.":"Eu senti como se houvesse dois sucessores na aldeia, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 claro que pensei que fosse o Theodore.","I finally felt it..":"finalmente senti..","I finally got a good sword.":"Finalmente consegui uma boa espada.","I finally got a good sword.;I'll come back stronger!":"Finalmente consegui uma boa espada.;Voltarei mais forte!","I forgot":"eu esqueci","I found a crad that could be a clue.":"Encontrei um idiota que pode ser uma pista.","I found four people, including you.":"Encontrei quatro pessoas, incluindo voc\u00ea.","I found it for you. Very dangerous for children...":"Eu encontrei para voc\u00ea. Muito perigoso para as crian\u00e7as...","I found it near the Ark in the Frozen Sea... Did you take it to the woman in the Irem library?)":"Encontrei-o perto da Arca no Mar Congelado... Voc\u00ea o levou para a mulher na biblioteca de Irem?)","I found out that the listeners here are up to something new.":"Descobri que os ouvintes aqui est\u00e3o tramando algo novo.","I found the entrance, but it seemed a bit dangerous, so I was waiting for you.":"Encontrei a entrada, mas parecia um pouco perigosa, ent\u00e3o estava esperando por voc\u00ea.","I fully understand and agree to this.":"Eu entendo perfeitamente e concordo com isso.","I gave it to you guys":"Eu dei para voc\u00eas","I gave up the key to brilliance.":"Desisti da chave do brilho.","I get injected with ancient god cells every day...":"Eu recebo inje\u00e7\u00f5es de c\u00e9lulas divinas antigas todos os dias...","I get it. Go away.":"Eu entendo. V\u00e1 embora.","I get it. I'll follow you soon.":"Entendo. Seguirei voc\u00ea em breve.","I got caught... I was waiting for all three of us to gather...":"Fui pego... estava esperando n\u00f3s tr\u00eas nos reunirmos...","I got everything?":"Eu tenho tudo?","I got money, not love.":"Eu tenho dinheiro, n\u00e3o amor.","I guess I can't just leave it like that. I'm thinking of raiding.":"Acho que n\u00e3o posso simplesmente deixar assim. Estou pensando em invadir.","I guess I expected him to be a master craftsman, but I'm a bit sorry...":"Acho que esperava que ele fosse um mestre artes\u00e3o, mas sinto um pouco...","I guess I need some guidance from that man. We have to find them before Rufus...":"Acho que preciso de alguma orienta\u00e7\u00e3o daquele homem. Temos que encontr\u00e1-los antes de Rufus...","I guess I need to dig deeper...":"Acho que preciso cavar mais fundo...","I guess I should pay the treatment fee generously.":"Acho que deveria pagar generosamente a taxa de tratamento.","I guess I'm anxious. I have to go too!":"Acho que estou ansioso. Eu tamb\u00e9m tenho que ir!","I guess I'm really annoying.":"Acho que sou muito chato.","I guess it doesn't exist now.":"Acho que isso n\u00e3o existe agora.","I guess it was a good thing I didn't bring Eileen.":"Acho que foi bom n\u00e3o ter trazido Eileen.","I guess money alone isn't enough.":"Acho que s\u00f3 dinheiro n\u00e3o \u00e9 suficiente.","I guess persuasion failed...){":"Acho que a persuas\u00e3o falhou...){","I guess so.":"Acho que sim.","I guess so... but I don't remember this place at all...":"Acho que sim... mas n\u00e3o me lembro desse lugar...","I guess so?":"Eu acho que sim?","I guess that cave earlier... seems to be an undersea cave across the sea.":"Acho que aquela caverna de antes... parece ser uma caverna submarina do outro lado do mar.","I guess that kind of thing is fine. More than that...":"Acho que esse tipo de coisa est\u00e1 bem. Mais do que isso...","I guess that's the case... Alfred, that man is the head of the Black Army, a unit directly under the Wade family.":"Acho que \u00e9 esse o caso... Alfred, esse homem \u00e9 o chefe do Ex\u00e9rcito Negro, uma unidade diretamente subordinada \u00e0 fam\u00edlia Wade.","I guess that's the place I like to spend my vacation in, even if it's a bit inconvenient.":"Acho que \u00e9 onde gosto de passar as f\u00e9rias, mesmo que seja um pouco inconveniente.","I guess that's what caused the inn to be noisy earlier. It's difficult...":"Acho que foi isso que fez com que a pousada ficasse barulhenta antes. \u00c9 dif\u00edcil...","I guess the successors":"Eu acho que os sucessores","I guess there":"Eu acho que a\u00ed","I guess this is the hardest thing for me?":"Eu acho que isso \u00e9 a coisa mais dif\u00edcil para mim?","I guess this is true...){":"Acho que isso \u00e9 verdade...){","I guess you still don":"Eu acho que voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o","I guess you still don\u2019t know me.. kekekeke..":"Acho que voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o me conhece.. kekekeke..","I guess you're a guy with a neat work style. Come again next time, I'll give you my good work.":"Acho que voc\u00ea \u00e9 um cara com um estilo de trabalho bacana. Volte na pr\u00f3xima vez, darei a voc\u00ea meu bom trabalho.","I guess... Eileen's spirit is causing some change.":"Acho que... o esp\u00edrito de Eileen est\u00e1 causando alguma mudan\u00e7a.","I guess... I don't think it's a trap for the listeners.":"Eu acho... n\u00e3o acho que seja uma armadilha para os ouvintes.","I guess... this is what Alex was protecting.":"Eu acho... que era isso que Alex estava protegendo.","I had it too.":"Eu tamb\u00e9m tive.","I had it too.;Someone who needs to be protected.;A person you want to rely on...":"Eu tamb\u00e9m tive.;Algu\u00e9m que precisa ser protegido.;Uma pessoa em quem voc\u00ea quer confiar...","I had no choice, because I was in a wheelchair and couldn't move without help.":"N\u00e3o tive escolha, pois estava numa cadeira de rodas e n\u00e3o conseguia me mover sem ajuda.","I had no idea it would get this far so quickly. Please understand that the test was a bit extreme because there were black robes.":"Eu n\u00e3o tinha ideia de que chegaria t\u00e3o longe t\u00e3o rapidamente. Por favor, entenda que o teste foi um pouco extremo porque havia vestes pretas.","I had no idea that the small crack planted back then would grow so uncontrollably.":"Eu n\u00e3o tinha ideia de que a pequena rachadura plantada naquela \u00e9poca cresceria de forma t\u00e3o incontrol\u00e1vel.","I had that dream just once a year ago... and that was when I accepted the spirit.":"Tive esse sonho apenas uma vez h\u00e1 um ano... e foi quando aceitei o esp\u00edrito.","I had to go to Rockville urgently...":"Eu tive que ir para Rockville com urg\u00eancia...","I happened to bring it with me when I entered the Central Tower.":"Acontece que eu o trouxe comigo quando entrei na Torre Central.","I hate being busy.":"Eu odeio estar ocupado.","I hate it! Even if I die, I can't do that!":"Eu odeio isso! Mesmo se eu morrer, n\u00e3o posso fazer isso!","I hate it! We'll go together!":"Eu odeio isso! Iremos juntos!","I hate that kind of thing.":"Eu odeio esse tipo de coisa.","I hate that.":"Eu odeio isso.","I hated you.. so much..":"Eu odiei voc\u00ea.. tanto..","I have a bad feeling.":"Estou com um mau pressentimento.","I have a bad personality, but...":"Eu tenho uma personalidade ruim, mas...","I have a dream that I want to achieve.":"Tenho um sonho que quero realizar.","I have a favor left to do... Should I quit and rest?|":"Ainda tenho um favor a fazer... Devo desistir e descansar?|","I have a house and a lot of money left over to run the guild, so I don't think there's any need to worry about making a living, right?":"Tenho uma casa e sobra muito dinheiro para administrar a guilda, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o acho que haja necessidade de me preocupar em ganhar a vida, certo?","I have a lot to ask you..":"Tenho muito que te perguntar..","I have a meat soup recipe.":"Tenho uma receita de sopa de carne.","I have a personal request.":"Eu tenho um pedido pessoal.","I have a promise to keep.":"Tenho uma promessa a cumprir.","I have a strong feeling that I need to save to keep up.":"Tenho uma forte sensa\u00e7\u00e3o de que preciso economizar para acompanhar.","I have an ominous feeling...":"Estou com uma sensa\u00e7\u00e3o sinistra...","I have been notified of the provision as above.":"Fui notificado da disposi\u00e7\u00e3o acima.","I have been working at this library for 7 years. Even when the revolution occurred four years ago, the library was protected.":"Trabalho nesta biblioteca h\u00e1 7 anos. Mesmo quando a revolu\u00e7\u00e3o ocorreu h\u00e1 quatro anos, a biblioteca estava protegida.","I have felt it. It feels like the owner of my body is not me, but the Advent.":"Eu senti isso. Parece que o dono do meu corpo n\u00e3o sou eu, mas o Advento.","I have more urgent work to do now.":"Tenho um trabalho mais urgente para fazer agora.","I have no choice but to collect it.":"N\u00e3o tenho escolha a n\u00e3o ser colet\u00e1-lo.","I have no choice but to go in and check. Theodore, can I get soul stones or soul powder around here?":"N\u00e3o tenho escolha a n\u00e3o ser entrar e verificar. Theodore, posso conseguir pedras da alma ou p\u00f3 da alma por aqui?","I have no choice but to go.":"N\u00e3o tenho escolha a n\u00e3o ser ir.","I have no intention of fighting because someone else told me to.":"N\u00e3o tenho inten\u00e7\u00e3o de lutar porque algu\u00e9m me mandou.","I have no intention of fighting either.":"Tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o tenho inten\u00e7\u00e3o de lutar.","I have no intention of opposing you... yet.":"N\u00e3o tenho inten\u00e7\u00e3o de me opor a voc\u00ea... ainda.","I have no purpose in life other than that right now. I hope you believe me.":"N\u00e3o tenho outro prop\u00f3sito na vida al\u00e9m desse agora. Espero que voc\u00ea acredite em mim.","I have people to keep, promises to keep... This... This is just the process...!":"Tenho pessoas para cumprir, promessas para cumprir... Isto... Este \u00e9 apenas o processo...!","I have some work left to do.":"Ainda tenho algum trabalho a fazer.","I have someone to protect,":"Eu tenho algu\u00e9m para proteger,","I have someone to protect,;I have a promise to keep.":"Eu tenho algu\u00e9m para proteger,;Tenho uma promessa a cumprir.","I have someone to protect. The person who must be protected before all mankind...":"Eu tenho algu\u00e9m para proteger. A pessoa que deve ser protegida diante de toda a humanidade...","I have something to see.":"Eu tenho algo para ver.","I have to collect this? Where should I go?":"Eu tenho que coletar isso? Para onde devo ir?","I have to do it. I have to fight until the end...":"Eu tenho que fazer isso. Tenho que lutar at\u00e9 o fim...","I have to do it... I can't get caught by them again... I can't go back to that time...":"Eu tenho que fazer isso... n\u00e3o posso ser pego por eles de novo... n\u00e3o posso voltar \u00e0quela \u00e9poca...","I have to enter the coffin of doctrine.":"Tenho que entrar no caix\u00e3o da doutrina.","I have to fight to protect what is precious... until I die, until I become a blood clot... kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk.":"Tenho que lutar para proteger o que \u00e9 precioso... at\u00e9 morrer, at\u00e9 virar um co\u00e1gulo de sangue... kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk.","I have to fight.":"Eu tenho que lutar.","I have to find Tiana... It's east.":"Tenho que encontrar Tiana... Fica a leste.","I have to find it. Who is playing pranks like this? How can I escape from this bondage?":"Eu tenho que encontrar isso. Quem est\u00e1 pregando pe\u00e7as assim? Como posso escapar dessa escravid\u00e3o?","I have to get it done this time...":"Tenho que fazer isso dessa vez...","I have to get paid.":"Eu tenho que ser pago.","I have to go back to Bernal. I guess I'm worried about Kaz.":"Tenho que voltar para Bernal. Acho que estou preocupado com Kaz.","I have to go to Rockville.":"Eu tenho que ir para Rockville.","I have to go to the northern cave, but... First, I have to find a way to escape the village and avoid their eyes.":"Tenho que ir para a caverna do norte, mas... Primeiro, tenho que encontrar uma maneira de escapar da vila e evitar os olhares deles.","I have to ride it.":"Eu tenho que mont\u00e1-lo.","I have to step away now...!){":"Preciso me afastar agora...!){","I have to suggest it to Kaz.":"Eu tenho que sugerir isso para Kaz.","I have to tell Kaz that I'm going to Moitura Island, so I'll go inside for a moment.":"Tenho que avisar Kaz que estou indo para a Ilha Moitura, ent\u00e3o vou entrar por um momento.","I haven't gotten over it yet.":"Ainda n\u00e3o superei isso.","I haven't seen Theodore lately. What's going on?":"N\u00e3o tenho visto Theodore ultimamente. O que est\u00e1 acontecendo?","I hear a sound inside.){":"Ou\u00e7o um som l\u00e1 dentro.){","I hear an unknown voice":"Eu ou\u00e7o uma voz desconhecida","I heard a story about a famous craftsman called Ronberg in Central... Are you by any chance?":"Ouvi uma hist\u00f3ria sobre um famoso artes\u00e3o chamado Ronberg na Central... Voc\u00ea por acaso?","I heard a story about a famous craftsman family called Ronberg in Central...":"Ouvi uma hist\u00f3ria sobre uma famosa fam\u00edlia de artes\u00e3os chamada Ronberg, na regi\u00e3o Central...","I heard from Tyr that the heir is coming to Irem.":"Ouvi de Tyr que o herdeiro est\u00e1 vindo para Irem.","I heard it from Graham. What did he do on Coal Creek Island?":"Eu ouvi isso de Graham. O que ele fez na Ilha Coal Creek?","I heard that after some major accident occurred in the Ernest family, a very young head of the family took over.":"Ouvi dizer que depois de um grande acidente ocorrido na fam\u00edlia Ernest, um jovem chefe de fam\u00edlia assumiu o comando.","I heard that ancient species only eat human internal organs. Please help me.":"Ouvi dizer que as esp\u00e9cies antigas s\u00f3 comem \u00f3rg\u00e3os internos humanos. Por favor me ajude.","I heard that everything with the L initial engraved on it is Ronberg's work.":"Ouvi dizer que tudo que tem a inicial L gravada \u00e9 obra de Ronberg.","I heard that he was a guest brought by Tyr... and he dealt with the monsters in the sacred place quite well.":"Ouvi dizer que ele foi um convidado trazido por Tyr... e ele lidou muito bem com os monstros no local sagrado.","I heard that if you cross the frozen sea, there is a village where you can collect taxes. Is this true?":"Ouvi dizer que se voc\u00ea cruzar o mar congelado, h\u00e1 uma vila onde voc\u00ea pode cobrar impostos. Isso \u00e9 verdade?","I heard that if you offend Wade Street in Central, you'll be caught and taken to Central Tower?":"Ouvi dizer que se voc\u00ea ofender a Wade Street na Central, ser\u00e1 pego e levado para a Torre Central?","I heard that it's hard to get a ferry to Rockville these days...":"Ouvi dizer que \u00e9 dif\u00edcil pegar uma balsa para Rockville hoje em dia...","I heard that passenger ship operations have been suspended and only cargo ships are traveling.":"Ouvi dizer que as opera\u00e7\u00f5es de navios de passageiros foram suspensas e apenas navios de carga est\u00e3o viajando.","I heard that spies are running rampant in other guilds in Central these days...":"Ouvi dizer que espi\u00f5es est\u00e3o invadindo outras guildas na Central atualmente...","I heard that the Old Gods are evil gods. Then I am completed...":"Ouvi dizer que os Deuses Antigos s\u00e3o deuses do mal. Ent\u00e3o estou completo...","I heard that the number of kids like that has increased considerably since the Holy Land War.":"Ouvi dizer que o n\u00famero de crian\u00e7as assim aumentou consideravelmente desde a Guerra da Terra Santa.","I heard that there are cases where high-quality ingredients can be made by combining existing ingredients.":"Ouvi dizer que h\u00e1 casos em que ingredientes de alta qualidade podem ser produzidos combinando ingredientes existentes.","I heard that there are people who gather children like that and sell them somewhere.":"Ouvi dizer que tem gente que re\u00fane crian\u00e7as assim e vende em algum lugar.","I heard that this is why I have a hard time communicating with young children.":"Ouvi dizer que \u00e9 por isso que tenho dificuldade em me comunicar com crian\u00e7as pequenas.","I heard the guild is gone":"Ouvi dizer que a guilda se foi","I heard the mercenaries hired by the mining union capture me and imprison me here.":"Ouvi dizer que os mercen\u00e1rios contratados pelo sindicato mineiro me capturaram e me aprisionaram aqui.","I heard the story from Theo. These days, it's rare to see new faces...":"Eu ouvi a hist\u00f3ria do Theo. Hoje em dia, \u00e9 raro ver rostos novos...","I heard the transport ship was attacked...":"Ouvi dizer que o navio de transporte foi atacado...","I heard there was once a fairly large city...":"Ouvi dizer que era uma vez uma cidade bastante grande...","I heard there was one kid who happened to be alive because he was away from Central.":"Ouvi dizer que havia um garoto que estava vivo porque estava longe da Central.","I heard there were some black robes hanging around... I guess something happened?":"Ouvi dizer que havia algumas vestes pretas por a\u00ed... Acho que aconteceu alguma coisa?","I heard you have combat skills?":"Ouvi dizer que voc\u00ea tem habilidades de combate?","I hid it on a cliff on the north coast and just asked them to tell me I was going to Irem.":"Escondi-o num penhasco na costa norte e pedi apenas que me avisassem que estava indo para Irem.","I hit him like that, but he went away unharmed...":"Eu bati nele daquele jeito, mas ele saiu ileso...","I hope Mark from the Thorn Spider Cave is a good person.":"Espero que Mark da Thorn Spider Cave seja uma boa pessoa.","I hope it doesn't cause trouble.":"Espero que isso n\u00e3o cause problemas.","I hope it doesn't end up being a waste of time... but it's definitely worth investigating, right?":"Espero que n\u00e3o seja uma perda de tempo... mas definitivamente vale a pena investigar, certo?","I hope it's true that there are survivors of Rydmeier. Because only they can appease the wrath of that volcano.":"Espero que seja verdade que existem sobreviventes de Rydmeier. Porque s\u00f3 eles podem apaziguar a ira daquele vulc\u00e3o.","I hope my younger brother didn't die in vain.":"Espero que meu irm\u00e3o mais novo n\u00e3o tenha morrido em v\u00e3o.","I hope so too..":"Eu tamb\u00e9m espero que sim..","I hope so.":"Espero que sim.","I hope that both humans and Neved will be properly prepared at that time.":"Espero que tanto os humanos quanto o Neved estejam devidamente preparados nesse momento.","I hope the twins in the northwest haunted place will have more fun, kekekeke...":"Espero que os g\u00eameos no lugar assombrado do noroeste se divirtam mais, kekekeke...","I hope to see you again in the future.":"Espero v\u00ea-lo novamente no futuro.","I hope you finish it as soon as possible. Because you never know when new information will come in.":"Espero que voc\u00ea termine o mais r\u00e1pido poss\u00edvel. Porque voc\u00ea nunca sabe quando novas informa\u00e7\u00f5es chegar\u00e3o.","I hope you guys don't break down.. Sincerely.":"Espero que voc\u00eas n\u00e3o desmoronem.. Atenciosamente.","I hope you guys like it. They clearly know their origins.":"Espero que voc\u00eas gostem. Eles conhecem claramente suas origens.","I just can't go in. Take this with you.":"Eu simplesmente n\u00e3o posso entrar. Leve isso com voc\u00ea.","I just don't want my heir to die.":"S\u00f3 n\u00e3o quero que meu herdeiro morra.","I just found it on 9th Street.":"Acabei de encontr\u00e1-lo na Rua 9.","I just found out about it now, but I actually can't believe it.":"Acabei de descobrir isso agora, mas na verdade n\u00e3o consigo acreditar.","I just gave up, but...":"Eu simplesmente desisti, mas...","I just hate putting off things I need to do.":"Eu simplesmente odeio adiar coisas que preciso fazer.","I just have something to show you...":"S\u00f3 tenho uma coisa para te mostrar...","I just have to stay here. If you are recognized for your contribution to the development corporation, you will be able to secure a good position in the future.":"Eu s\u00f3 tenho que ficar aqui. Se voc\u00ea for reconhecido por sua contribui\u00e7\u00e3o para a corpora\u00e7\u00e3o de desenvolvimento, poder\u00e1 garantir uma boa posi\u00e7\u00e3o no futuro.","I just need to find it again. Since I know where to get it, I can follow along in no time.":"Eu s\u00f3 preciso encontr\u00e1-lo novamente. Como sei onde consegui-lo, posso acompanhar rapidamente.","I just take you with me because my life is at stake, and you also never had a chance to choose your master, right?":"S\u00f3 te levo comigo porque minha vida est\u00e1 em jogo, e voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m nunca teve a chance de escolher seu mestre, certo?","I just thought about surviving.":"Eu apenas pensei em sobreviver.","I keep screaming inside of me... I want to be complete, I need to kill myself...!":"Fico gritando dentro de mim... quero ser completo, preciso me matar...!","I killed Chris... and Alex...":"Eu matei Chris... e Alex...","I knew a day like this would come someday.. someone is aiming for the successor..":"Eu sabia que um dia como esse chegaria algum dia.. algu\u00e9m est\u00e1 almejando o sucessor..","I know it well, right? About them.":"Eu sei bem, certo? Sobre eles.","I know that Mr. Schurz really cherishes Tiana.":"Eu sei que o Sr. Schurz realmente estima Tiana.","I know that there is no such thing in the magic used by the ancestors.":"Eu sei que n\u00e3o existe tal coisa na magia usada pelos ancestrais.","I know too well to say that I was talking in my sleep.":"Sei muito bem para dizer que estava falando enquanto dormia.","I know where you are hiding.":"Eu sei onde voc\u00ea est\u00e1 se escondendo.","I know, don't kill! Don't worry, hide!":"Eu sei, n\u00e3o mate! N\u00e3o se preocupe, esconda-se!","I know.":"Eu sei.","I know. But don't get too ahead of yourself.":"Eu sei. Mas n\u00e3o se precipite muito.","I know.. this time is different from other times..":"Eu sei.. desta vez \u00e9 diferente de outras vezes..","I know..! I will never be eaten by something like this.":"Eu sei..! Eu nunca serei comido por algo assim.","I know...so don't worry...":"Eu sei... ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o se preocupe...","I learned (a lot)":"Eu aprendi (muito)","I learned how to make weapons, but...":"Aprendi a fazer armas, mas...","I learned how to protect someone and-":"Aprendi como proteger algu\u00e9m e-","I leave it alone":"eu deixo isso em paz","I left the village.":"Sa\u00ed da aldeia.","I left the village.;become a clue to the rebels;A man named Theodore;I often go to the northern cave alone.;They said they were going to investigate.;Let's investigate there.":"Sa\u00ed da aldeia.;tornar-se uma pista para os rebeldes;Um homem chamado Teodoro;Costumo ir sozinho para a caverna do norte.;Eles disseram que iriam investigar.;Vamos investigar a\u00ed.","I like that.":"Eu gosto disso.","I like the quiet, but...":"Gosto do sil\u00eancio, mas...","I like things that are adult-like.":"Gosto de coisas que s\u00e3o adultas.","I look for it":"eu procuro por isso","I looked around and... all the monsters have become vicious. The journey will become much more difficult.":"Olhei em volta e... todos os monstros se tornaram cru\u00e9is. A jornada se tornar\u00e1 muito mais dif\u00edcil.","I made it because there were some injured people, but usually I just make it with beef jerky. So wake up from your dream.":"Fiz porque tinha alguns feridos, mas normalmente s\u00f3 fa\u00e7o com carne seca. Ent\u00e3o acorde do seu sonho.","I may have been captured.":"Posso ter sido capturado.","I may have done some trick...":"Posso ter feito algum truque...","I mean, even though I'm a trafficker, I've lived my life without causing any harm to others.":"Quer dizer, mesmo sendo traficante, vivi minha vida sem causar nenhum dano aos outros.","I mean, that's not something you have to worry about!":"Quero dizer, isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 algo com que voc\u00ea precise se preocupar!","I met Schurz before.":"Eu conheci Schurz antes.","I might kill Theodore, Evelyn, or even that little child.":"Eu poderia matar Theodore, Evelyn ou at\u00e9 mesmo aquela crian\u00e7a.","I might need some help. Tell him I want him to come as soon as possible.":"Talvez eu precise de ajuda. Diga a ele que quero que ele venha o mais r\u00e1pido poss\u00edvel.","I missed Rufus.":"Senti falta do Rufus.","I must have missed it, seeing you sweating in this cold.":"Devo ter sentido falta de ver voc\u00ea suando com esse frio.","I must protect this place.":"Devo proteger este lugar.","I need something similar to the }soulstone{ that I found in the }Frozen Sea{, and a lot of it...":"Preciso de algo 