e sent it to Central Tower for study?":"Se o Congresso soubesse da ferramenta, n\u00e3o a teria enviado \u00e0 Torre Central para estudo?","If Descendant is the creator of spirits as you said, I think we should research in another direction.":"Se o Descendente \u00e9 o criador dos esp\u00edritos, como voc\u00ea disse, acho que dever\u00edamos pesquisar em outra dire\u00e7\u00e3o.","If I always thought of others like that, I would feel at ease too.":"Se eu sempre pensasse nos outros assim, tamb\u00e9m me sentiria \u00e0 vontade.","If I can't become stronger myself...":"Se eu n\u00e3o puder me tornar mais forte...","If I could just live like this, I would. I hope other successors do the same.":"Se eu pudesse viver assim, eu viveria. Espero que outros sucessores fa\u00e7am o mesmo.","If I could step on the earth,":"Se eu pudesse pisar na terra,","If I could touch you with my hands...":"Se eu pudesse tocar voc\u00ea com minhas m\u00e3os...","If I don't get back something real that I need to protect anyway, that's fine too...":"Se eu n\u00e3o recuperar algo real que preciso proteger de qualquer maneira, tudo bem tamb\u00e9m...","If I go outside, I'm going to die, so I need you to save me. Can you do it?":"Se eu sair, vou morrer, ent\u00e3o preciso que voc\u00ea me salve. Voc\u00ea pode fazer isso?","If I had known it would be such a hardship, I wouldn't have moved, but I did.":"Se eu soubesse que seria t\u00e3o dif\u00edcil, n\u00e3o teria me mudado, mas mudei.","If I had other jobs to do, I wouldn't have taken on the job of protecting these guys.":"Se eu tivesse outras tarefas para fazer, n\u00e3o teria assumido a tarefa de proteger esses caras.","If I hadn't come to this island, I would have drowned in the sea.":"Se eu n\u00e3o tivesse vindo para esta ilha, teria me afogado no mar.","If I just get rid of this... can I get by?":"Se eu me livrar disso... posso sobreviver?","If I risk my life... I think we can join forces to create a seal. But...":"Se eu arriscar a minha 