ns are met while playing the game, it will be automatically achieved and registered, and you can check the achievements you have obtained so far in Main Menu > Achievements.!":"Se certas condi\u00e7\u00f5es forem atendidas durante o jogo, ele ser\u00e1 automaticamente alcan\u00e7ado e registrado, e voc\u00ea poder\u00e1 verificar as conquistas obtidas at\u00e9 o momento em Menu Principal > Conquistas.!","If even one of these is missing, you have to pay a penalty...":"Se pelo menos um deles estiver faltando, voc\u00ea ter\u00e1 que pagar uma multa...","If game runs slow, reduce visual effects in Settings.":"Se o jogo ficar lento, reduza os efeitos visuais nas Configura\u00e7\u00f5es.","If given another chance, wouldn't it be better to fight?":"Se tivesse outra chance, n\u00e3o seria melhor lutar?","If intervention is necessary, separate instructions will be given.":"Se for necess\u00e1ria interven\u00e7\u00e3o, ser\u00e3o fornecidas instru\u00e7\u00f5es separadas.","If it can be equipped to a spirit body, <I think it can be equipped to Ren as well.){":"Se puder ser equipado para um corpo espiritual, <acho que tamb\u00e9m pode ser equipado para Ren.){","If it doesn't work, you can't do it. Give it back.":"Se n\u00e3o funcionar, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pode fazer isso. Devolva.","If it goes as I heard from Tyr,":"Se tudo correr como ouvi de Tyr,","If it goes as I heard from Tyr,;Those who listen have already;Chris is in a closed mine shaft.;It's hiding;You probably know.;they are dangerous":"Se tudo correr como ouvi de Tyr,;Quem ouve j\u00e1;Chris est\u00e1 em um po\u00e7o de mina fechado.;Est\u00e1 se escondendo;Voc\u00ea provavelmente sabe.;eles s\u00e3o perigosos","If it is more convenient not to materialize, why bother to materialize?":"Se \u00e9 mais conveniente n\u00e3o materializar, por que se preocupar em materializar?","If it is the power of the spirit, it will definitely be able to help her.":"Se for o poder do esp\u00edrito, com certeza poder\u00e1 ajud\u00e1-la.","If it sells, it will be quite a profit.":"Se vender, ser\u00e1 um grande lucro.","If it sells, it will be quite a profit.~":"Se vender, ser\u00e1 um grande lucro.~","If it was a rebel hideout, they wouldn't have put up a sign or something, right?":"Se fosse um esconderijo rebelde, eles n\u00e3o teriam colocado uma placa ou algo assim, certo?","If it was about the mansion, there was no way Kaz would tell everything to just one employee.":"Se fosse sobre a mans\u00e3o, Kaz n\u00e3o contaria tudo para apenas um funcion\u00e1rio.","If it was family...":"Se fosse fam\u00edlia...","If it were like before, this fight would be like this":"Se fosse como antes essa luta seria assim","If it were like before, this fight would be like this;I don't even contain my body anymore;won't":"Se fosse como antes essa luta seria assim;Eu nem contenho mais meu corpo;n\u00e3o vou","If it were me, it would be a specification.":"Se fosse eu, seria uma especifica\u00e7\u00e3o.","If it weren't for her, I would have been dead already. No... both humans and neved may have disappeared.":"Se n\u00e3o fosse por ela, eu j\u00e1 estaria morto. N\u00e3o... tanto os humanos quanto os neved podem ter desaparecido.","If it weren't for this miraculous spark, we might all have frozen to death within a few years.":"Se n\u00e3o fosse por esta fa\u00edsca milagrosa, todos n\u00f3s ter\u00edamos morrido congelados dentro de alguns anos.","If it's a place they can't come to, if it's a place where just the two of us can live, that's fine!":"Se for um lugar onde eles n\u00e3o podem ir, se for um lugar onde s\u00f3 n\u00f3s dois podemos morar, tudo bem!","If it's a rumor going around among miners... you can get information from the eastern mine shaft{ in the middle of Coal Creek Island.":"Se for um boato circulando entre os mineiros... voc\u00ea pode obter informa\u00e7\u00f5es no po\u00e7o da mina leste, no meio da Ilha Coal Creek.{","If it's dangerous, come back without looking back. Because you can run away at the speed of light.":"Se for perigoso, volte sem olhar para tr\u00e1s. Porque voc\u00ea pode fugir na velocidade da luz.","If it's difficult, don't accept that request.":"Se for dif\u00edcil, n\u00e3o aceite esse pedido.","If it's that important, find it yourself.":"Se \u00e9 t\u00e3o importante, descubra voc\u00ea mesmo.","If it's the only way to know the truth... I'll do it.":"Se for a \u00fanica maneira de saber a verdade... eu farei isso.","If it's true, there's one thing I'd like to ask you.":"Se for verdade, h\u00e1 uma coisa que gostaria de lhe perguntar.","If it's uncomfortable... I'll change it... yo.":"Se for desconfort\u00e1vel... eu vou mudar... ei.","If it's urgent, check at the }store{. Because transporters can board transport ships...":"Se for urgente, consulte na }loja{. Porque os transportadores podem embarcar em navios de transporte...","If miners could act as a group, they would be able to demand things like better wages, better rest, and better working conditions.":"Se os mineiros pudessem agir em grupo, seriam capazes de exigir coisas como melhores sal\u00e1rios, melhor descanso e melhores condi\u00e7\u00f5es de trabalho.","If my life really depends on this succession... I might have to fight when I have to.":"Se minha vida realmente depende dessa sucess\u00e3o... talvez eu tenha que lutar quando for preciso.","If not... we need to gather more strength. More than Revan 4 years ago...":"Se n\u00e3o... precisamos reunir mais for\u00e7as. Mais que Revan h\u00e1 4 anos...","If nothing else happens, we can meet there.":"Se nada mais acontecer, podemos nos encontrar l\u00e1.","If only Cradd could control the Ark of the Advent forever.":"Se ao menos Cradd pudesse controlar a Arca do Advento para sempre.","If only I had believed in you earlier...":"Se eu tivesse acreditado em voc\u00ea antes...","If only I was 10 years younger...":"Se eu fosse 10 anos mais novo...","If only the war hadn't ended because of those damn fish...":"Se ao menos a guerra n\u00e3o tivesse terminado por causa daqueles malditos peixes...","If possible, I wanted to meet a nicer and kinder heir.":"Se poss\u00edvel, eu queria conhecer um herdeiro mais gentil e gentil.","If so, just go. Don't pay attention to us.":"Se sim, basta ir. N\u00e3o preste aten\u00e7\u00e3o em n\u00f3s.","If so, let me introduce it formally.":"Se sim, deixe-me apresent\u00e1-lo formalmente.","If so, please tell me first what you are asking for. Don't act like you're being generous.":"Em caso afirmativo, diga-me primeiro o que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 pedindo. N\u00e3o aja como se estivesse sendo generoso.","If so, that's it.":"Se sim, \u00e9 isso.","If so... that's fine. If I die while protecting this place until the end... I will at least be able to protect my family's honor.":"Se sim... tudo bem. Se eu morrer protegendo este lugar at\u00e9 o fim... pelo menos poderei proteger a honra da minha fam\u00edlia.","If that guy tries to fight first, it'll be a problem...":"Se aquele cara tentar lutar primeiro, ser\u00e1 um problema...","If that happens... Evelyn's remaining spirit cannot be completed. The role of successor is over.":"Se isso acontecer... o esp\u00edrito restante de Evelyn n\u00e3o poder\u00e1 ser completado. O papel de sucessor acabou.","If that time is given":"Se esse tempo for dado","If that's not enough for you, we'll give you some hints about hidden events for Ren.":"Se isso n\u00e3o for suficiente para voc\u00ea, daremos algumas dicas sobre eventos ocultos para Ren.","If the Council really wanted to develop the Republic, they should have developed Irem or Kingsport to the south.":"Se o Conselho realmente quisesse desenvolver a Rep\u00fablica, deveria ter desenvolvido Irem ou Kingsport ao sul.","If the Old Gods had been fully resurrected, wouldn't the war have ended the way it did?":"Se os Deuses Antigos tivessem sido totalmente ressuscitados, a guerra n\u00e3o teria terminado do jeito que terminou?","If the Ruins of the Advent don't go as planned, things will be difficult.":"Se as Ru\u00ednas do Advento n\u00e3o correrem como planejado, as coisas ficar\u00e3o dif\u00edceis.","If the ancient god's body, which is being reconstructed in the rift, is destroyed again...":"Se o corpo do Deus Antigo, que est\u00e1 sendo reconstru\u00eddo na Fenda, for destru\u00eddo novamente...","If the ancient species are the henchmen of the ancient gods... then it's not just nonsense to say that the war ended with God's blessing.":"Se as esp\u00e9cies antigas s\u00e3o os capangas dos deuses antigos... ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o \u00e9 um absurdo dizer que a guerra terminou com a b\u00ean\u00e7\u00e3o de Deus.","If the black army moves, there is no safe zone in Central. Taking a boat was a breeze.":"Se o ex\u00e9rcito negro se mover, n\u00e3o haver\u00e1 zona segura na Central. Pegar um barco foi muito f\u00e1cil.","If the end is truly upon us, we could fight together...":"Se o fim realmente estiver sobre n\u00f3s, poder\u00edamos lutar juntos...","If the number of people increases, I might not have enough workers on my own...":"Se o n\u00famero de pessoas aumentar, posso n\u00e3o ter trabalhadores suficientes sozinho...","If the relationship is deep... no race can stop the heart.":"Se o relacionamento for profundo... nenhuma corrida poder\u00e1 parar o cora\u00e7\u00e3o.","If the same situation comes again... then I will definitely protect that guy.":"Se a mesma situa\u00e7\u00e3o acontecer novamente... ent\u00e3o com certeza protegerei aquele cara.","If the spirit's power becomes stronger... I won't be able to deal with it either.":"Se o poder do esp\u00edrito ficar mais forte... tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o serei capaz de lidar com isso.","If the weapons are forged by our own hands, there's nothing scary about the weapons made in Central's factories!":"Se as armas s\u00e3o forjadas pelas nossas pr\u00f3prias m\u00e3os, n\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada de assustador nas armas fabricadas nas f\u00e1bricas da Central!","If there are 4 people left, that level of power.. is that the power of 1/4 of the complete body?":"Se sobrarem 4 pessoas, esse n\u00edvel de poder... \u00e9 o poder de 1/4 do corpo completo?","If there are kids who have nowhere to go, I'd like to take care of them, but I can't just walk around without them.":"Se h\u00e1 crian\u00e7as que n\u00e3o t\u00eam para onde ir, eu gostaria de cuidar delas, mas n\u00e3o posso simplesmente andar sem elas.","If there are old relics, it seems like we can investigate the ruins underneath the Hall of Origin.":"Se houver rel\u00edquias antigas, parece que podemos investigar as ru\u00ednas abaixo do Sal\u00e3o de Origem.","If there are really any survivors of the Rydmire family, the power of Coal Creek Island could also contribute to the revolution.":"Se realmente houver sobreviventes da fam\u00edlia Rydmire, o poder da Ilha Coal Creek tamb\u00e9m poder\u00e1 contribuir para a revolu\u00e7\u00e3o.","If there is a charge, you must pay it.)":"Se houver uma cobran\u00e7a, voc\u00ea dever\u00e1 pag\u00e1-la.)","If there is a charge, you must pay it.)3":"Se houver uma cobran\u00e7a, voc\u00ea dever\u00e1 pag\u00e1-la.)3","If there is a {critical sphere|":"Se houver uma {esfera cr\u00edtica|","If there is another purpose for this request, I can't think of anything other than that.":"Se houver outro prop\u00f3sito para este pedido, n\u00e3o consigo pensar em nada al\u00e9m disso.","If there is nothing to be afraid of in that cause...":"Se n\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada a temer nessa causa...","If there is something you want to see, watch it.. If there is something to learn, learn it. He's one year old now.":"Se h\u00e1 algo que voc\u00ea deseja ver, assista. Se h\u00e1 algo para aprender, aprenda. Ele tem um ano agora.","If they don't get caught, all responsibility will fall on Gerald Co. and the Mercenary Guild.":"Se eles n\u00e3o forem pegos, toda a responsabilidade recair\u00e1 sobre Gerald Co. e a Guilda dos Mercen\u00e1rios.","If they had requested support by phone, our position would have been advertised in the minds of everyone who would listen.":"Se tivessem solicitado apoio por telefone, nossa posi\u00e7\u00e3o teria sido divulgada na mente de todos que quisessem ouvir.","If they keep attacking, more regular troops will be called in.":"Se continuarem atacando, mais tropas regulares ser\u00e3o chamadas.","If they see us, they'll run away again...":"Se eles nos virem, eles fugir\u00e3o novamente...","If things go well, try something.":"Se tudo correr bem, tente algo.","If this happens, will I have no choice but to wait for someone to come out and ride?":"Se isso acontecer, n\u00e3o terei escolha a n\u00e3o ser esperar que algu\u00e9m saia e ande?","If this is also the power of the ancient gods, isn't it a power that should disappear?":"Se este tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 o poder dos deuses antigos, n\u00e3o \u00e9 um poder que deveria desaparecer?","If this was really the birthplace of the successor, Krad would have been there too. Because he is a technology provider.":"Se este fosse realmente o local de nascimento do sucessor, Krad tamb\u00e9m estaria l\u00e1. Porque ele \u00e9 um fornecedor de tecnologia.","If we can live quietly in a place without humans... that's it.":"Se pudermos viver tranquilamente num lugar sem humanos... \u00e9 isso.","If we can overcome it... you can overcome it too.":"Se conseguirmos super\u00e1-lo... voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m poder\u00e1 super\u00e1-lo.","If we destroy the body of the Old God that is rebuilding in the rift... wouldn't we be able to buy some time?":"Se destruirmos o corpo do Deus Antigo que est\u00e1 se reconstruindo na Fenda... n\u00e3o conseguir\u00edamos ganhar algum tempo?","If we don't defeat them all before we get surrounded...!!":"Se n\u00e3o derrotarmos todos eles antes de sermos cercados...!!","If we don't get swayed by the desire to gain more power... if we get along well with each other, everything will be okay. Isn't it?":"Se n\u00e3o nos deixarmos levar pelo desejo de ganhar mais poder... se nos dermos bem, tudo ficar\u00e1 bem. N\u00e3o \u00e9?","If we don't trust each other... we can't get through it.":"Se n\u00e3o confiarmos um no outro... n\u00e3o conseguiremos superar isso.","If we fight with those who listen... we will meet again soon.":"Se brigarmos com quem nos escuta... nos encontraremos novamente em breve.","If we form a union and act as a group, we can put pressure on the mining union.":"Se formarmos um sindicato e agirmos em grupo, poderemos pressionar o sindicato mineiro.","If we go back to the beginning, it is the history of the ancient gods, our Nebed, and the Advent.":"Se voltarmos ao in\u00edcio, \u00e9 a hist\u00f3ria dos deuses antigos, do nosso Nebed e do Advento.","If we had met before... if you were in the same group as those guys, I would have killed you already!":"Se tiv\u00e9ssemos nos conhecido antes... se voc\u00ea estivesse no mesmo grupo daqueles caras, eu j\u00e1 teria matado voc\u00ea!","If we humans want to live on a warm island, is war with the indigenous species the only answer?":"Se n\u00f3s, humanos, quisermos viver numa ilha quente, ser\u00e1 a guerra com as esp\u00e9cies ind\u00edgenas a \u00fanica resposta?","If we meet the quota they ask for, our family will starve to death in the winter.":"Se atingirmos a cota que eles pedem, nossa fam\u00edlia morrer\u00e1 de fome no inverno.","If we say we will go on strike as a group, the mining union will not be able to ignore us.":"Se dissermos que entraremos em greve como grupo, o sindicato mineiro n\u00e3o poder\u00e1 ignorar-nos.","If we take away his right to succession, the spirit's power will become stronger.":"Se retirarmos o seu direito \u00e0 sucess\u00e3o, o poder do esp\u00edrito ficar\u00e1 mais forte.","If we take down the Wade family and the listeners... we'll be fine as is.":"Se derrubarmos a fam\u00edlia Wade e os ouvintes... ficaremos bem como est\u00e3o.","If you are Tyr's friend, you are welcome. Do you need anything? Human currency is also fine.":"Se voc\u00ea \u00e9 amigo de Tyr, seja bem-vindo. Voc\u00ea precisa de alguma coisa? A moeda humana tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 bem.","If you are a descendant, here":"Se voc\u00ea \u00e9 descendente, aqui","If you are asked to clean an underpass, assume that your combat ability is not high...":"Se lhe pedirem para limpar uma passagem subterr\u00e2nea, presuma que sua capacidade de combate n\u00e3o \u00e9 alta...","If you are destructive":"Se voc\u00ea \u00e9 destrutivo","If you are not a member of the denomination, you cannot enter the Doctrine Pavilion.":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o for membro da denomina\u00e7\u00e3o, n\u00e3o poder\u00e1 entrar no Pavilh\u00e3o de Doutrina.","If you are not the Adventist, then why do you appear in the Adventist Ruins? The ark must be the Adventist Ruins.":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o \u00e9 Adventista, ent\u00e3o por que aparece nas Ru\u00ednas Adventistas? A arca deve ser as Ru\u00ednas Adventistas.","If you are truly a human god..!!":"Se voc\u00ea \u00e9 realmente um deus humano..!!","If you are uncooperative like that, there will only be unnecessary conflicts. We need a more cooperative successor.":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o cooperar assim, s\u00f3 haver\u00e1 conflitos desnecess\u00e1rios. Precisamos de um sucessor mais cooperativo.","If you can still feel it, you'll be safe. The problem is... I've seen traces of it.":"Se voc\u00ea ainda consegue sentir isso, voc\u00ea estar\u00e1 seguro. O problema \u00e9... que vi vest\u00edgios disso.","If you can't do it, I will kill all the successors and complete the spirit.":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o conseguir, matarei todos os sucessores e completarei o esp\u00edrito.","If you can't see it in the village":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o consegue ver isso na aldeia","If you catch a worm and bring back its head, the Mining Guild will give you a reward.":"Se voc\u00ea pegar um verme e trazer sua cabe\u00e7a de volta, a Guilda de Minera\u00e7\u00e3o lhe dar\u00e1 uma recompensa.","If you change your mobile phone number, you may not be able to play the game due to a copy protection authentication error.":"Se voc\u00ea alterar o n\u00famero do seu celular, talvez n\u00e3o consiga jogar devido a um erro de autentica\u00e7\u00e3o de prote\u00e7\u00e3o contra c\u00f3pia.","If you choose Tiana, complete the hidden quests }Silver Earring{ and }Nightmare{.":"Se voc\u00ea escolher Tiana, complete as miss\u00f5es ocultas }Brinco de Prata{ e }Pesadelo{.","If you chose Evelyn, complete the hidden quests }Blind Faith{ and }On Guard{.":"Se voc\u00ea escolheu Evelyn, complete as miss\u00f5es ocultas }Blind Faith{ e }On Guard{.","If you collect materials, you can make items.":"Se voc\u00ea coletar materiais, poder\u00e1 criar itens.","If you collect the ingredients, you can make the item, but it's not ready yet.":"Se voc\u00ea coletar os ingredientes, poder\u00e1 fazer o item, mas ele ainda n\u00e3o estar\u00e1 pronto.","If you come to the Pavilion of Doctrine and stay with us for just one week, you will be waiting for the coming of the Advent.":"Se voc\u00ea vier ao Pavilh\u00e3o da Doutrina e ficar conosco apenas uma semana, estar\u00e1 aguardando a chegada do Advento.","If you disassemble a `Heroic{, ^Legendary{, or <Set{> grade item, you can rarely obtain <Orbs{.":"Se voc\u00ea desmontar um item de classifica\u00e7\u00e3o `Heroic{, ^Legendary{ ou <Set{>, raramente poder\u00e1 obter <Orbs{.","If you disassemble an item, it will be <saved> and cannot be returned, so be careful.":"Se voc\u00ea desmontar um item, ele ser\u00e1 <salvo> e n\u00e3o poder\u00e1 ser devolvido, ent\u00e3o tome cuidado.","If you don":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o","If you don't always maintain equipment that matches your level, you won't be able to face increasingly stronger enemies.":"Se voc\u00ea nem sempre mantiver equipamentos adequados ao seu n\u00edvel, n\u00e3o conseguir\u00e1 enfrentar inimigos cada vez mais fortes.","If you don't believe me, then...":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o acredita em mim, ent\u00e3o...","If you don't call, there's no point in coming here.":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o ligar, n\u00e3o adianta vir aqui.","If you don't do your duty,":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o cumprir seu dever,","If you don't focus, you won't miss it, right?":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tiver foco, n\u00e3o vai perder, n\u00e9?","If you don't go back... I have no choice but to stop you by force.":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o voltar... n\u00e3o tenho escolha a n\u00e3o ser det\u00ea-lo \u00e0 for\u00e7a.","If you don't have a place to settle down, consider officially becoming a guild member.":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tem um lugar para se estabelecer, considere se tornar oficialmente um membro da guilda.","If you don't have anywhere else to go later, Schurz comes here too.":"Se n\u00e3o tiver para onde ir depois, o Schurz vem aqui tamb\u00e9m.","If you don't have the money to buy equipment or the equipment you want isn't available, combining them is a good idea.":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tem dinheiro para comprar o equipamento ou o equipamento que deseja n\u00e3o est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel, combin\u00e1-los \u00e9 uma boa ideia.","If you don't hurry you'll miss it!":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o se apressar, voc\u00ea vai perder!","If you don't know anything, nothing will change even if you live as is.":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o sabe de nada, nada mudar\u00e1, mesmo que voc\u00ea viva como est\u00e1.","If you don't overcome it... everything will end up...":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o superar... tudo vai acabar...","If you don't want to die, don't come near us again. Because we won't be used by anyone...":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o quer morrer, n\u00e3o se aproxime de n\u00f3s novamente. Porque n\u00e3o seremos usados por ningu\u00e9m...","If you don't want to lose it...":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o quer perd\u00ea-lo...","If you donate a lot, you can gain fame.":"Se voc\u00ea doar muito, poder\u00e1 ganhar fama.","If you don\u2019t hurry up\u2026 even the Wade family won\u2019t be able to control the listeners.":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o se apressar... nem mesmo a fam\