on them. It's proof that it's genuine.":"Se voc\u00ea conseguir uma arma especial, fique de olho nela. As armas ali fabricadas sempre trazem as iniciais L gravadas. \u00c9 a prova de que \u00e9 genu\u00edno.","If you get crushed to death like this, it's a dog's death. Let's hurry!":"Se voc\u00ea for esmagado at\u00e9 a morte assim, ser\u00e1 a morte de um cachorro. Vamos nos apressar!","If you get good results, please share them.":"Se voc\u00ea obtiver bons resultados, compartilhe-os.","If you get some answers from the shrine, join us at Kingsport and meet Kaz together.":"Se voc\u00ea obtiver algumas respostas do santu\u00e1rio, junte-se a n\u00f3s em Kingsport e encontre Kaz juntos.","If you give, you will receive, but...":"Se voc\u00ea der, voc\u00ea receber\u00e1, mas...","If you go around like that":"Se voc\u00ea andar por a\u00ed assim","If you go around like that and the owner sees you, you'll be accused of being a thief.":"Se voc\u00ea andar assim e o dono te ver, voc\u00ea ser\u00e1 acusado de ladr\u00e3o.","If you go further north from here, you will only reach the frozen sea.":"Se voc\u00ea for mais ao norte daqui, s\u00f3 alcan\u00e7ar\u00e1 o mar congelado.","If you go to the Pavilion of Origins":"Se voc\u00ea for ao Pavilh\u00e3o das Origens","If you go to the guild today, there will probably be a request from Gerald's Company. You just have to take it.":"Se voc\u00ea for \u00e0 guilda hoje, provavelmente haver\u00e1 um pedido da Companhia de Gerald. Voc\u00ea apenas tem que aceitar.","If you hadn't caught that white bear at that time, he would have become even more ferocious, right?":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tivesse pegado aquele urso branco naquela hora, ele teria ficado ainda mais feroz, certo?","If you hadn't helped me... what would have happened to everyone by now.":"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tivesse me ajudado... o que teria acontecido com todo mundo agora.","If you have a bad personality, you have to at least have good abilities.":"Se voc\u00ea tem uma personalidade ruim, precisa pelo menos ter boas habilidades.","If you have an idea, shouldn't you first build a large dock and start construction? What kind of useless labor is this?":"Se voc\u00ea tem uma ideia, n\u00e3o deveria primeiro construir um grande cais e come\u00e7ar a constru\u00e7\u00e3o? Que tipo de trabalho in\u00fatil \u00e9 esse?","If you hit a critical hit":"Se voc\u00ea acertar um acerto cr\u00edtico","If you hunt the }Snow Woman{, you can obtain the }Soul Stone{ that will neutralize the seal, but... it won't be easy to find since the population is small.":"Se voc\u00ea ca\u00e7ar a }Mulher da Neve{, poder\u00e1 obter a }Pedra da Alma{ que neutralizar\u00e1 o selo, mas... n\u00e3o ser\u00e1 f\u00e1cil encontr\u00e1-la, pois a popula\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 pequena.","If you insist on going in here, I can't help but stop you.":"Se voc\u00ea insiste em entrar aqui, n\u00e3o posso deixar de impedi-lo.","If you just deal with Rufus, who doesn't know what he's going to do... nothing will happen.":"Se voc\u00ea apenas lidar com o Rufus, que n\u00e3o sabe o que vai fazer... nada vai acontecer.","If you keep pushing back and letting strange people in, you will die.":"Se voc\u00ea continuar reagindo e deixando pessoas estranhas entrarem, voc\u00ea morrer\u00e1.","If you know in advance, the risk is reduced by half. That's only if your feelings are accurate.":"Se voc\u00ea souber com anteced\u00eancia, o risco \u00e9 reduzido pela metade. Isso s\u00f3 se seus sentimentos forem precisos.","If you know someone who can help, could you please send them here?":"Se voc\u00ea conhece algu\u00e9m que possa ajudar, poderia envi\u00e1-lo aqui?","If you look around":"Se voc\u00ea olhar ao redor","If you look at that bag, there should be dried meat.":"Se voc\u00ea olhar para aquele saco, deve haver carne seca.","If you look at that point alone, it wouldn't be unreasonable to call him God.":"Se voc\u00ea olhar apenas para esse ponto, n\u00e3o seria irracional cham\u00e1-lo de Deus.","If you look at the documents that Advent left us, it is said that Topaz is a medium that can control great power.":"Se voc\u00ea olhar os documentos que o Advento nos deixou, diz-se que o Top\u00e1zio \u00e9 um meio que pode controlar um grande poder.","If you lure Rufus":"Se voc\u00ea atrair Rufus","If you mention that name":"Se voc\u00ea mencionar esse nome","If you met Graham before entering the Ark, wait for Tyr to come.":"Se voc\u00ea conheceu Graham antes de entrar na Arca, espere a chegada de Tyr.","If you need work, look elsewhere.":"Se precisar de trabalho, procure outro lugar.","If you proceed with the transfer,":"Se voc\u00ea prosseguir com a transfer\u00eancia,","If you proceed with the transfer,;All information is stored on the server;The game will be reset.;Would you like to proceed with the transfer?":"Se voc\u00ea prosseguir com a transfer\u00eancia,;Todas as informa\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o armazenadas no servidor;O jogo ser\u00e1 reiniciado.;Gostaria de prosseguir com a transfer\u00eancia?","If you proceed with the transfer,;All information is stored on the server;The game will be reset.;Would you like to proceed with the transfer?R":"Se voc\u00ea prosseguir com a transfer\u00eancia,;Todas as informa\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o armazenadas no servidor;O jogo ser\u00e1 reiniciado.;Deseja prosseguir com a transfer\u00eancia?R","If you put them in direct contact with it... the Nightmare Master will probably react in some way. I can hear that voice.":"Se voc\u00ea coloc\u00e1-los em contato direto com ele... o Mestre do Pesadelo provavelmente reagir\u00e1 de alguma forma. Eu posso ouvir essa voz.","If you really are hiding some power from me...":"Se voc\u00ea realmente est\u00e1 escondendo algum poder de mim...","If you really have to ask, is it instinct?":"Se voc\u00ea realmente precisa perguntar, \u00e9 instinto?","If you really have to... there's nothing you can do about it.":"Se voc\u00ea realmente precisar... n\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada que voc\u00ea possa fazer a respeito.","If you really intend to protect this place... why don't you use all your strength?":"Se voc\u00ea realmente pretende proteger este lugar... por que n\u00e3o usa toda a sua for\u00e7a?","If you really want to fight, you can make it happen.":"Se voc\u00ea realmente quer lutar, voc\u00ea pode fazer isso acontecer.","If you repeatedly hit the same orb, a synergy occurs and performance increases.":"Se voc\u00ea acertar repetidamente o mesmo orbe, ocorre uma sinergia e o desempenho aumenta.","If you see it, please report it to the guard immediately.":"Se voc\u00ea vir isso, por favor, informe o guarda imediatamente.","If you somehow steal it":"Se voc\u00ea de alguma forma roubar","If you start a battle with Rurain, you cannot save.":"Se voc\u00ea iniciar uma batalha com Rurain, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o poder\u00e1 salvar.","If you succeed, your attack power or defense power goes up by 1... and if you're lucky and hit a >big success{, it goes up by 2.":"Se voc\u00ea tiver sucesso, seu poder de ataque ou poder de defesa aumenta em 1... e se voc\u00ea tiver sorte e obtiver um >grande sucesso{, ele aumenta em 2.","If you think about it, isn't it Schurz's fault that I became unemployed?":"Se voc\u00ea pensar bem, n\u00e3o \u00e9 culpa do Schurz que eu fiquei desempregado?","If you think about it, something was strange from the moment Kefnes was elected.":"Se voc\u00ea pensar bem, algo ficou estranho desde o momento em que Kefnes foi eleito.","If you touch a lot of money from a young age, it's usually easy to go crazy...":"Se voc\u00ea toca muito dinheiro desde tenra idade, geralmente \u00e9 f\u00e1cil enlouquecer...","If you truly want to fight against the Wade family, you will have to respect Neved.":"Se voc\u00ea realmente quer lutar contra a fam\u00edlia Wade, ter\u00e1 que respeitar Neved.","If you use the Relics of the Advent... it will be possible to stop Rufus.":"Se voc\u00ea usar as Rel\u00edquias do Advento... ser\u00e1 poss\u00edvel deter Rufus.","If you walk around and see kids who have nowhere to go or people who are interested in this, send them here.":"Se voc\u00ea anda por a\u00ed e v\u00ea crian\u00e7as que n\u00e3o t\u00eam para onde ir ou pessoas interessadas nisso, mande-as aqui.","If you wander around and miss a request, Kaz will try to kill you.":"Se voc\u00ea vagar por a\u00ed e perder um pedido, Kaz tentar\u00e1 mat\u00e1-lo.","If you want to buy something, go to Meadow Hill and tell me. Sorry, but it's not free for everyone.":"Se voc\u00ea quiser comprar alguma coisa, v\u00e1 at\u00e9 Meadow Hill e me diga. Desculpe, mas n\u00e3o \u00e9 gratuito para todos.","If you want to help attack the transport ship, go to the dock south of Moitura Plains.":"Se voc\u00ea quiser ajudar no ataque ao navio de transporte, v\u00e1 at\u00e9 o cais ao sul da Plan\u00edcie de Moitura.","If you want to help, come to the dock south of Moitura.":"Se quiser ajudar, venha at\u00e9 o cais ao sul de Moitura.","If you want to live properly, you have to think about what you can change with your own hands. Why are you waiting?":"Se voc\u00ea quer viver bem, precisa pensar no que pode mudar com suas pr\u00f3prias m\u00e3os. Por que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 esperando?","If you want to make a proper twilight soup restaurant, the ingredients you buy aren't enough.":"Se voc\u00ea quiser fazer um restaurante de sopa crepuscular adequado, os ingredientes que voc\u00ea compra n\u00e3o s\u00e3o suficientes.","If you want to make money":"Se voc\u00ea quer ganhar dinheiro","If you want to make money, it would be better to just stay on the street and catch the fugitive.":"Se voc\u00ea quer ganhar dinheiro, \u00e9 melhor ficar na rua e pegar o fugitivo.","If you want to make money;I'd rather just stay on that road;Better catch the fugitive.":"Se voc\u00ea quer ganhar dinheiro;Eu prefiro ficar nessa estrada;Melhor pegar o fugitivo.","If you want to meet Kaz anyway,":"Se voc\u00ea quiser conhecer Kaz de qualquer maneira,","If you want to meet him, go to the cave to the north of the Moytura Plain. They say they go out to that area often these days...":"Se quiser conhec\u00ea-lo, v\u00e1 at\u00e9 a caverna ao norte da Plan\u00edcie de Moytura. Dizem que hoje em dia v\u00e3o frequentemente para aquela \u00e1rea...","If you wanted to live in hiding like this, that's fine. Sorry to bother you.":"Se voc\u00ea quisesse viver escondido assim, tudo bem. Desculpe incomod\u00e1-lo.","If you were alive, wouldn't you have shown your face a long time ago?":"Se voc\u00ea estivesse vivo, n\u00e3o teria mostrado seu rosto h\u00e1 muito tempo?","If you're a guy with the intention to live hard, you won't pass over. Those who want to deny the life they are currently living should just move on.":"Se voc\u00ea \u00e9 um cara com a inten\u00e7\u00e3o de viver muito, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o vai passar despercebido. Aqueles que querem negar a vida que vivem atualmente deveriam simplesmente seguir em frente.","If you're alive, with us...":"Se voc\u00ea est\u00e1 vivo, conosco...","If you're going to do a deal, present the right conditions.":"Se for fazer um neg\u00f3cio, apresente as condi\u00e7\u00f5es adequadas.","If you're going to fight, I'll hide.":"Se voc\u00ea for lutar, eu me esconderei.","If you're here to look for a job, it's just a temporary job and there's nothing for a mercenary to do.":"Se voc\u00ea est\u00e1 aqui em busca de emprego, \u00e9 apenas um trabalho tempor\u00e1rio e n\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada para um mercen\u00e1rio fazer.","If you're looking for a wanted person, then I'm right. But my name is not Brianne, it is Tyr.":"Se voc\u00ea est\u00e1 procurando uma pessoa procurada, estou certo. Mas meu nome n\u00e3o \u00e9 Brianne, \u00e9 Tyr.","If you're next to me... I'll let you sleep forever...":"Se voc\u00ea estiver perto de mim... vou deixar voc\u00ea dormir para sempre...","If }Ancient God{ had been resurrected back then, surely no one would be alive now..":"Se o }Deus Antigo{ tivesse ressuscitado naquela \u00e9