as, voc\u00eas podem pisar sem \u00e2nimo..!!","It's all a trick. First-class manufacturers usually make things on the spot.":"\u00c9 tudo um truque. Os fabricantes de primeira classe geralmente fazem as coisas na hora.","It's all about your karma. Now that humanity has gained God, there is no longer any need for the petty ruling system between humans.":"\u00c9 tudo uma quest\u00e3o de seu carma. Agora que a humanidade ganhou Deus, n\u00e3o h\u00e1 mais necessidade de um sistema mesquinho de governo entre os humanos.","It's all just speculation anyway.":"De qualquer forma, \u00e9 tudo apenas especula\u00e7\u00e3o.","It's all natural!":"\u00c9 tudo natural!","It's all over. God is complete.":"Est\u00e1 tudo acabado. Deus est\u00e1 completo.","It's already been 5 years... I miss the times when we were at war with them...":"J\u00e1 se passaram 5 anos... tenho saudades dos tempos em que est\u00e1vamos em guerra com eles...","It's already been a year, is that all you can say?":"J\u00e1 faz um ano, \u00e9 tudo que voc\u00ea pode dizer?","It's already too late. The reaction is interesting.":"J\u00e1 \u00e9 tarde demais. A rea\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 interessante.","It's amazing that a wound of that magnitude healed in just one day...":"\u00c9 incr\u00edvel que uma ferida dessa magnitude tenha cicatrizado em apenas um dia...","It's amazing... Are these techniques that the listeners received from the ancient gods?":"\u00c9 incr\u00edvel... S\u00e3o essas t\u00e9cnicas que os ouvintes receberam dos deuses antigos?","It's amazing... Schurz completely stopped you, right? It's amazing, Theodore and Evelyn...":"\u00c9 incr\u00edvel... Schurz te impediu completamente, certo? \u00c9 incr\u00edvel, Theodore e Evelyn...","It's aminopena.":"\u00c9 aminopena.","It's an abyss inside me anyway. I can open it.":"De qualquer forma, \u00e9 um abismo dentro de mim. Eu posso abri-lo.","It's an ancient god or it's magic. As I listen to it every day, my useless imagination only grows.":"\u00c9 um deus antigo ou \u00e9 magia. \u00c0 medida que ou\u00e7o isso todos os dias, minha imagina\u00e7\u00e3o in\u00fatil s\u00f3 aumenta.","It's an old abandoned underground passage, but there are only a few goblins.":"\u00c9 uma antiga passagem subterr\u00e2nea abandonada, mas existem apenas alguns goblins.","It's an old man dozing happily. It's best not to touch it.){":"\u00c9 um velho cochilando feliz. \u00c9 melhor n\u00e3o toc\u00e1-lo.){","It's annoying":"\u00c9 irritante","It's annoying because my spirit always tells me to just give up if I'm not going to fight.":"\u00c9 chato porque meu esp\u00edrito sempre me diz para desistir se n\u00e3o vou lutar.","It's annoying just listening to it.":"\u00c9 irritante s\u00f3 de ouvir isso.","It's annoying that the world is unfair, but even God is unfair... damn it.":"\u00c9 chato que o mundo seja injusto, mas at\u00e9 Deus \u00e9 injusto... droga.","It's annoying, but the frozen sea":"\u00c9 chato, mas o mar congelado","It's appropriate. It's just enough to make the cold go away.":"\u00c9 apropriado. \u00c9 apenas o suficiente para fazer o frio passar.","It's as you guessed. The spirits are based on the cells of the ancient gods.":"\u00c9 como voc\u00ea adivinhou. Os esp\u00edritos s\u00e3o baseados nas c\u00e9lulas dos deuses antigos.","It's basic to periodically check to see if there are any new skills to learn.":"\u00c9 b\u00e1sico verificar periodicamente se h\u00e1 alguma nova habilidade para aprender.","It's because of people like you who show unlucky interest. Since you're young, you know that you can just scam people and take advantage of them, right?":"\u00c9 por causa de pessoas como voc\u00ea que demonstram um interesse infeliz. Desde jovem voc\u00ea sabe que pode simplesmente enganar as pessoas e tirar vantagem delas, certo?","It's been a long goodbye.":"Foi um longo adeus.","It's been a while since I gave my all, so it might hurt a little.":"J\u00e1 faz um tempo que n\u00e3o dei tudo de mim, ent\u00e3o pode doer um pouco.","It's been a while since I heard that name...":"J\u00e1 faz um tempo que n\u00e3o ou\u00e7o esse nome...","It's been a while since I've been camping, so I'd like to give it a try.":"J\u00e1 faz um tempo que n\u00e3o acampo, ent\u00e3o gostaria de tentar.","It's been a while since I've seen humans other than Tyr... I'm receiving help in many ways from Tyr and his gang.":"J\u00e1 faz um tempo que n\u00e3o vejo outros humanos al\u00e9m de Tyr... Estou recebendo ajuda de v\u00e1rias maneiras de Tyr e sua gangue.","It's been a while. Rufus... After becoming the successor, he became quite arrogant.":"J\u00e1 faz um tempo. Rufus... Depois de se tornar o sucessor, ele se tornou bastante arrogante.","It's been a while... I think it's on a large scale!":"J\u00e1 faz um tempo... acho que \u00e9 em grande escala!","It's better for relics of the old world to sleep in the sea.":"\u00c9 melhor que as rel\u00edquias do velho mundo durmam no mar.","It's better not to have unnecessary expectations.":"\u00c9 melhor n\u00e3o ter expectativas desnecess\u00e1rias.","It's better than going out injured.":"\u00c9 melhor do que sair lesionado.","It's better to avoid the black robes...":"\u00c9 melhor evitar as vestes pretas...","It's blocked as a danger zone, but there's nothing wrong with it.":"Est\u00e1 bloqueado como zona de perigo, mas n\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada de errado com isso.","It's blocked here too... but we force our way through!){":"Aqui tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 bloqueado... mas for\u00e7amos a passagem!){","It's called memory manipulation...":"Isso se chama manipula\u00e7\u00e3o de mem\u00f3ria...","It's called }Graham{. I was waiting for you according to Captain Tyr's orders.":"Chama-se }Graham{. Eu estava esperando por voc\u00ea de acordo com as ordens do Capit\u00e3o Tyr.","It's coming, avoid it!":"Est\u00e1 chegando, evite!","It's complicated...":"\u00c9 complicado...","It's cute. It was when I was young. Are those standing behind you your parents?":"\u00c9 fofo. Foi quando eu era jovem. Aqueles que est\u00e3o atr\u00e1s de voc\u00ea s\u00e3o seus pais?","It's dangerous but somehow":"\u00c9 perigoso, mas de alguma forma","It's dangerous, that is. There's a rumor that a dangerous monster appears.":"\u00c9 perigoso, isso \u00e9. H\u00e1 um boato de que um monstro perigoso aparece.","It's definitely... strange.":"\u00c9 definitivamente... estranho.","It's delicious.":"\u00c9 delicioso.","It's east... east. I feel it...":"\u00c9 leste... leste. Eu sinto isso...","It's easy if you just listen to it. And the guys who actually carried out the request inside the tower say it was easy.":"\u00c9 f\u00e1cil se voc\u00ea apenas ouvir. E os caras que realmente atenderam o pedido dentro da torre dizem que foi f\u00e1cil.","It's easy to throw away the spirits. All you have to do is reach an agreement with the spirits. If the successor truly gives up what he or she has gained, he or she can be liberated from the spirit.":"\u00c9 f\u00e1cil jogar fora os esp\u00edritos. Tudo o que voc\u00ea precisa fazer \u00e9 chegar a um acordo com os esp\u00edritos. Se o sucessor realmente desistir do que conquistou, ele poder\u00e1 ser libertado do esp\u00edrito.","It's enough now... if Tiana got one more chance... because of me...":"J\u00e1 \u00e9 o suficiente... se Tiana tivesse mais uma chance... por minha causa...","It's fascinating. I don't even know this person, but I feel friendly and likable because of some memories I don't know about.":"\u00c9 fascinante. Nem conhe\u00e7o essa pessoa, mas me sinto simp\u00e1tica e simp\u00e1tica por causa de algumas lembran\u00e7as que desconhe\u00e7o.","It's for the safety of the village... I have to do it.":"\u00c9 para a seguran\u00e7a da aldeia... eu tenho que fazer isso.","It's fortunate that no one has been seriously hurt or sick so far...":"\u00c9 uma sorte que ningu\u00e9m tenha ficado gravemente ferido ou doente at\u00e9 agora...","It's funny that on the day Meadow Hill burned at the hands of the ancient servants, we helped our unit be the last to withdraw.":"\u00c9 engra\u00e7ado que no dia em que Meadow Hill queimou nas m\u00e3os dos antigos servos, ajudamos nossa unidade a ser a \u00faltima a se retirar.","It's funny, they just called something like this a god...":"\u00c9 engra\u00e7ado, eles simplesmente chamaram algo assim de deus...","It's gone far away... I don't think it's anywhere near me anymore.":"Foi para longe... Acho que n\u00e3o est\u00e1 mais perto de mim.","It's good to be confident in your own thoughts, but you need to trust others more.":"\u00c9 bom ter confian\u00e7a em seus pr\u00f3prios pensamentos, mas voc\u00ea precisa confiar mais nos outros.","It's good to work hard, but also say hello to your neighbors.":"\u00c9 bom trabalhar duro, mas tamb\u00e9m cumprimentar os vizinhos.","It's hard to get people back together... and I didn't really want to start a mercenary guild in the first place.":"\u00c9 dif\u00edcil reunir as pessoas novamente... e eu realmente n\u00e3o queria come\u00e7ar uma guilda de mercen\u00e1rios em primeiro lugar.","It's hard to make a living off the land. I have to get my kids to succeed at all costs...":"\u00c9 dif\u00edcil ganhar a vida com a terra. Tenho que fazer com que meus filhos tenham sucesso a todo custo...","It's hard to see a proper invitation. Anyway, let's check the face.":"\u00c9 dif\u00edcil ver um convite adequado. De qualquer forma, vamos verificar o rosto.","It's hell outside anyway!":"De qualquer maneira, \u00e9 um inferno l\u00e1 fora!","It's here.":"Est\u00e1 aqui.","It's hiding":"Est\u00e1 se escondendo","It's important research, for you and me. Don't say such sad things.":"\u00c9 uma pesquisa importante, para voc\u00ea e para mim. N\u00e3o diga coisas t\u00e3o tristes.","It's impossible!":"\u00c9 imposs\u00edvel!","It's impossible. I'm going to die.":"\u00c9 imposs\u00edvel. Eu vou morrer.","It's in Irem.":"Est\u00e1 em Irem.","It's in front...!":"Est\u00e1 na frente...!","It's in the southeast.":"Est\u00e1 no sudeste.","It's inside... I can feel the successor{ inside there.":"Est\u00e1 dentro... Posso sentir o sucessor l\u00e1 dentro.{","It's inside... but I can't die... in front of that child...":"Est\u00e1 dentro... mas n\u00e3o posso morrer... na frente daquela crian\u00e7a...","It's just a feeling. I got injured, and more than anything, I feel comfortable working.":"\u00c9 apenas um sentimento. Me machuquei e, mais do que tudo, me sinto confort\u00e1vel trabalhando.","It's just a feeling... but be careful.":"\u00c9 apenas uma sensa\u00e7\u00e3o... mas tome cuidado.","It's just a personal thing. Let's finish it soon.":"\u00c9 apenas uma coisa pessoal. Vamos terminar logo.","It's just a piece of discarded flesh from an ancient god.":"\u00c9 apenas um peda\u00e7o de carne descartado de um deus antigo.","It's just a random bounty...":"\u00c9 apenas uma recompensa aleat\u00f3ria...","It's just a tranquilizer. First, I think I should go to a safe place and get plenty of rest.":"\u00c9 apenas um tranquilizante. Primeiro, acho que deveria ir para um lugar seguro e descansar bastante.","It's just a walk...":"\u00c9 s\u00f3 uma caminhada...","It's just an accessory to a weapon...":"\u00c9 apenas um acess\u00f3rio de uma arma...","It's just an illusion created...":"\u00c9 apenas uma ilus\u00e3o criada...","It's just as I heard. Leave this guy to me... and get out of the island.":"\u00c9 exatamente como ouvi. Deixe esse cara comigo... e saia da ilha.","It's just one of the many underpasses connected to Central Tower{. Looking at the height and structure, it certainly wasn't a route that could be infiltrated.":"\u00c9 apenas uma das muitas passagens subterr\u00e2neas ligadas \u00e0 Torre Central{. Olhando pela altura e estrutura, certamente n\u00e3o era uma rota que pudesse ser infiltrada.","It's just scary. In the first place... did you even care about our happiness?":"\u00c9 simplesmente assustador. Em primeiro lugar... voc\u00ea se importou com a nossa felicidade?","It's just something that appears in Seonjujong's records. <Creatures that look similar to us appeared across the frozen sea{":"\u00c9 apenas algo que aparece nos registros de Seonjujong. <Criaturas semelhantes a n\u00f3s apareceram no mar congelado{","It's just that the shadow of the Descending One, similar to the one you met on the Ark, is trying to invade this world.":"Acontece que a sombra do Descendente, semelhante \u00e0quela que voc\u00ea conheceu na Arca, est\u00e1 tentando invadir este mundo.","It's just useless truth.":"\u00c9 apenas uma verdade in\u00fatil.","It's kind of gloomy... Where have the other people gone?":"\u00c9 meio sombrio... Para onde foram as outras pessoas?","It's late at night so let's rest today":"J\u00e1 \u00e9 tarde da noite, ent\u00e3o vamos descansar hoje","It's locked and I can't get in.":"Est\u00e1 trancado e n\u00e3o consigo entrar.","It's locked.":"Est\u00e1 trancado.","It's locked. The door is too thick to break down.":"Est\u00e1 trancado. A porta \u00e9 muito grossa para quebrar.","It's locked... this is the way out.":"Est\u00e1 trancado... esta \u00e9 a sa\u00edda.","It's mine... I'll never throw it away. I won't let someone like Altena take it!":"\u00c9 meu... nunca vou jogar fora. N\u00e3o vou deixar algu\u00e9m como Altena pegar isso!","It's more rewarding to give people useful information than to work in Congress.":"\u00c9 mais gratificante dar informa\u00e7\u00f5es \u00fateis \u00e0s pessoas do que trabalhar no Congresso.","It's my fault. Did saving the relics of Advent lead to the breaking of the seal on the Ark?":"A culpa \u00e9 minha. Salvar as rel\u00edquias do Advento levou \u00e0 quebra do selo da Arca?","It's my first time on a boat... I guess I don't get seasick or anything.":"\u00c9 minha primeira vez em um barco... Acho que n\u00e3o fico enjoado nem nada.","It's my mood. don't mind.":"\u00c9 o meu humor. n\u00e3o se importe.","It's natural that you don't believe me based on words alone, but please come with me now.":"\u00c9 natural que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o acredite em mim apenas com base em palavras, mas por favor, venha comigo agora.","It's natural to be curious.":"\u00c9 natural ficar curioso.","It's nice to see the child having fun.":"\u00c9 bom ver a crian\u00e7a se divertindo.","It's no fun here. Dad and Mom just sigh every day...":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 divertido aqui. Papai e mam\u00e3e apenas suspiram todos os dias...","It's no use. I come back again and again...":"N\u00e3o adianta. Eu volto de novo e de novo...","It's noisy.":"\u00c9 barulhento.","It's noisy. Don't worry, there's a way out in your head.":"Est\u00e1 com ru\u00eddos. N\u00e3o se preocupe, h\u00e1 uma sa\u00edda na sua cabe\u00e7a.","It's none of my business.":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 da minha conta.","It's none of your business...":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 da sua conta...","It's northeast of Rockville.":"Fica a nordeste de Rockville.","It's not Kepnes, it's a being grown from Ellen's cells. That kid...":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 Kepnes, \u00e9 um ser cultivado a partir das c\u00e9lulas de Ellen. Aquele garoto...","It's not a dream or anything in vain.":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 um sonho nem nada em v\u00e3o.","It's not a fight you know you have to fight..":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 uma luta que voc\u00ea sabe que tem que lutar.","It's not a reason not to die...":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 uma raz\u00e3o para n\u00e3o morrer...","It's not a very pleasant visit.":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 uma visita muito agrad\u00e1vel.","It's not deep, it's an endless abyss... but how...":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 profundo, \u00e9 um abismo sem fim... mas como...","It's not difficult, right? What are you reluctant about? Mercenaries have to work for money.":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 dif\u00edcil, certo? Sobre o que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 relutante? Os mercen\u00e1rios t\u00eam que trabalhar por dinheiro.","It's not even mine... I think I did something a little weird.":"Nem \u00e9 meu... Acho que fiz uma coisa meio estranha.","It's not fun. Isn":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 divertido. N\u00e3o \u00e9","It's not fun. Isn\u2019t it normal for men to be surprised when they hear something like this?":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 divertido. N\u00e3o \u00e9 normal que os homens se surpreendam ao ouvir algo assim?","It's not in vain!":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 em v\u00e3o!","It's not like please save me, it's like, please come save me...){":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 como, por favor, me salve, \u00e9 como, por favor, venha me salvar...){","It's not like they're trying to sell it somewhere else for a high price...":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 como se eles estivessem tentando vend\u00ea-lo em outro lugar por um pre\u00e7o alto...","It's not mine. Don't worry about other people's business like that.":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 meu. N\u00e3o se preocupe com os neg\u00f3cios de outras pessoas assim.","It's not mine. You can throw it away.":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 meu. Voc\u00ea pode jog\u00e1-lo fora.","It's not mine. You can throw it away. Above all... I'm not sure that they can stop me if I go now.":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 meu. Voc\u00ea pode jog\u00e1-lo fora. Acima de tudo... n\u00e3o tenho certeza se eles poder\u00e3o me impedir se eu for agora.","It's not mine. You can throw it away. That's a matter for the guild to resolve.":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 meu. Voc\u00ea pode jog\u00e1-lo fora. Esse \u00e9 um assunto para a guilda resolver.","It's not my fault.":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 minha culpa.","It's not often, but I said I'd be staying on this island for a while, so maybe I'll come back sometime?":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 sempre, mas eu disse que ficaria nesta ilha por um tempo, ent\u00e3o talvez eu volte algum dia?","It's not that I feel bad...":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 que eu me sinta mal...","It's not that I'm hiding anything, but...":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 que eu esteja escondendo alguma coisa, mas...","It's not that bad of a wound, this!":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 uma ferida t\u00e3o grave assim!","It's not that it's hot or anything, it's purely magical power that protects the entire village from the cold.":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 que esteja quente nem nada, \u00e9 um poder puramente m\u00e1gico que protege toda a vila do frio.","It's not that she died... she gave up... Evelyn...!":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 que ela morreu... ela desistiu... Evelyn...!","It's not time yet.":"Ainda n\u00e3o \u00e9 hora.","It's not too late because you're still young. How about taking the path of a scholar right now?":"N\u00e3o \u00e9 tarde demais porque voc\u00ea ainda \u00e9 jovem. Que tal seguir o caminho de um estudioso agora mesmo?","It's not what I wanted...just for my mission...":"N\u00e3o era o que eu queria... apenas para minha miss\u00e3o...","It's not what they did. Their sacrifice just happened to revive the power of the relic.":"N\u00e3o foi o que eles fizeram. O sacrif\u00edcio deles aconteceu para reviver o poder da rel\u00edquia.","It's not wrong. Just like when you first came to the Holy Land, this will buy you some time.":"N\u00e3o est\u00e1 errado. Assim como quando voc\u00ea veio pela primeira vez \u00e0 Terra Santa, isso lhe dar\u00e1 algum tempo.","It's okay Evelyn... we can get through this.":"Est\u00e1 tudo bem, Evelyn... podemos superar isso.","It's okay if it's not mine... and if it's you... you'll use Altena properly...":"Tudo bem se n\u00e3o for meu... e se for voc\u00ea... voc\u00ea usar\u00e1 Altena corretamente...","It's okay now.":"Est\u00e1 tudo bem agora.","It's okay up to this point, but this area is under my jurisdiction.":"Tudo bem at\u00e9 agora, mas esta \u00e1rea est\u00e1 sob minha jurisdi\u00e7\u00e3o.","It's okay, Len. I took the medicine Theodore made and I felt better.":"Est\u00e1 tudo bem, Len. Tomei o rem\u00e9dio que o Theodore preparou e me senti melhor.","It's okay, Ren.":"Est\u00e1 tudo bem, Ren.","It's okay, Ren. I have to go... it'll only be a distraction.":"Est\u00e1 tudo bem, Ren. Eu tenho que ir... ser\u00e1 apenas uma distra\u00e7\u00e3o.","It's okay, it's okay, don't be shy. Because successors must unite through trust and loyalty.":"Est\u00e1 tudo bem, est\u00e1 tudo bem, n\u00e3o seja t\u00edmido. Porque os sucessores devem unir-se atrav\u00e9s da confian\u00e7a e da lealdade.","It's okay, so let's go! I want to see the sea!":"Est\u00e1 tudo bem, ent\u00e3o vamos! Quero ver o mar!","It's okay, you're a successor. It wouldn't have been easy to catch...!":"Est\u00e1 tudo bem, voc\u00ea \u00e9 um sucessor. N\u00e3o teria sido f\u00e1cil de capturar...!","It's okay.":"Tudo bem.","It's okay. Instead...":"Tudo bem. Em vez disso...","It's okay.. If you rest a bit.. you will recover..":"Est\u00e1 tudo bem.. Se voc\u00ea descansar um pouco.. voc\u00ea vai se recuperar..","It's on the north coast, so get it.":"Fica na costa norte, ent\u00e3o pegue.","It's on the north coast. Do you know where north is?":"Est\u00e1 no litoral norte. Voc\u00ea sabe onde fica o norte?","It's only been three years, but they've proven to us the existence of the Advent.":"S\u00f3 se passaram tr\u00eas anos, mas eles nos provaram a exist\u00eancia do Advento.","It's our job to keep them hopeful.":"\u00c9 nosso trabalho mant\u00ea-los esperan\u00e7osos.","It's over there.":"Est\u00e1 ali.","It's over, Rufus. Give up your right to succession...and leave us alone.":"Acabou, Rufus. Desista do seu direito \u00e0 sucess\u00e3o... e deixe-nos em paz.","It's over... everything...":"Acabou... tudo...","It's pretty and feminine. Adult and...":"\u00c9 lindo e feminino. Adulto e...","It's probably a bad situation":"Provavelmente \u00e9 uma situa\u00e7\u00e3o ruim","It's probably just a pseudo-religious group.":"Provavelmente \u00e9 apenas um grupo pseudo-religioso.","It's quite boring to just sit around and forget about severance pay.":"\u00c9 muito chato ficar sentado e esquecer as indeniza\u00e7\u00f5es.","It's really big!":"\u00c9 muito grande!","It's really big! A lot! I will definitely work there when I grow up!":"\u00c9 muito grande! Bastante! Com certeza trabalharei l\u00e1 quando crescer!","It's really depressing if even this doesn't help.":"\u00c9 realmente deprimente se mesmo isso n\u00e3o ajudar.","It's really... a life-changing story...":"\u00c9 realmente... uma hist\u00f3ria de mudan\u00e7a de vida...","It's really... hard.":"\u00c9 realmente... dif\u00edcil.","It's sad to say that.":"\u00c9 triste dizer isso.","It's shaking... as if I'm on a ship... no, maybe it's really a ship.":"Est\u00e1 tremendo... como se eu estivesse em um navio... n\u00e3o, talvez seja mesmo um navio.","It's similar.":"\u00c9 semelhante.","It's similar. Because we are going to the exact place where the master of nightmares is sealed.":"\u00c9 semelhante. Porque estamos indo para o lugar exato onde o mestre dos pesadelos est\u00e1 selado.","It's so narrow... I can't get in?":"\u00c9 t\u00e3o estreito... n\u00e3o consigo entrar?","It's so powerful that it feels like it's going to explode...! But.. I will never lose..!":"\u00c9 t\u00e3o poderoso que parece que vai explodir...! Mas.. eu nunca vou perder..!","It's somehow fun, but this situation... I'm afraid of the consequences.){":"\u00c9 at\u00e9 divertido, mas esta situa\u00e7\u00e3o... tenho medo das consequ\u00eancias.){","It's someone else's land anyway, so I have no intention of using it.":"De qualquer forma, \u00e9 terra de outra pessoa, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o tenho inten\u00e7\u00e3o de us\u00e1-la.","It's something only I can do... I feel like if I don't do this, I'll end up doing the thing I don't want to do the most.":"\u00c9 algo que s\u00f3 eu posso fazer... Sinto que se n\u00e3o fizer isso, vou acabar fazendo aquilo que mais n\u00e3o quero fazer.","It's still cold. That tone of voice hasn't changed at all.":"Ainda est\u00e1 frio. Esse tom de voz n\u00e3o mudou em nada.","It's still too early!":"Ainda \u00e9 muito cedo!","It's still unfamiliar and scary, but I think she's a good person.":"Ainda \u00e9 estranho e assustador, mas acho que ela \u00e9 uma boa pessoa.","It's strange that you are so cautious.":"\u00c9 estranho que voc\u00ea seja t\u00e3o cauteloso.","It's such a bothersome burden that you even get hurt... It's okay if you don't materialize it...":"\u00c9 um fardo t\u00e3o inc\u00f4modo que voc\u00ea at\u00e9 se machuca... Tudo bem se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o concretizar...","It's supposed to be sent to the Rockville Development Corporation...I see there's an additional shipment.":"Deveria ser enviado para a Rockville Development Corporation... Vejo que h\u00e1 uma remessa adicional.","It's that dangerous...":"\u00c9 t\u00e3o perigoso...","It's that guy over there! A blue-haired mercenary!":"\u00c9 aquele cara ali! Um mercen\u00e1rio de cabelo azul!","It's that kid.":"\u00c9 aquele garoto.","It's the closest thing to us.":"\u00c9 a coisa mais pr\u00f3xima de n\u00f3s.","It's the duty of a mercenary to not hesitate to do anything that might require additional pay!":"\u00c9 dever de um mercen\u00e1rio n\u00e3o hesitar em fazer qualquer coisa que possa exigir pagamento adicional!","It's the front door key... Let's hurry and get out!":"\u00c9 a chave da porta da frente... Vamos nos apressar e sair!","It's the last resort to get a clear answer... I know that.":"\u00c9 o \u00faltimo recurso para obter uma resposta clara... eu sei disso.","It's the last state-of-the-art ship I stole from the military! Parting the seas for the future of humanity.":"\u00c9 o \u00faltimo navio de \u00faltima gera\u00e7\u00e3o que roubei dos militares! Separando os mares para o futuro da humanidade.","It's the older brother's role to protect his younger siblings.":"\u00c9 fun\u00e7\u00e3o do irm\u00e3o mais velho proteger os irm\u00e3os mais novos.","It's the opposite. Only when those guys disappear can we fight the ancient gods.":"\u00c9 o oposto. Somente quando esses caras desaparecerem poderemos lutar contra os deuses antigos.","It's the opposite. You were so fun that I wanted to play until the end.":"\u00c9 o oposto. Voc\u00ea foi t\u00e3o divertido que eu queria brincar at\u00e9 o fim.","It's the same for both of us. There is no need to shed blood between those on the same side.":"\u00c9 o mesmo para n\u00f3s dois. N\u00e3o h\u00e1