 can see nothing..":"Oh meu Deus.. Acho que meu corpo ainda n\u00e3o se recuperou.. N\u00e3o consigo ver nada..","Oh my...":"Ah meu...","Oh my... you really caught it?":"Nossa... voc\u00ea realmente pegou?","Oh my... you really don't know anything? That's why they didn't kill the black soldiers.":"Nossa... voc\u00ea realmente n\u00e3o sabe de nada? \u00c9 por isso que n\u00e3o mataram os soldados negros.","Oh no...":"Ah, n\u00e3o...","Oh really...":"Ah, realmente...","Oh wow.. he":"Ah, uau.. ele","Oh wow.. he\u2019s got something to complain about, isn\u2019t he? Is it because of the black soldiers?":"Nossa... ele tem do que reclamar, n\u00e3o \u00e9? \u00c9 por causa dos soldados negros?","Oh!":"Oh!","Oh, I want to hit you..":"Ah, eu quero bater em voc\u00ea..","Oh, I... I'll hide!":"Ah, eu... vou me esconder!","Oh, Mr. Schurz. You're back. The matriarch is very worried because she is arriving later than expected.":"Ah, Sr. Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 de volta. A matriarca est\u00e1 muito preocupada porque chega mais tarde do que o esperado.","Oh, Schurz! Are you here?":"Ah, Schurz! Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 aqui?","Oh, Schurz. Did you come?":"Ah, Schurz. Voc\u00ea veio?","Oh, are you finally believing me?":"Oh, voc\u00ea finalmente est\u00e1 acreditando em mim?","Oh, are you sure? So can I ask you a simple favor?":"Ah, voc\u00ea tem certeza? Ent\u00e3o posso te pedir um favor simples?","Oh, but since you're not an official guild member yet, you won't receive any other benefits...":"Ah, mas como voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o \u00e9 membro oficial da guilda, n\u00e3o receber\u00e1 nenhum outro benef\u00edcio...","Oh, by the way, I forgot to tell you. You know the building down here when you leave the guild?":"Ah, a prop\u00f3sito, esqueci de te contar. Voc\u00ea conhece o pr\u00e9dio aqui quando voc\u00ea sai da guilda?","Oh, did you call me?":"Ah, voc\u00ea me ligou?","Oh, did you mean to use this? Sorry, I was in a bit of a hurry.":"Ah, voc\u00ea pretendia usar isso? Desculpe, eu es