at.":"Ok, ent\u00e3o. H\u00e1 algo que a Rockville Development Corporation solicitou e acho que podemos fazer isso.","Okay, this guy will come with you. Although he is young, he is one of the leading figures in our guild.":"Ok, esse cara ir\u00e1 com voc\u00ea. Embora seja jovem, ele \u00e9 uma das principais figuras da nossa guilda.","Okay, what do you think?":"Ok, o que voc\u00ea acha?","Okay, you definitely got it right.":"Ok, voc\u00ea definitivamente acertou.","Okay.":"OK.","Okay. But I have to go back to Central first, and even if I wanted to, it wouldn't be easy to meet him...":"OK. Mas primeiro tenho que voltar para a Central e, mesmo que quisesse, n\u00e3o seria f\u00e1cil conhec\u00ea-lo...","Okay. Done.":"Ok. Feito.","Okay. I won't ask any more questions, so let's eat.":"OK. N\u00e3o farei mais perguntas, ent\u00e3o vamos comer.","Okay. Just stop there.":"OK. Apenas pare a\u00ed.","Okay.. I'll go. Show me, you are a revolutionary army.":"Ok.. eu vou. Mostre-me, voc\u00ea \u00e9 um ex\u00e9rcito revolucion\u00e1rio.","Okay.. Now, unless something special happens, you too will be able to go to the Holy Land through these points.":"Ok.. Agora, a menos que algo especial aconte\u00e7a, voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m poder\u00e1 ir para a Terra Santa atrav\u00e9s destes pontos.","Okay.. just teach me one thing. Eileen, since when have you had that dream?":"Ok.. apenas me ensine uma coisa. Eileen, desde quando voc\u00ea tem esse sonho?","Okay.. okay.":"Ok.. ok.","Okay.. then let":"Ok.. ent\u00e3o vamos","Okay.. then let\u2019s get to the point.":"Ok.. ent\u00e3o vamos direto ao ponto.","Okay...":"Ok...","Okay... I'll do that. First, let's wait in the village for him to get better.":"Ok... eu farei isso. Primeiro vamos esperar na aldeia ele melhorar.","Okay... answer the question.":"Ok... responda \u00e0 pergunta.","Okay... it's not organized very well, but anyway...":"Ok... n\u00e3o est\u00e1 muito bem organizado, mas enfim...","Okay... with this, we should be able to ne