 gather materials, right?":"Como voc\u00ea \u00e9 um mercen\u00e1rio, voc\u00ea deveria conseguir coletar materiais, certo?","Since you're a mercenary, you're probably interested in good weapons, right?":"Como voc\u00ea \u00e9 um mercen\u00e1rio, provavelmente est\u00e1 interessado em boas armas, certo?","Since you're giving me what I want, it looks like I have something to ask...":"J\u00e1 que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 me dando o que eu quero, parece que tenho algo a perguntar...","Since you're still young, why don't you study now?":"J\u00e1 que voc\u00ea ainda \u00e9 jovem, por que n\u00e3o estuda agora?","Since you've come this far, you're probably thinking of coming in.":"J\u00e1 que voc\u00ea chegou at\u00e9 aqui, provavelmente est\u00e1 pensando em entrar.","Sister Eileen!":"Irm\u00e3 Eileen!","Sister Eileen! I missed you!":"Irm\u00e3 Eileen! Senti a sua falta!","Sister Eileen... Sister Evelyn...":"Irm\u00e3 Eileen... Irm\u00e3 Evelyn...","Sister Eileen?":"Irm\u00e3 Eileen?","Sister Evelyn, are you okay?":"Irm\u00e3 Evelyn, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem?","Sister Evelyn, please take care of Mr. Schurz. Loneliness... Because I'm a person who suffers a lot.":"Irm\u00e3 Evelyn, por favor, cuide do Sr. Schurz. Solid\u00e3o... Porque sou uma pessoa que sofre muito.","Sister Evelyn, you look tired.":"Irm\u00e3 Evelyn, voc\u00ea parece cansada.","Sister Evelyn... Mr. Theodore... is the one listening...":"Irm\u00e3 Evelyn... Sr. Theodore... \u00e9 quem est\u00e1 ouvindo...","Sister Evelyn... she's such a wonderful person.":"Irm\u00e3 Evelyn... ela \u00e9 uma pessoa maravilhosa.","Sister Luraine!!":"Irm\u00e3 Luraine!!","Sister Luraine, then... Is it good for me to be completed?":"Irm\u00e3 Luraine, ent\u00e3o... \u00c9 bom para mim estar completa?","Sister, are you surprised by the ancient species? Or even motion sickness...":"Irm\u00e3, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 surpresa com as esp\u00e9cies antigas? Ou at\u00e9 mesmo enj\u00f4o...","Sister, should you take care of yourself? Later... 