 Holy Land two days ago.":"Aquele velho estava solicitando ao conselho que o enviasse para a Terra Santa h\u00e1 dois dias.","That person has been saying some dangerous things these days.":"Essa pessoa tem dito algumas coisas perigosas ultimamente.","That person just said... }Crad Oppa{?":"Essa pessoa acabou de dizer... }Crad Oppa{?","That person..!":"Essa pessoa..!","That person...":"Essa pessoa...","That plan... would also include spirits.":"Esse plano... tamb\u00e9m incluiria bebidas espirituosas.","That powerful being... the enemy we must fight...":"Esse ser poderoso... o inimigo que devemos combater...","That said...":"Dito isso...","That sounds incomprehensible. Is there any other way to help? Even if it's just to buy some time.":"Isso parece incompreens\u00edvel. Existe alguma outra maneira de ajudar? Mesmo que seja apenas para ganhar algum tempo.","That sounds positive.":"Isso parece positivo.","That spark... that's what you wanted the most.":"Essa fa\u00edsca... era o que voc\u00ea mais queria.","That too... fighting while protecting my beloved sister. It's quite fun. Cough.":"Isso tamb\u00e9m... lutar enquanto protegia minha amada irm\u00e3. \u00c9 muito divertido. Tosse.","That was just 30 years ago.":"Isso foi h\u00e1 apenas 30 anos.","That was the truth about what happened to our family.":"Essa foi a verdade sobre o que aconteceu com nossa fam\u00edlia.","That way, you don't cause harm to others and if you have to, you can just throw it into the sea.":"Dessa forma, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o causa danos a terceiros e, se for preciso, pode simplesmente jog\u00e1-lo no mar.","That we were born to be perfect...":"Que nascemos para ser perfeitos...","That woman called a saint":"Aquela mulher chamada de santa","That woman is overdoing it. It's the same as pretending to be bright...":"Essa mulher est\u00e1 exagerando. \u00c9 o mesmo que fingir ser brilhante...","That would be nice, but... Graham may have been late in delivering it, but it hasn't arrived.":"Seria bom, mas... Graham pode ter se atrasado na entrega, mas ainda n\u00e3o chegou.","That would be ridiculously possible.":"Isso seria ridiculamente poss\u00edvel.","That wouldn't have been the story... In the past,":"Essa n\u00e3o teria sido a hist\u00f3ria... No passado,","That you are god":"Que voc\u00ea \u00e9 deus","That you have to be at the top.":"Que voc\u00ea tem que estar no topo.","That young guy doesn't taste cute. I did a good job, but...":"Esse jovem n\u00e3o tem um gosto fofo. Fiz um bom trabalho, mas...","That's a creation of a human-centered mindset, so it's rude to them.":"Isso \u00e9 a cria\u00e7\u00e3o de uma mentalidade centrada no ser humano, por isso \u00e9 rude com eles.","That's a defective product. Me, like you.":"Isso \u00e9 um produto com defeito. Eu, como voc\u00ea.","That's a long time ago now...":"Isso j\u00e1 faz muito tempo...","That's a mineral just for me.":"Esse \u00e9 um mineral s\u00f3 para mim.","That's a really unmotivated friend. Quit it.":"Esse \u00e9 um amigo realmente desmotivado. Pare com isso.","That's always their method... they ruin everything else to make things go according to plan.":"Esse \u00e9 sempre o m\u00e9todo deles... eles estragam tudo para fazer as coisas correrem conforme o planejado.","That's amazing. Are all high-ranking officers in the regular army like this?":"Isso \u00e9 incr\u00edvel. Todos os oficiais de alta patente do ex\u00e9rcito regular s\u00e3o assim?","That's awkward. Am I alone or not?":"Isso \u00e9 estranho. Estou sozinho ou n\u00e3o?","That's because they sprinkled hi-potion on it and baked it.":"Isso porque eles borrifaram po\u00e7\u00e3o sobre ele e assaram.","That's childish thinking. This is not the time for sentimental thoughts.":"Isso \u00e9 pensamento infantil. Este n\u00e3o \u00e9 o momento para pensamentos sentimentais.","That's enough":"Isso \u00e9 o suficiente","That's enough. good.":"Isso \u00e9 o suficiente. bom.","That's even more stupid. Tiana... lost all her memories a year ago.":"Isso \u00e9 ainda mais est\u00fapido. Tiana... perdeu todas as suas mem\u00f3rias h\u00e1 um ano.","That's good, I'm looking forward to it.":"Isso \u00e9 bom, estou ansioso por isso.","That's harsh...":"Isso \u00e9 duro...","That's how it should be. In the end, Advent only provided technology...":"\u00c9 assim que deveria ser. No final, a Advent apenas forneceu tecnologia...","That's impossible. Look at this list of wanted criminals registered this time.":"Isso \u00e9 imposs\u00edvel. Veja esta lista de criminosos procurados registrados desta vez.","That's it now, right? Could you please stop bothering me?":"\u00c9 isso agora, certo? Voc\u00ea poderia, por favor, parar de me incomodar?","That's it too.":"\u00c9 isso tamb\u00e9m.","That's it, get over it.":"\u00c9 isso, supere isso.","That's it. After the red-haired fugitive caused an emergency, further investigation was impossible.":"\u00c9 isso. Depois que o fugitivo ruivo causou uma emerg\u00eancia, uma investiga\u00e7\u00e3o mais aprofundada foi imposs\u00edvel.","That's it. Anyway, I'll just sleep again.":"\u00c9 isso. De qualquer forma, vou dormir de novo.","That's it.. let's go.":"\u00c9 isso.. vamos.","That's just a coincidence. It's just the ghosts of the family that are obsessed with this place.":"Isso \u00e9 apenas uma coincid\u00eancia. S\u00e3o apenas os fantasmas da fam\u00edlia que est\u00e3o obcecados por este lugar.","That's just...":"Isso \u00e9 s\u00f3...","That's my opinion too.":"Essa \u00e9 a minha opini\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m.","That's my spear":"Essa \u00e9 minha lan\u00e7a","That's my spear@":"Essa \u00e9 minha lan\u00e7a@","That's nonsense, it can't happen.":"Isso \u00e9 um absurdo, n\u00e3o pode acontecer.","That's not about you, it's about the rules as a successor, Ren.":"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 sobre voc\u00ea, \u00e9 sobre as regras como sucessor, Ren.","That's not enough. You go first.":"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 suficiente. Voc\u00ea vai primeiro.","That's not it either. It's just that the relics 