tigo...","That's right...":"Isso mesmo...","That's right... I can't...":"Isso mesmo... eu n\u00e3o posso...","That's right... it's an eerie cave.":"Isso mesmo... \u00e9 uma caverna misteriosa.","That's right... let's go right in.":"Isso mesmo... vamos entrar.","That's the mindset. There is a lot of work to be done in the future!":"Essa \u00e9 a mentalidade. H\u00e1 muito trabalho a ser feito no futuro!","That's the only way. Give up your right to succession.":"Essa \u00e9 a \u00fanica maneira. Desista do seu direito \u00e0 sucess\u00e3o.","That's true though.":"Mas isso \u00e9 verdade.","That's true, but...":"Isso \u00e9 verdade, mas...","That's what I want to ask. I've just been introduced to being a successor.":"Isso \u00e9 o que eu quero perguntar. Acabei de ser apresentado como um sucessor.","That's what we do best, that's...":"Isso \u00e9 o que fazemos de melhor, isso \u00e9...","That's why I didn't bring him.":"Foi por isso que n\u00e3o o trouxe.","That's why I needed you.":"\u00c9 por isso que eu precisava de voc\u00ea.","That's why I was able to survive even after receiving those injuries.":"\u00c9 por isso que consegui sobreviver mesmo depois de receber esses ferimentos.","That's why I'm asking...":"Por isso estou perguntando...","That's wrong, it's all the remnants left behind by the Old Gods!":"Isso est\u00e1 errado, s\u00e3o todos os restos deixados pelos Deuses Antigos!","That's...":"Isso \u00e9...","That's... I didn't mean to say that.":"Isso \u00e9... eu n\u00e3o quis dizer isso.","That's... I still don't know.":"Isso \u00e9... ainda n\u00e3o sei.","That\u2019s all I want to say. Stop... go back to your hell.":"Isso \u00e9 tudo que quero dizer. Pare... volte para o seu inferno.","That\u2019s ridiculous.. If there was an attack or something last night, there\u2019s no way I wouldn\u2019t have heard of it..":"Isso \u00e9 rid\u00edculo.. Se houvesse um ataque ou algo assim ontem \u00e0 noite, de jeito nenhum eu n\u00e3o teria ouvido falar disso..","That\u2019s ridiculous.. There\u2019s no way I could move in that state..!":"Isso \u00e9 rid\u00edculo.. N\u00e3o tem como eu me mover nesse estado..!","That\u2019s understandable.":"Isso \u00e9 compreens\u00edvel.","That\u2019s your true intention, right?":"Essa \u00e9 a sua verdadeira inten\u00e7\u00e3o, certo?","The (a) was used.":"O (a) foi usado.","The Central Tower is already too much, matriarch.":"A Torre Central j\u00e1 \u00e9 demais, matriarca.","The Church of the Advent, in the process of preparing its believers for the ancestral rites.":"A Igreja do Advento, em processo de prepara\u00e7\u00e3o dos seus fi\u00e9is para os ritos ancestrais.","The Congress still hasn't given up the land of the original owners, and it will eventually lead to war...":"O Congresso ainda n\u00e3o desistiu das terras dos propriet\u00e1rios originais e isso acabar\u00e1 por levar \u00e0 guerra...","The Crown of Doctrine is the backbone of the Order of the Advent.":"A Coroa da Doutrina \u00e9 a espinha dorsal da Ordem do Advento.","The Ernest family and the Bain family were also exterminated, but I and Schurz are still there.":"A fam\u00edlia Ernest e a fam\u00edlia Bain tamb\u00e9m foram exterminadas, mas eu e Schurz ainda estamos l\u00e1.","The Ernest family was a great family that protected Rockville since ancient times.":"A fam\u00edlia Ernest foi uma grande fam\u00edlia que protegeu Rockville desde os tempos antigos.","The Guardian cannot leave the seal now. We must go to the Holy Land.":"O Guardi\u00e3o n\u00e3o pode sair do selo agora. Devemos ir para a Terra Santa.","The Guardian of Nebed":"O Guardi\u00e3o de Nebed","The Guardian of Nebed;to meet;I went to a holy place.;Tyr's allies in Irem;I'm guessing he's pulling a boat;So let":"O Guardi\u00e3o de Nebed;conhecer;Fui para um lugar sagrado.;Aliados de Tyr em Irem;Acho que ele est\u00e1 puxando um barco;Ent\u00e3o deixe","The Guardian... entered directly into the center of the seal.":"O Guardi\u00e3o... entrou diretamente no centro do selo.","The Guardian... seems to have already known we were coming.":"O Guardi\u00e3o... parece j\u00e1 saber que est\u00e1vamos vindo.","The Holy Land War five years ago was humanity's worst mistake. To have so many victims...":"A Guerra da Terra Santa, h\u00e1 cinco anos, foi o pior erro da humanidade. Ter tantas v\u00edtimas...","The Holy Land War{... On the outside it was a war between humans and Nebed, but on the inside it was a completely different fight.":"A Guerra da Terra Santa{... Por fora foi uma guerra entre humanos e Nebed, mas por dentro foi uma luta completamente diferente.","The Holy Land of Nebed":"A Terra Santa de Nebed","The Mining Guild also offers a bounty for worms, so if you have the ability, it would be a good idea to catch them yourself.":"A Guilda de Minera\u00e7\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m oferece uma recompensa por vermes, ent\u00e3o, se voc\u00ea tiver habilidade, seria uma boa ideia captur\u00e1-los voc\u00ea mesmo.","The Moytura Plain has good soil, allowing numerous types of grains to be grown despite the cold weather.":"A Plan\u00edcie de Moytura possui bons solos, permitindo o cultivo de numerosos tipos de gr\u00e3os apesar do frio.","The Old God created several subordinates to serve as his limbs during the war... and they are called Guardians.":"O Deus Antigo criou v\u00e1rios subordinados para servirem como seus membros durante a guerra... e eles s\u00e3o chamados de Guardi\u00f5es.","The Old Gods are our enemies. I agree with that.":"Os Deuses Antigos s\u00e3o nossos inimigos. Eu concordo com isso.","The Old Gods are still slowly tearing the seal apart.":"Os Deuses Antigos ainda est\u00e3o destruindo lentamente o selo.","The Old Gods certainly... must be close to the time of resurrection.":"Os Deuses Antigos certamente... devem estar pr\u00f3ximos do tempo da ressurrei\u00e7\u00e3o.","The Order of the Advent is close to the science created by the most advanced, young intellectuals on Moytura Island.":"A Ordem do Advento est\u00e1 pr\u00f3xima da ci\u00eancia criada pelos jovens intelectuais mais avan\u00e7ados da Ilha Moytura.","The Republic has definitely been getting better since the Wade family took control of the council.":"A Rep\u00fablica definitivamente melhorou desde que a fam\u00edlia Wade assumiu o controle do conselho.","The Ridmire family's mission was to protect the remains of the Advent? What does this mean..?":"A miss\u00e3o da fam\u00edlia Ridmire era proteger os restos do Advento? O que isto significa..?","The Rydmire family has protected Coal Creek Island for a long time. From the }volcano{ of }Trident Island{.":"A fam\u00edlia Rydmire protege a Ilha Coal Creek h\u00e1 muito tempo. Do }vulc\u00e3o{ da }Ilha Tridente{.","The SP of }#07|":"O SP de }#07|","The Saint of 9th Street":"O Santo da Rua 9","The Saint of 9th StreetsI see a strange girl.":"O Santo das Ruas 9Vejo uma garota estranha.","The Saint of 9th StreetsI see a strange girl.;It was definitely a dream...;cured me;That woman called a saint;I may have done some trick...":"O Santo das Ruas 9Vejo uma garota estranha.;Com certeza foi um sonho...;me curou;Aquela mulher chamada de santa;Posso ter feito algum truque...","The Soltians truly have a god for you.":"Os Soltians realmente t\u00eam um deus para voc\u00ea.","The Wade family and the Listeners are seeking Altena's power.":"A fam\u00edlia Wade e os Ouvintes buscam o poder de Altena.","The Wade family came and punished my father, and the case was closed. I was the only one left in the family.":"A fam\u00edlia Wade veio e puniu meu pai, e o caso foi encerrado. Eu era o \u00fanico que restava na fam\u00edlia.","The Wade family has been using the listeners to increase their power, even though they know that the listeners are minions of the Old Gods.":"A fam\u00edlia Wade tem usado os ouvintes para aumentar seu poder, mesmo sabendo que os ouvintes s\u00e3o servos dos Deuses Antigos.","The Wade family said that God would have no choice but to be perfected due to human nature.":"A fam\u00edlia Wade disse que Deus n\u00e3o teria escolha sen\u00e3o ser aperfei\u00e7oado devido \u00e0 natureza humana.","The Wade family's power remains, and the threat of the Advent remains.":"O poder da fam\u00edlia Wade permanece e a amea\u00e7a do Advento permanece.","The Wade family... those who listen will come back. You cannot accomplish that mission alone.":"A fam\u00edlia Wade... quem ouvir voltar\u00e1. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pode cumprir essa miss\u00e3o sozinho.","The ability }#10| increases.":"A habilidade }#10| aumenta.","The adventure begins":"A aventura come\u00e7a","The amount charged":"O valor cobrado","The amount of HP recovered is":"A quantidade de HP recuperada \u00e9","The amount of SP charged is":"O valor de SP cobrado \u00e9","The amount of SP is }50%| increasing":"O valor de SP \u00e9 }50%| aumentando","The amount of SP recovered is":"A quantidade de SP recuperada \u00e9","The ancient god at the center of the sanctuary":"O antigo deus no centro do santu\u00e1rio","The ancient gods and those who listen...":"Os deuses antigos e aqueles que ouvem...","The ancient gods are trying to wake up... The Advent is trying to return... This world is becoming more and more a mess.":"Os deuses antigos est\u00e3o tentando acordar... O Advento est\u00e1 tentando retornar... Este mundo est\u00e1 se tornando cada vez mais uma bagun\u00e7a.","The ancient gods cannot interfere, but if you feel any danger, please come back immediately.":"Os deuses antigos n\u00e3o podem interferir, mas se voc\u00ea sentir algum perigo, volte imediatamente.","The ancient gods.. for resurrection..":"Os deuses antigos.. para a ressurrei\u00e7\u00e3o..","The ancient species that attacked the ship":"As esp\u00e9cies antigas que atacaram o navio","The apostles have it.":"Os ap\u00f3stolos t\u00eam isso.","The ark will soon start up, and no one will be able to enter the once-started ark.":"A arca ser\u00e1 iniciada em breve e ningu\u00e9m poder\u00e1 entrar na arca que j\u00e1 foi i