rande influ\u00eancia indireta no aumento da produtividade de Moytura.","The magical rules that the man discovered had a great indirect influence on the increase in Moytura's productivity.":"As regras m\u00e1gicas que o homem descobriu tiveram grande influ\u00eancia indireta no aumento da produtividade de Moytura.","The main material of the tank.":"O material principal do tanque.","The main material of the tank.*":"O principal material do tanque.*","The man had planned all escape routes.":"O homem planejou todas as rotas de fuga.","The man is called Tyr. Besides...there is such a thing as a rebel?":"O homem se chama Tyr. Al\u00e9m disso... existe rebelde?","The man named Tyr, the existence of the rebels, and the reason for chasing the successor... I need to hear it all here.":"O homem chamado Tyr, a exist\u00eancia dos rebeldes e o motivo para perseguir o sucessor... Preciso ouvir tudo aqui.","The master of nightmares... decided that something was threatening him.":"O mestre dos pesadelos... decidiu que algo o estava amea\u00e7ando.","The maximum HP is":"O HP m\u00e1ximo \u00e9","The maximum SP is":"O SP m\u00e1ximo \u00e9","The maximum SP is permanently":"O SP m\u00e1ximo \u00e9 permanentemente","The memories of this child that I erased,":"As mem\u00f3rias desta crian\u00e7a que apaguei,","The miners of Coal Creek Island":"Os mineiros da Ilha Coal Creek","The mining association has no idea what the situation is right now.":"A associa\u00e7\u00e3o mineira n\u00e3o tem ideia de qual \u00e9 a situa\u00e7\u00e3o neste momento.","The mining union is full of trash. They just want to squeeze us somehow and make a profit for themselves.":"O sindicato mineiro est\u00e1 cheio de lixo. Eles s\u00f3 querem nos espremer de alguma forma e lucrar para si pr\u00f3prios.","The miracle of healing performed by the saint is said to be unbelievable unless you experience it.":"Diz-se que o milagre de cura realizado pelo santo \u00e9 inacredit\u00e1vel, a menos que voc\u00ea o experimente.","The moment I accepted the inheritance in my dream, my completely frozen body began to move.":"No momento em que aceitei a heran\u00e7a em meu sonho, meu corpo completamente congelado come\u00e7ou a se mover.","The monsters suddenly became ferocious. More bears appear too.":"Os monstros de repente ficaram ferozes. Mais ursos aparecem tamb\u00e9m.","The more I look at them, the more fun they are as a couple.":"Quanto mais olho para eles, mais divertidos eles s\u00e3o como casal.","The most famous are }Saints of Central 9th ??Street{, }Eileen{.":"Os mais famosos s\u00e3o }Saints of Central 9th ??Street{, }Eileen{.","The most famous are }Saints of Central 9th \u200b\u200bStreet{, }Eileen{.":"Os mais famosos s\u00e3o }Santos da Central 9th Street{, }Eileen{.","The most surprising thing is that the commander-in-chief at the time, Kefnes, was actually an apostle of the ancient gods.":"O mais surpreendente \u00e9 que o comandante-chefe da \u00e9poca, Kefnes, era na verdade um ap\u00f3stolo dos deuses antigos.","The movements of the Wade family and those listening were clearly dead. Especially... those listening are completely silent.":"Os movimentos da fam\u00edlia Wade e daqueles que ouviam estavam claramente mortos. Especialmente... aqueles que ouvem ficam completamente em sil\u00eancio.","The name is }mark{. A man in Rockville who suddenly became wealthy a few years ago.":"O nome \u00e9 }marca{. Um homem em Rockville que de repente ficou rico h\u00e1 alguns anos.","The name... I don't think that's it...":"O nome... acho que n\u00e3o \u00e9 isso...","The nature of spirits and":"A natureza dos esp\u00edritos e","The new blacksmith":"O novo ferreiro","The next day, I saw that someone had thrown a bag of grains in front of the door.":"No dia seguinte, vi que algu\u00e9m havia jogado um saco de gr\u00e3os na frente da porta.","The northwest mine has been closed for a long time. It's dangerous because the entrance collapsed due to an earthquake.":"A mina noroeste est\u00e1 fechada h\u00e1 muito tempo. \u00c9 perigoso porque a entrada desabou devido a um terremoto.","The official name is }Althena{. This is humanity's final weapon that we are trying to create by borrowing Advent's technology.":"O nome oficial \u00e9 }Althena{. Esta \u00e9 a arma final da humanidade que estamos tentando criar tomando emprestada a tecnologia do Advento.","The old Mr. Schurz was easier to manipulate...":"O velho Sr. Schurz era mais f\u00e1cil de manipular...","The only ones who are not intoxicated with peace are you and Theodore.":"Os \u00fanicos que n\u00e3o est\u00e3o intoxicados pela paz s\u00e3o voc\u00ea e Theodore.","The only remaining descendant was named }Crad{.":"O \u00fanico descendente restante chamava-se }Crad{.","The only thing I'm worried about is that the Adventists run amok.":"A \u00fanica coisa que me preocupa \u00e9 que os adventistas fiquem descontrolados.","The only thing there is a transport ship, so if you want to ride it, go to the store and get some work.":"A \u00fanica coisa que existe \u00e9 um navio de transporte, ent\u00e3o se voc\u00ea quiser andar nele, v\u00e1 at\u00e9 a loja e trabalhe.","The ostriches on Coal Creek Island are very vicious. This is the part the security guards pay the most attention to.":"Os avestruzes da Ilha Coal Creek s\u00e3o muito cru\u00e9is. Esta \u00e9 a parte que os seguran\u00e7as prestam mais aten\u00e7\u00e3o.","The other party did not accept and return it.":"A outra parte n\u00e3o aceitou e devolveu.","The other side... I hope so.":"O outro lado... espero que sim.","The others are in the sewers... Have you heard?":"Os outros est\u00e3o nos esgotos... Voc\u00ea ouviu?","The outfit is either mercenary or thief, but if you're a thief, you're in trouble, right?":"A roupa \u00e9 mercen\u00e1ria ou ladr\u00e3o, mas se voc\u00ea \u00e9 ladr\u00e3o, est\u00e1 encrencado, certo?","The owner will notice and take it away.":"O propriet\u00e1rio notar\u00e1 e levar\u00e1 embora.","The password we originally decided on was: What do you think love is?":"A senha que decidimos originalmente foi: O que voc\u00ea acha que \u00e9 o amor?","The past I don't even remember... It's not important. Something that only makes things difficult for everyone.":"O passado eu nem me lembro... N\u00e3o \u00e9 importante. Algo que s\u00f3 dificulta as coisas para todos.","The pay isn't bad, and I'm used to taking care of kids, but...":"O sal\u00e1rio n\u00e3o \u00e9 mau e estou habituado a cuidar de crian\u00e7as, mas...","The people gathered here have different stories and purposes.":"As pessoas aqui reunidas t\u00eam hist\u00f3rias e prop\u00f3sitos diferentes.","The people of Coal Creek Island are waiting for you to save them from the Wade family.":"O povo de Coal Creek Island est\u00e1 esperando que voc\u00ea os salve da fam\u00edlia Wade.","The people of Irem are also victims of the tyranny of the Wade family.":"O povo de Irem tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 v\u00edtima da tirania da fam\u00edlia Wade.","The performance of weapons combined with orbs is different from ordinary weapons.":"O desempenho das armas combinadas com orbes \u00e9 diferente das armas comuns.","The period of stay in the tower is two days. Because I can only move for one night...":"O per\u00edodo de perman\u00eancia na torre \u00e9 de dois dias. Porque s\u00f3 posso me mover por uma noite...","The person I am now is Ren... The person I am now is the most important thing, right?":"A pessoa que sou agora \u00e9 Ren... A pessoa que sou agora \u00e9 a coisa mais importante, certo?","The person who is wanted by the Wade family is still ranked first.":"A pessoa procurada pela fam\u00edlia Wade ainda est\u00e1 em primeiro lugar.","The place where Eileen died... there was the same magic circle there too...":"O lugar onde Eileen morreu... havia o mesmo c\u00edrculo m\u00e1gico l\u00e1 tamb\u00e9m...","The place where that god is buried is what they call a holy place.":"O lugar onde esse deus est\u00e1 enterrado \u00e9 o que eles chamam de lugar sagrado.","The population, size, and power of the ancient species are on a different level... They are crawling up from the deepest depths.":"A popula\u00e7\u00e3o, o tamanho e o poder das esp\u00e9cies antigas est\u00e3o em um n\u00edvel diferente... Eles est\u00e3o rastejando das profundezas.","The power of the Old Gods has disappeared, but as long as they remain, the survival of all mankind will be threatened again one day.":"O poder dos Deuses Antigos desapareceu, mas enquanto eles permanecerem, um dia a sobreviv\u00eancia de toda a humanidade ser\u00e1 novamente amea\u00e7ada.","The power of the spirit is the ancient god":"O poder do esp\u00edrito \u00e9 o deus antigo","The preparations the fugitive made to escape the tower... the emergency placed on the tower to catch him, and the monster that appeared on the escape route.":"Os preparativos que o fugitivo fez para escapar da torre... a emerg\u00eancia colocada na torre para peg\u00e1-lo e o monstro que apareceu na rota de fuga.","The probability is high.":"A probabilidade \u00e9 alta.","The processing of the request ends here.":"O processamento do pedido termina aqui.","The protagonist of a tragedy...":"O protagonista de uma trag\u00e9dia...","The purity of this is too low compared to its weight. The quality is getting worse these days.":"A pureza disto \u00e9 muito baixa em compara\u00e7\u00e3o com o seu peso. A qualidade est\u00e1 piorando atualmente.","The purpose, who sent it, and why it came to me...":"O prop\u00f3sito, quem enviou e por que veio at\u00e9 mim...","The quantity required is also quite high. There are as many as 20{... they are greedy people.":"A quantidade necess\u00e1ria tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 bastante elevada. S\u00e3o at\u00e9 20... s\u00e3o pessoas gananciosas.{","The rain has stopped... it will be more comfortable than yesterday.":"A chuva parou... ser\u00e1 mais confort\u00e1vel que ontem.","The real fight begins after we uncover them...":"A verdadeira luta come\u00e7a depois que os descobrimos...","The reason humans are shivering in the cold northern land is because the indigenous species does not recognize humans as an equal race.":"A raz\u00e3o pela qual os humanos est\u00e3o tremendo nas terras frias do norte \u00e9 porque as esp\u00e9cies ind\u00edgenas n\u00e3o reconhecem os humanos como uma ra\u00e7a igual.","The reason you were born is what you make of it.":"A raz\u00e3o pela qual voc\u00ea nasceu \u00e9 o que voc\u00ea pensa disso.","The recorded history of Nebed lasted a thousand years, compared to only 300 years for humans.":"A hist\u00f3ria registrada de Nebed durou mil anos, em compara\u00e7\u00e3o com apenas 300 anos para os humanos.","The red-haired fugitive":"O fugitivo ruivo","The relics found there became the foundation of this church.":"As rel\u00edquias ali encontradas tornaram-se a base desta igreja.","The relics of the Advent... won't stop. Why?":"As rel\u00edquias do Advento... n\u00e3o v\u00e3o parar. Por que?","The resurrection of the ancient gods is already imminent, and the nervousness of those listening has reached its peak.":"A ressurrei\u00e7\u00e3o dos deuses antigos j\u00e1 \u00e9 iminente e o nervosismo de quem est\u00e1 ouvindo atingiu o auge.","The robbery happened and the whole town was worried...":"O roubo aconteceu e toda a cidade ficou preocupada...","The ruins of the Advent are in the northern lands... That's enough.":"As ru\u00ednas do Advento est\u00e3o nas terras do norte... J\u00e1 chega.","The safest place? It doesn't seem like the hiding place the kids were hoping for.":"O lugar mais seguro? N\u00e3o parece o esconderijo que as crian\u00e7as esperavam.","The same class cannot be transferred.":"A mesma classe n\u00e3o pode ser transferida.","The seal of the }Ancient God{ is still weakening... }The Adventists{ will also be aiming for the time of the Advent.":"O selo do }Deus Antigo{ ainda est\u00e1 enfraquecendo... Os }Adventistas{ tamb\u00e9m estar\u00e3o visando o tempo do Advento.","The seal 