ck up another one.":"Theodore estar\u00e1 aqui em breve tamb\u00e9m. Ele foi pegar outro.","Theodore!!":"Teodoro!!","Theodore's broken guard was restored.":"A guarda quebrada de Theodore foi restaurada.","Theodore's broken guard was restored.E":"A guarda quebrada de Theodore foi restaurada.E","Theodore's voice is inside me. The descendants will return with the completion of God and become the new inhabitants of this land.":"A voz de Theodore est\u00e1 dentro de mim. Os descendentes retornar\u00e3o com a conclus\u00e3o de Deus e se tornar\u00e3o os novos habitantes desta terra.","Theodore, is it possible to completely control spirits?":"Theodore, \u00e9 poss\u00edvel controlar completamente os esp\u00edritos?","Theodore, what are you talking about? Now we are approaching an important ancestral rite for Advent.":"Theodoro, do que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 falando? Agora estamos nos aproximando de um importante rito ancestral do Advento.","Theodore..!":"Teodoro..!","Theodore... Or maybe this is what Evelyn wanted most.":"Theodore... Ou talvez fosse isso que Evelyn mais queria.","Theodore... are you really satisfied with catching me?":"Theodore... voc\u00ea est\u00e1 realmente satisfeito em me pegar?","Theodore... stop... I'm in so much pain...!":"Theodore... pare... estou com tanta dor...!","Theodore... was a listener...":"Theodore... era um ouvinte...","Theodore? Why that guy?":"Teodoro? Por que aquele cara?","Theodore{":"Teodoro{","There are Chris, Tiana, and other sisters... But, the backgrounds in all the photos are the same?":"Tem Chris, Tiana e outras irm\u00e3s... Mas os fundos de todas as fotos s\u00e3o iguais?","There are a lot of cold islands in the republic and there is not enough land for farming...":"H\u00e1 muitas ilhas frias na rep\u00fablica e n\u00e3o h\u00e1 terra suficiente para a agricultura...","There are a lot of regular soldiers on board the ship. The ship is safe, but you are the one in danger.":"H\u00e1 muitos soldados regulares a bordo do navio. O n