cond coming of the Advent. Let us wait for salvation with more sincerity.":"N\u00e3o restam muitos ritos para rezar pela segunda vinda do Advento. Esperemos pela salva\u00e7\u00e3o com mais sinceridade.","There are now four left.":"Agora restam quatro.","There are only a few weapons left that were made there, and I can't get them anymore...":"Restam apenas algumas armas que foram feitas l\u00e1, e n\u00e3o consigo mais peg\u00e1-las...","There are only a very small number of children who were suppressed and arrested. Aren't the remaining kids hiding somewhere to plan their future?":"H\u00e1 apenas um n\u00famero muito pequeno de crian\u00e7as que foram reprimidas e presas. As crian\u00e7as restantes n\u00e3o est\u00e3o se escondendo em algum lugar para planejar seu futuro?","There are only miscellaneous things at the center of the seal, so nothing much will happen. Instead, never let your guard down against the master of nightmares.":"Existem apenas coisas diversas no centro do selo, ent\u00e3o nada acontecer\u00e1. Em vez disso, nunca baixe a guarda contra o mestre dos pesadelos.","There are people who need to be protected.":"Existem pessoas que precisam ser protegidas.","There are probably many people who don't understand why a combination is necessary.":"Provavelmente h\u00e1 muitas pessoas que n\u00e3o entendem por que uma combina\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 necess\u00e1ria.","There are promises to keep.":"H\u00e1 promessas a cumprir.","There are really heirs who want to fight...":"Realmente existem herdeiros que querem lutar ...","There are rumors that a large quadrupedal tank is being developed in the basement of the tower.":"H\u00e1 rumores de que um grande tanque quadr\u00fapede est\u00e1 sendo desenvolvido no por\u00e3o da torre.","There are several islands on the ship":"Existem v\u00e1rias ilhas no navio","There are several islands on the ship;Because there are people;If you look around;You can get unexpected information;There may be.":"Existem v\u00e1rias ilhas no navio;Porque h\u00e1 pessoas;Se voc\u00ea olhar ao redor;Voc\u00ea pode obter informa\u00e7\u00f5es inesperadas;Pode haver.","There are so many people coming and going that I can't remember them all.":"H\u00e1 tantas pessoas indo e vindo que n\u00e3o consigo me lembrar de todas.","There are some things in this world that are better left unnoticed.":"H\u00e1 algumas coisas neste mundo que \u00e9 melhor deixar despercebidas.","There are still a lot of monsters, so the mercenaries can make a living, but what are you going to do when the monsters decrease?":"Ainda existem muitos monstros, ent\u00e3o os mercen\u00e1rios podem ganhar a vida, mas o que voc\u00ea vai fazer quando os monstros diminuirem?","There are still people who live with the stigma of slavery stamped on their hearts.":"Ainda h\u00e1 pessoas que vivem com o estigma da escravid\u00e3o estampado no cora\u00e7\u00e3o.","There are still young children!":"Ainda h\u00e1 crian\u00e7as pequenas!","There are traffic restrictions at night. I can't go outside.":"Existem restri\u00e7\u00f5es de tr\u00e1fego \u00e0 noite. Eu n\u00e3o posso sair.","There aren't many regular troops in 17th Street.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 muitas tropas regulares na Rua 17.","There is a creation myth, that is. It is said that the God who created this world also created Nebed.":"Existe um mito da cria\u00e7\u00e3o, claro. Diz-se que o Deus que criou este mundo tamb\u00e9m criou Nebed.","There is a dangerous-looking bear in the frozen sea. If you catch it, let Revan's guard know.":"H\u00e1 um urso de apar\u00eancia perigosa no mar congelado. Se voc\u00ea pegar, avise o guarda de Revan.","There is a guy who is not easy. Don't try to make money and lose it all on treatment costs.":"Tem um cara que n\u00e3o \u00e9 f\u00e1cil. N\u00e3o tente ganhar dinheiro e perder tudo com custos de tratamento.","There is a limit of 5 item sockets)":"H\u00e1 um limite de 5 encaixes de itens)","There is a limit to the reward amount, so I cannot give you more than this.":"H\u00e1 um limite para o valor da recompensa, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o posso lhe dar mais do que isso.","There is a need for improvement.":"H\u00e1 necessidade de melhorias.","There is a successor.":"Existe um sucessor.","There is a suspicious labyrinth underground. Looks very old...":"Existe um labirinto suspeito no subsolo. Parece muito antigo...","There is a tattoo engraved on it.":"H\u00e1 uma tatuagem gravada nele.","There is a tool with the initials L engraved on it. It appears to be badly damaged.){":"H\u00e1 uma ferramenta com as iniciais L gravadas. Parece estar muito danificado.){","There is a way to learn more about spirits.":"Existe uma maneira de aprender mais sobre esp\u00edritos.","There is absolutely no completion. It ends there. Never.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 absolutamente nenhuma conclus\u00e3o. Termina a\u00ed. Nunca.","There is an empty space on the control panel. If I insert something, it might work.){":"H\u00e1 um espa\u00e7o vazio no painel de controle. Se eu inserir algo, pode funcionar.){","There is more than I expected, so I will share some with you.":"H\u00e1 mais do que eu esperava, ent\u00e3o vou compartilhar alguns com voc\u00eas.","There is no benefit in going around bragging about being different from others.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 nenhum benef\u00edcio em sair por a\u00ed se gabando de ser diferente dos outros.","There is no inn here, so I would have stayed in a private house next door. The lady there might know something, right?":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 pousada aqui, ent\u00e3o eu teria ficado em uma casa particular ao lado. A senhora ali pode saber de alguma coisa, certo?","There is no life in the attack... Is it just to scare you?":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 vida no ataque... \u00c9 s\u00f3 para te assustar?","There is no more income.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 mais renda.","There is no place in the Orbis Islands that my fully remodeled Neo Graham cannot go!":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 lugar nas Ilhas Orbis onde meu Neo Graham totalmente remodelado n\u00e3o possa ir!","There is no place to retreat now. You and me too.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 lugar para recuar agora. Voc\u00ea e eu tamb\u00e9m.","There is no proper person for someone who hides his identity. Wouldn't it be bothersome if you got involved in something useless?":"N\u00e3o existe pessoa adequada para quem esconde sua identidade. N\u00e3o seria inc\u00f4modo se voc\u00ea se envolvesse em algo in\u00fatil?","There is no reality, right?":"N\u00e3o existe realidade, certo?","There is no researcher...is only the security device activated?){":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 pesquisador...s\u00f3 o dispositivo de seguran\u00e7a est\u00e1 ativado?){","There is no royal road to becoming strong! Just practice, practice, practice!":"N\u00e3o existe um caminho real para se tornar forte! Apenas pratique, pratique, pratique!","There is no save data stored on the server. Please save your save data on the server before using it.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 dados salvos armazenados no servidor. Salve seus dados salvos no servidor antes de us\u00e1-los.","There is no save history.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 hist\u00f3rico de salvamento.","There is no save history.?":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 hist\u00f3rico de salvamento.","There is no solution right now":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 solu\u00e7\u00e3o agora","There is no spirit..?":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 esp\u00edrito..?","There is no such god in this world.":"N\u00e3o existe tal deus neste mundo.","There is no such thing as what I wanted most.":"N\u00e3o existe o que eu mais queria.","There is no way.. I can only do my best.":"N\u00e3o tem como.. S\u00f3 posso fazer o meu melhor.","There is no way.. This is not an opponent you can face head-on..!":"N\u00e3o tem como.. Este n\u00e3o \u00e9 um oponente que voc\u00ea possa enfrentar de frente..!","There is not enough storage space. Please free up some space and try again.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 espa\u00e7o de armazenamento suficiente. Libere espa\u00e7o e tente novamente.","There is nothing to find.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada para encontrar.","There is only one crazy god who will kill us all when he wakes up.":"Existe apenas um deus maluco que vai matar todos n\u00f3s quando acordar.","There is something...){":"H\u00e1 algo...){","There is still enough time for the survivors of the exterminated family or those who were loyal to them to remain and cause a riot.":"Ainda h\u00e1 tempo para que os sobreviventes da fam\u00edlia exterminada ou aqueles que lhes foram leais permane\u00e7am e provoquem um motim.","There is.. In this, there is another successor other than Evelyn!":"Existe.. Nisso, existe outra sucessora al\u00e9m de Evelyn!","There isn't enough time to talk in circles. I'll tell you what you want to know.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 tempo suficiente para conversar em c\u00edrculos. Eu vou te contar o que voc\u00ea quer saber.","There isn't much for a mercenary to do.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 muito para um mercen\u00e1rio fazer.","There it is! There's Brianne!":"A\u00ed est\u00e1! L\u00e1 est\u00e1 Brianna!","There may also be Van Wade movement on Coal Creek Island.":"Tamb\u00e9m pode haver movimento de Van Wade na Ilha Coal Creek.","There may be survivors of Ronberg, a famous artisan family in Central, somewhere on Moytura Island.":"Pode haver sobreviventes de Ronberg, uma famosa fam\u00edlia de artes\u00e3os da Central, em algum lugar da Ilha Moytura.","There may be.":"Pode haver.","There might already be people out there searching. Be careful and let's go to the }northern cave{.":"Pode j\u00e1 haver pessoas por a\u00ed pesquisando. Tenha cuidado e vamos para a }caverna do norte{.","There might be a possibility...":"Pode haver uma possibilidade...","There must be a place.":"Deve haver um lugar.","There must be at least 3 people.":"Deve haver pelo menos 3 pessoas.","There must be some clues inside that closed tower.":"Deve haver algumas pistas dentro daquela torre fechada.","There seems to be a problem":"Parece haver um problema","There seems to be something in the ice.){":"Parece haver algo no gelo.){","There was a big 