s someone from Central looking for you a few days ago, right?":"Teve algu\u00e9m da Central procurando por voc\u00ea h\u00e1 alguns dias, certo?","There was someone who came to me to introduce you.":"Houve algu\u00e9m que veio at\u00e9 mim para apresent\u00e1-lo.","There was something strange about Captain Tyr at that time. It was like someone was possessed by something. Kefnes, Tyr, Brianne. The people who made up the three axes of the expedition":"Havia algo estranho no Capit\u00e3o Tyr naquela \u00e9poca. Era como se algu\u00e9m estivesse possu\u00eddo por alguma coisa. Kefnes, Tyr, Brianne. As pessoas que compuseram os tr\u00eas eixos da expedi\u00e7\u00e3o","There wasn't. I just felt worse.":"N\u00e3o houve. Eu apenas me senti pior.","There were people who immigrated with us, but over the past few years, one or two people have run away.":"Houve pessoas que imigraram connosco, mas nos \u00faltimos anos uma ou duas pessoas fugiram.","There were some accidents.":"Houve alguns acidentes.","There were the remains of the descendants.":"L\u00e1 estavam os restos mortais dos descendentes.","There will be a rattle with purple hair{, so you can find it.":"Haver\u00e1 um chocalho com cabelo roxo, ent\u00e3o voc\u00ea poder\u00e1 encontr\u00e1-lo.{","There will be.":"Haver\u00e1.","There!":"L\u00e1!","There's a Ren inside him, you can find it!":"H\u00e1 um Ren dentro dele, voc\u00ea pode encontr\u00e1-lo!","There's a cave to the east from here, right?":"H\u00e1 uma caverna a leste daqui, certo?","There's a chance it could be Rufus or Chris out of nowhere, so be nervous.":"H\u00e1 uma chance de que seja Rufus ou Chris do nada, ent\u00e3o fique nervoso.","There's a high possibility that it's Mark... Can you tell right away who the successor is?":"H\u00e1 uma grande possibilidade de que seja o Mark... Voc\u00ea consegue dizer imediatamente quem \u00e9 o sucessor?","There's a new store there.":"Tem uma loja nova l\u00e1.","There's also a rumor that the youngest one survived...":"H\u00e1 tamb\u00e9m um boato de que o mais novo sobreviveu...","There's no end in sight, but it won't last forever. I believe so.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 fim \u00e0 vista, mas n\u00e3o durar\u00e1 para sempre. Eu acredito que sim.","There's no end.. It's been a long time since we've had a fight like this...!":"N\u00e3o tem fim.. J\u00e1 faz muito tempo que n\u00e3o brigamos assim...!","There's no need for that.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 necessidade disso.","There's no need to help those guys.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 necessidade de ajudar esses caras.","There's no one in Central who hasn't heard of you.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 ningu\u00e9m na Central que n\u00e3o tenha ouvido falar de voc\u00ea.","There's no way I would have that tool, and since they said I was exterminated, wouldn't that be too much of a stretch?":"De jeito nenhum eu teria essa ferramenta, e j\u00e1 que disseram que fui exterminado, isso n\u00e3o seria exagero?","There's no way to deal with it right now.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 como lidar com isso agora.","There's not much from the council about what happened in the tower yesterday...":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 muito do conselho sobre o que aconteceu na torre ontem...","There's not much left!":"N\u00e3o resta muito!","There's nothing else to do yet. If there is anything I need to do, please ask again.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 mais nada a fazer ainda. Se houver algo que eu precise fazer, pergunte novamente.","There's nothing in this tunnel.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada neste t\u00fanel.","There's nothing left now. The ancient gods... the successors... and Althena...":"N\u00e3o resta mais nada agora. Os deuses antigos... os sucessores... e Althena...","There's nothing strange. This is a place where your creator may be located.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada de estranho. Este \u00e9 um lugar onde seu criador pode estar localizado.","There's nothing to gain. Looking at ugly machines will only make you feel bad.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada a ganhar. Olhar para m\u00e1quinas feias s\u00f3 far\u00e1 voc\u00ea se sentir mal.","There's nothing to see in the visitor area anyway. From now on, it will be a bold move.":"De qualquer forma, n\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada para ver na \u00e1rea de visitantes. De agora em diante, ser\u00e1 uma jogada ousada.","There's nothing you can't find if you have money.":"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o consiga encontrar se tiver dinheiro.","There's something strange, like there's something inside me that isn't me.":"H\u00e1 algo estranho, como se houvesse algo dentro de mim que n\u00e3o sou eu.","There's something you left behind earlier.":"H\u00e1 algo que voc\u00ea deixou para tr\u00e1s antes.","There's still me, and there's Schurz, too.":"Ainda existo eu e Schurz tamb\u00e9m.","There, Kaz!":"Pronto, Kaz!","There, there is a point that can lift the barrier.":"A\u00ed, h\u00e1 um ponto que pode levantar a barreira.","These are completely worthless words. Because everything is prepared to catch you.":"Estas s\u00e3o palavras completamente in\u00fateis. Porque tudo est\u00e1 preparado para te pegar.","These are keys... Most doors can be opened with these.":"Estas s\u00e3o chaves... A maioria das portas pode ser aberta com elas.","These are some of the programs set up on the Ark. It's just an annoying procedure.":"Estes s\u00e3o alguns dos programas instalados na Arca. \u00c9 apenas um procedimento chato.","These are the guests Evelyn mentioned. I'm ready to rest, so get some rest.":"Estes s\u00e3o os convidados que Evelyn mencionou. Estou pronto para descansar, ent\u00e3o descanse um pouco.","These are the main and auxiliary gun barrels of a large tank.":"Estes s\u00e3o os canos principais e auxiliares de um tanque grande.","These are the shoes Chris was wearing.":"Estes s\u00e3o os sapatos que Chris estava usando.","These are the shoes Chris was wearing.x":"Estes s\u00e3o os sapatos que Chris estava usando.x","These are the teeth of carnivorous seals that live in the frozen sea.":"Estes s\u00e3o os dentes das focas carn\u00edvoras que vivem no mar congelado.","These are work clothes ordered by the Rockville Development Corporation.":"Estas s\u00e3o roupas de trabalho encomendadas pela Rockville Development Corporation.","These books are probably offensive to the Wade family right now.":"Esses livros provavelmente s\u00e3o ofensivos para a fam\u00edlia Wade no momento.","These children... came to go to the }Ark{. I don't know how you knew...":"Estas crian\u00e7as... vieram para a }Arca{. N\u00e3o sei como voc\u00ea sabia...","These days are quite busy...":"Esses dias est\u00e3o bastante corridos...","These days, I feel like I've been too negligent in reading or researching.":"Hoje em dia, sinto que tenho sido muito negligente na leitura ou na pesquisa.","These days, because of the ancient species, almost every ship that goes out to sea is under the control of the Council.":"Hoje em dia, por causa das esp\u00e9cies antigas, quase todos os navios que saem para o mar est\u00e3o sob o controle do Conselho.","These days, the amount of materials going into the Central Tower has decreased significantly.":"Hoje em dia, a quantidade de materiais que v\u00e3o para a Torre Central diminuiu significativamente.","These days, the villagers keep making an uproar about something coming out of the haunted house in the northwest.":"Hoje em dia, os alde\u00f5es continuam fazendo alvoro\u00e7o sobre algo que sai da casa mal-assombrada no noroeste.","These days, there's a guy coming to the Rockville Development Complex{ to sell a huge amount of precious metals, and I think that's the name.":"Hoje em dia, tem um cara vindo ao Complexo de Desenvolvimento de Rockville{ para vender uma enorme quantidade de metais preciosos, e acho que esse \u00e9 o nome.","These expensive items cause unnecessary trouble. It's better to just leave it alone.":"Esses itens caros causam problemas desnecess\u00e1rios. \u00c9 melhor deixar isso como est\u00e1.","These guys are really annoying.":"Esses caras s\u00e3o realmente irritantes.","These guys, I don't know how they found out, but they know you're on Coal Creek Island.":"Esses caras, n\u00e3o sei como descobriram, mas sabem que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 na ilha Coal Creek.","These kids want to live in hiding in a place called the ark.":"Essas crian\u00e7as querem viver escondidas em um lugar chamado arca.","These photos...":"Essas fotos...","These things are all part of history that humans must take on.":"Todas essas coisas fazem parte da hist\u00f3ria que os humanos devem assumir.","These weapons cannot be repaired at will. As long as you have the right tools...":"Estas armas n\u00e3o podem ser reparadas \u00e0 vontade. Contanto que voc\u00ea tenha as ferramentas certas...","These wounds... are not caused by human weapons.":"Estas feridas... n\u00e3o s\u00e3o causadas por armas humanas.","They are cleverly preventing anyone from going to the frozen sea to investigate.":"Eles est\u00e3o habilmente impedindo que algu\u00e9m v\u00e1 ao mar congelado para investigar.","They are developing the republic and preventing chaos.":"Est\u00e3o a desenvolver a rep\u00fablica e a prevenir o caos.","They are gathering.":"Eles est\u00e3o se reunindo.","They are hostile to their successors.":"Eles s\u00e3o hostis aos seus sucessores.","They are not that different from humans. I laugh, I get angry, and I feel pain.":"Eles n\u00e3o s\u00e3o t\u00e3o diferentes dos humanos. Eu rio, fico com raiva e sinto dor.","They are performing ancestral rites according to the records left by Kangrimja. In that case, it makes sense that the ruins were revived.":"Eles est\u00e3o realizando ritos ancestrais de acordo com os registros deixados por Kangrimja. Nesse caso, faz sentido que as ru\u00ednas tenham sido revividas.","They are soldiers in black... they are dangerous.":"S\u00e3o soldados de preto... s\u00e3o perigosos.","They are unpleasant people.. without saying a word to each other.":"S\u00e3o pessoas desagrad\u00e1veis.. sem dizer uma palavra um ao outro.","They called Eileen":"Eles ligaram para Eileen","They called Eileen;Another successor, Mark.;According to Kaz;Holds gems of unknown origin;It is said that he is a rich man.;Where he lives is unknown;Rockville Development Authority;They say they mainly trade;Let":"Eles ligaram para Eileen;Outro sucessor, Mark.;De acordo com Kaz;Cont\u00e9m joias de origem desconhecida;Dizem que ele \u00e9 um homem rico.;Onde ele mora \u00e9 desconhecido;Autoridade de desenvolvimento de Rockville;Eles dizem que negociam principalmente;Deixe","They can have mental conversations with each other. Without even opening your mouth, no matter how far away you are.":"Eles podem ter conversas mentais entre si. Sem nem abrir a boca, n\u00e3o importa a dist\u00e2ncia que voc\u00ea esteja.","They decided to use humans for their master's resurrection, and humans were drawn to the power of the ancient gods and wanted to use that power...":"Eles decidiram usar humanos para a ressurrei\u00e7\u00e3o de seu mestre, e os humanos foram atra\u00eddos pelo poder dos deuses antigos e queriam usar esse poder...","They don't even know what's for humans. Just inciting confusion...":"Eles nem sabem o que \u00e9 para os humanos. Apenas incitando a confus\u00e3o...","They don't move around or have a base... What are they for?":"Eles n\u00e3o se movimentam nem t\u00eam base... Para que servem?","They look like twins, but the boy and I are complete opposites.":"Eles parecem g\u00eameos, mas o menino e eu somos completamente opostos.","They must have a plan too.":"Eles tamb\u00e9m devem ter um plano.","They must have created us for that purpose.. And they must be laughing somewhere even now..?":"Eles devem ter nos criado para esse prop\u00f3sito.. E eles devem estar rindo em algum lugar at\u00e9 agora..?","They must have gone into the center first. But...":"Eles devem ter ido primeiro para o centro. Mas...","They never come near the village.":"Eles nunca chegam perto da aldeia.","They probably worked on planting spirits in the successors here.":"Eles provavelmente trabalharam para plantar esp\u00edritos nos sucessores daqui.","They said he was Irem's genius scholar. I'm going to go to Moytura Island, where Irem is, and meet that man.":"Disseram que ele era o estudioso genial de Irem. Vou at\u00e9 a Ilha Moytura, onde est\u00e1 Irem, e encontro aquele homem.","They said humans... gave up their alter egos and chose us.":"Eles disseram que os humanos... desistiram dos seus alter egos e nos escolheram.","They said the captain was Kefnes. Is it real?":"Disseram que o capit\u00e3o era Kefnes. \u00c9 real?","They said the council doesn't care.":"Eles disseram que o conselho n\u00e3o se importa.","They said they were going to investigate.":"Eles disseram que iriam investigar.","They said they were offering a bounty for the birds that are causing trouble these days...":"Eles disseram que estavam oferecendo uma recompensa pelas aves que est\u00e3o causando problemas atualmente...","They said they would make it for me.":"Eles disseram que fariam isso para mim.","They said they would send me on the next ship, but if I hurry, I might be able to get on this one too.":"Disseram que me mandariam no pr\u00f3ximo navio, mas se eu me apressar, talvez consiga embarcar neste tamb\u00e9m.","They said you have to be the last winner... That always bothered me.":"Disseram que voc\u00ea tem que ser o \u00faltimo vencedor... Isso sempre me incomodou.","They say Eileen has disappeared.":"Dizem que Eileen desapareceu.","They say Eileen has disappeared.;I didn't look well either.;If you can't see it in the village;It's probably a bad situation;This is a story that happened...":"Dizem que Eileen desapareceu.;Eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o parecia bem.;Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o consegue ver isso na aldeia;Provavelmente \u00e9 uma situa\u00e7\u00e3o ruim;Essa \u00e9 uma hist\u00f3ria que aconteceu...","They say I might become that kind of monster and eat Mr. Schurz...!":"Dizem que posso me tornar esse tipo de monstro e comer o Sr. Schurz...!","They say Rockville is also becoming industrialized, so I hope we also do some redevelopment.":"Dizem que Rockville tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 se industrializando, ent\u00e3o espero que tamb\u00e9m fa\u00e7amos alguma remodela\u00e7\u00e3o.","They say he listens.":"Dizem que ele escuta.","They say he suddenly appeared a year ago.":"Dizem que ele apareceu de repente h\u00e1 um ano.","They say it was created by descendants. They say it's the new power that humans want...":"Dizem que foi criado por descendentes. Dizem que \u00e9 o novo poder que os humanos querem...","They say it will happen.":"Eles dizem que isso vai acontecer.","They say it's become more difficult than before, but this is the only job we have.":"Dizem que ficou mais dif\u00edcil do que antes, mas este \u00e9 o \u00fanico trabalho que temos.","They say it's been getting worse since coming to Moytura... I think it's the spirits that are causing trouble.":"Dizem que desde que cheguei a Moytura est\u00e1 piorando... Acho que s\u00e3o os esp\u00edritos que est\u00e3o causando problemas.","They say it's like some kind of pseudo-religious group in Irem that's hiding there...":"Dizem que \u00e9 como se fosse algum tipo de grupo pseudo-religioso em Irem que est\u00e1 escondido l\u00e1...","They say listeners can absorb each other. They say you will have stronger abilities.":"Dizem que os ouvintes podem absorver uns aos outros. Dizem que voc\u00ea ter\u00e1 habilidades mais fortes.","They say that originally, every year during the harvest season, the birds were troublesome, so the villagers hunted in groups.":"Dizem que originalmente, todos os anos durante a \u00e9poca da colheita, as aves eram problem\u00e1ticas, por isso os alde\u00f5es ca\u00e7avam em grupos.","They say the Soltians created us. As a new human god to fight against himself...":"Dizem que os Soltianos nos criaram. Como um novo deus humano para lutar contra si mesmo...","They say there are much warmer islands out there. I don't even remember...":"Dizem que existem ilhas muito mais quentes por a\u00ed. eu nem me lembro...","They say there is that facility.":"Dizem que existe essa facilidade.","They say there is.":"Eles dizem que existe.","They say they can":"Eles dizem que podem","They say they can hear the voices of spirits. In a very close place...":"Dizem que podem ouvir as vozes dos esp\u00edritos. Num lugar bem pr\u00f3ximo...","They say they can\u2019t do it.":"Eles dizem que n\u00e3o podem fazer isso.","They say they know.":"Eles dizem que sabem.","They say they mainly trade":"Eles dizem que negociam principalmente","They say they were purged by the Wade family... who don't exist anymore.":"Dizem que foram expurgados pela fam\u00edlia Wade... que n\u00e3o existe mais.","They say they won't come north anymore after taking over Meadow Hill.":"Eles dizem que n\u00e3o vir\u00e3o mais para o norte depois de assumirem Meadow Hill.","They say they're going into the Central Tower, but they need an escort.":"Dizem que v\u00e3o para a Torre Central, mas precisam de escolta.","They say you have to be like this to listen to what you say, and it makes people tired. great job.":"Dizem que \u00e9 preciso ser assim para ouvir o que voc\u00ea fala, e isso cansa as pessoas. \u00f3timo trabalho.","They say you need a key.":"Dizem que voc\u00ea precisa de uma chave.","They say you need a soul stone.":"Dizem que voc\u00ea precisa de uma pedra da alma.","They searched the entire Republic and gathered the extreme people Cradd mentioned.":"Eles vasculharam toda a Rep\u00fablica e reuniram as pessoas extremas que Cradd mencionou.","They secretly kidnapped him, made him his successor, and erased his memories?":"Eles o sequestraram secretamente, fizeram dele seu sucessor e apagaram suas mem\u00f3rias?","They talked as if they would definitely provide support for production facilities, but what does this mean?":"Eles falaram como se fossem definitivamente fornecer suporte \u00e0s instala\u00e7\u00f5es de produ\u00e7\u00e3o, mas o que isso significa?","They told me what I wanted to know most.":"Eles me disseram o que eu mais queria saber.","They took it from Wade Street. They'd probably rather be barbarically dismantled in the Central Tower.":"Eles pegaram na Wade Street. Eles provavelmente prefeririam ser barbaramente desmantelados na Torre Central.","They use mediocre materials or the finish is a bit sloppy.":"Utilizam materiais med\u00edocres ou o acabamento \u00e9 um pouco desleixado.","They were Brianne, who until then had been called a traitor, and a lieutenant named Graham.":"Eram Brianne, que at\u00e9 ent\u00e3o era chamada de traidora, e um tenente chamado Graham.","They were all moving somewhere on a boat...":"Eles estavam todos se mudando para algum lugar em um barco...","They were holding ancient species in the Central Tower?":"Eles estavam mantendo esp\u00e9cies antigas na Torre Central?","They will eventually destroy the Republic. We fought... Wade... and the listeners to stop it.":"Eles acabar\u00e3o por destruir a Rep\u00fablica. N\u00f3s lutamos... contra Wade... e contra os ouvintes para impedir isso.","They won":"Eles ganharam","They won\u2019t fight together.. will they?":"Eles n\u00e3o v\u00e3o lutar juntos... v\u00e3o?","They're a bunch of junk...":"S\u00e3o um monte de lixo...","They're right... everyone will die eventually... God will be created and used by someone.":"Eles est\u00e3o certos... todo mundo morrer\u00e1 eventualmente... Deus ser\u00e1 criado e usado por algu\u00e9m.","They're saying they'll take care of all the miners who signed the petition!":"Est\u00e3o dizendo que cuidar\u00e3o de todos os mineiros que assinaram a peti\u00e7\u00e3o!","They're targeting Chris.":"Eles est\u00e3o mirando em Chris.","Thick leather obtained from seals/larvae/half-fish people, etc.":"Couro grosso obtido de focas/larvas/meio-peixe, etc.","Thick leather obtained from seals/larvae/half-fish people, etc.M":"Couro grosso obtido de focas/larvas/meio-peixe, etc.M","Thin leather 4 / 