a express\u00e3o no rosto.","We are going... to the }Ark{!":"N\u00f3s estamos indo... para a }Arca{!","We are not just a religious group. Only those who truly seek salvation can join us.":"N\u00e3o somos apenas um grupo religioso. Somente aqueles que realmente buscam a salva\u00e7\u00e3o podem se juntar a n\u00f3s.","We are used to waiting.":"Estamos acostumados a esperar.","We are weapons,":"Somos armas,","We are weapons, right?":"Somos armas, certo?","We can't just wait and see.":"N\u00e3o podemos simplesmente esperar para ver.","We contacted you because we thought there were revolutionary forces in other places too... but we had no idea about this?":"Entramos em contato com voc\u00ea porque pens\u00e1vamos que havia for\u00e7as revolucion\u00e1rias em outros lugares tamb\u00e9m... mas n\u00e3o t\u00ednhamos ideia disso?","We couldn't be of any help. You must have been very weak.":"N\u00e3o poder\u00edamos ajudar em nada. Voc\u00ea devia estar muito fraco.","We destroy those who listen... Among the successors, we only need to deal with Rufus.":"Destru\u00edmos quem ouve... Entre os sucessores, s\u00f3 precisamos lidar com Rufus.","We don't have time to explore the cave, let's get moving!":"N\u00e3o temos tempo para explorar a caverna, vamos andando!","We don't know anything. I have no desire to know, much less do anything.":"N\u00e3o sabemos de nada. N\u00e3o tenho vontade de saber e muito menos de fazer nada.","We escaped from them with the power of the spirits... but they gave us this power?":"N\u00f3s escapamos deles com o poder dos esp\u00edritos... mas eles nos deram esse poder?","We have no choice. The ancient gods...":"N\u00e3o temos escolha. Os deuses antigos...","We have to figure it out now. Above all...":"Temos que descobrir isso agora. Acima de tudo...","We have to go deep somehow. Can you do it?":"Temos que ir fundo de alguma forma. Voc\u00ea pode fazer isso?","We have to go deep somehow. I'm going to investigate the ancestral rites they are holding above.":"Temos que ir fundo de alguma forma. Vou investigar os ritos ancestrais que eles realizam acima.","We have to run away. We'll all die!":"Temos que fugir. Todos n\u00f3s morreremos!","We hope that you too will join us in our prayers.":"Esperamos que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m se junte a n\u00f3s em nossas ora\u00e7\u00f5es.","We hope that you will be able to experience all the stories contained in Chronicles of Heroes 5...":"Esperamos que voc\u00ea possa vivenciar todas as hist\u00f3rias contidas em Chronicles of Heroes 5...","We manage the main shafts on Coal Creek Island and are primarily responsible for classifying and verifying outgoing minerals.":"Gerenciamos os principais po\u00e7os em Coal Creek Island e somos os principais respons\u00e1veis pela classifica\u00e7\u00e3o e verifica\u00e7\u00e3o dos minerais de sa\u00edda.","We might be right... I can't miss this opportunity.":"Podemos estar certos... N\u00e3o posso perder esta oportunidade.","We must exterminate the goblins.":"Devemos exterminar os goblins.","We need more people, people. There is no choice with the workforce calculated by Congress.":"Precisamos de mais gente, gente. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 escolha com a for\u00e7a de trabalho calculada pelo Congresso.","We need to chase that guy and catch him. That man clearly knows something..!":"Precisamos perseguir aquele cara e peg\u00e1-lo. Esse homem claramente sabe alguma coisa..!","We need to create people like this...?":"Precisamos criar pessoas assim...?","We need to increase the cost of mineral review. If this is the case, labor costs will not be paid properly.":"Precisamos aumentar o custo da revis\u00e3o mineral. Se for esse o caso, os custos trabalhistas n\u00e3o ser\u00e3o pagos adequadamente.","We need to make explosives.":"Precisamos fazer explosivos.","We need to talk about it.":"Precisamos conversar sobre isso.","We only get one chance, Schurz.":"S\u00f3 temos uma oportunidade, Schurz.","We provide only the best items made from the best ingredients. Take a look.":"Fornecemos apenas os melhores itens feitos com os melhores ingredientes. D\u00ea uma olhada.","We put a lot of effort into causing a lot of accidents here and there, so now is our chance to escape.":"N\u00f3s nos esfor\u00e7amos muito para causar muitos acidentes aqui e ali, ent\u00e3o agora \u00e9 nossa chance de escapar.","We talked about it, but it doesn't seem to have been conveyed well.":"Conversamos sobre isso, mas n\u00e3o parece ter sido bem transmitido.","We too... are preparing to fight the Wade family in our own way.":"N\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m... estamos nos preparando para lutar contra a fam\u00edlia Wade \u00e0 nossa maneira.","We too... we will be in the ark too!":"N\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m... estaremos na arca tamb\u00e9m!","We wanted to know who was behind the Wade family that destroyed our family, so we planned to infiltrate Central Tower...":"Quer\u00edamos saber quem estava por tr\u00e1s da fam\u00edlia Wade que destruiu nossa fam\u00edlia, ent\u00e3o planejamos nos infiltrar na Torre Central...","We were }experiments{... of those listening...":"\u00c9ramos }experimentos{... de quem escuta...","We will be together from now on, always...":"Estaremos juntos a partir de agora, sempre...","We will wait...":"Vamos esperar...","We won't kill each other to create gods or something, and we won't be eaten by spirits and turn into monsters.":"N\u00e3o mataremos uns aos outros para criar deuses ou algo assim, e n\u00e3o seremos comidos por esp\u00edritos e nos transformaremos em monstros.","We won.":"N\u00f3s vencemos.","We'll be together until we find Mark{. Seeing as you came here, it looks like you got a clue.":"Estaremos juntos at\u00e9 encontrarmos Mark{. Vendo que voc\u00ea veio aqui, parece que voc\u00ea tem uma pista.","We'll blow up the side of the ship and load it out, so please guard the deck in the meantime.":"Vamos explodir a lateral do navio e carreg\u00e1-lo, ent\u00e3o, por favor, proteja o conv\u00e9s enquanto isso.","We'll go to the Ark{ and live quietly in hiding. Without interfering with anyone or being interfered with... then that's okay, right?":"Iremos para a Arca e viveremos tranquilamente escondidos. Sem interferir com ningu\u00e9m ou sofrer interfer\u00eancia... ent\u00e3o tudo bem, certo?{","We'll meet again soon.. so there's no need to miss you already.":"Nos encontraremos novamente em breve.. ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o h\u00e1 necessidade de j\u00e1 estar com saudades.","We'll talk later, but get out first!":"Conversaremos mais tarde, mas saia primeiro!","We're going to lure them in with a relic and settle the matter.":"Vamos atra\u00ed-los com uma rel\u00edquia e resolver o assunto.","We're trying to improve our situation. <Try to raise wages{or <improve working conditions{}.":"Estamos tentando melhorar nossa situa\u00e7\u00e3o. <Tente aumentar os sal\u00e1rios{ou <melhorar as condi\u00e7\u00f5es de trabalho{}.","We're using an old warehouse near the mine as a gathering place... but you really want to go alone?":"Estamos usando um antigo armaz\u00e9m perto da mina como ponto de encontro... mas voc\u00ea quer mesmo ir sozinho?","We've already searched the Twilight Island for the remains of the Advent...":"J\u00e1 vasculhamos a Ilha do Crep\u00fasculo em busca dos restos do Advento...","We've been given powers, so let's have fun, okay? I'll use your fingers..!":"Recebemos poderes, ent\u00e3o vamos nos divertir, ok? Vou usar seus dedos..!","We've only been guessing...":"Est\u00e1vamos apenas adivinhando...","We, Nebed, were the first ones created by that god to serve as slaves...":"N\u00f3s, Nebed, fomos os primeiros criados por aquele deus para servir como escravos...","Weapon":"Arma","Weapon Items":"Itens de armas","Weapon Items7":"Itens de armas7","Weapon1 Crit Damage LV":"Arma1 Dano Cr\u00edtico LV","Weapon1 Crit LV":"Arma1 Cr\u00edtico LV","Weapon2 Attack LV":"Arma2 Ataque LV","Weapon2 Hit LV":"Arma2 Hit LV","Weapon: Gun":"Arma: Arma","Weapon: Gun;Armor: Light Armor;HP: Recovered at re