 used, there is a }#04%|chance for }#13 seconds|":"Quando usado, h\u00e1 uma }#04%|chance de }#13 segundos|","When used, you become invincible for a short period of time.":"Quando usado, voc\u00ea se torna invenc\u00edvel por um curto per\u00edodo de tempo.","When using the exchange, the sales period limit is removed.":"Ao usar a troca, o limite do per\u00edodo de vendas \u00e9 removido.","When using the exchange, the selling period is extended to 14 days. The default is 7 days.":"Na utiliza\u00e7\u00e3o da bolsa, o prazo de venda \u00e9 estendido para 14 dias. O padr\u00e3o \u00e9 7 dias.","When using the exchange, you can list up to 20 items for sale.":"Ao usar a troca, voc\u00ea pode listar at\u00e9 20 itens \u00e0 venda.","When using the network overseas, international rates apply.":"Ao usar a rede no exterior, aplicam-se taxas internacionais.","When using }axe|":"Ao usar }axe|","When using }dagger|":"Ao usar }dagger|","When using }heavy gun|":"Ao usar }arma pesada|","When using }lightweight|":"Ao usar }lightweight|","When using }one-handed sword|":"Ao usar }espada de uma m\u00e3o|","When using }recovery item|":"Ao usar }item de recupera\u00e7\u00e3o|","When we hid them, the attacks of the ancient species stopped. There's no doubt that he felt the spirit was a threat, right?":"Quando os escondemos, os ataques das esp\u00e9cies antigas pararam. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 d\u00favida de que ele sentiu que o esp\u00edrito era uma amea\u00e7a, certo?","When will it come back? Tyr... it would be better if you go together.":"Quando isso vai voltar? Tyr... seria melhor se voc\u00eas fossem juntos.","When you became the successor, you created that little sun.":"Quando voc\u00ea se tornou o sucessor, voc\u00ea criou aquele pequeno sol.","When you cross the southern twilight bridge":"Quando voc\u00ea atravessa a ponte crepuscular do sul","When you fought me earlier... weren't you injured?":"Quando voc\u00ea lutou comigo mais cedo... voc\u00ea n\u00e3o se machucou?","When you get the chance.":"Quando voc\u00ea tiver a chance.","When you hear something about the war in the Holy Land, come to 9th Street later and tell me the story.":"Quando voc\u00ea ouvir algo sobre a guerra na Terra Santa, venha mais tarde \u00e0 Rua 9 e me conte a hist\u00f3ria.","When you lose your spirit power...":"Quando voc\u00ea perde seu poder espiritual...","When you meet Tyrna Graham, ask about the cause of the Holy Land War.":"Ao conhecer Tyrna Graham, pergunte sobre a causa da Guerra da Terra Santa.","When you meet him, he's just an ordinary young man.. Huh.":"Quando voc\u00ea o conhece, ele \u00e9 apenas um jovem comum.. Huh.","When you press it, it disassembles immediately.":"Ao pression\u00e1-lo, ele desmonta imediatamente.","When you say it like that, you seem like a much nicer guy than Mr. Schurz.":"Quando voc\u00ea diz isso assim, voc\u00ea parece um cara muito mais legal do que o Sr. Schurz.","When you say succession, what exactly do you mean by succession..!!":"Quando voc\u00ea diz sucess\u00e3o, o que exatamente voc\u00ea quer dizer com sucess\u00e3o..!!","When you select a <weapon{, <armor{, or <accessory{} from the bag, the <Disassemble{ menu will appear.":"Ao selecionar uma <arma{, <armadura{ ou <acess\u00f3rio{} da bolsa, o menu <Desmontar{ ser\u00e1 exibido.","When you use a combination book, a new combination recipe is automatically registered.":"Quando voc\u00ea usa um livro de combina\u00e7\u00f5es, uma nova receita de combina\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 registrada automaticamente.","When you're not feeling well, you need to take good care of yourself.":"Quando voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 se sentindo bem, voc\u00ea precisa cuidar bem de si mesmo.","Where am I..?":"Onde estou..?","Where are we?":"Onde estamos?","Where are you going out at this time of night?":"Onde voc\u00ea vai sair a esta hora da noite?","Where are you going?":"Onde voc\u00ea est\u00e1 indo?","Where can I find something like that?":"Onde posso encontrar algo assim?","Where did you run away!":"Para onde voc\u00ea fugiu!","Where does it lead?":"Aonde isso leva?","Where does it say in the letter to meet?":"Onde est\u00e1 escrito na carta para nos encontrarmos?","Where have you been and what have you been doing all this time?":"Onde voc\u00ea esteve e o que tem feito todo esse tempo?","Where he lives is unknown":"Onde ele mora \u00e9 desconhecido","Where is it?":"Onde est\u00e1?","Where is that? If only I was alive.. As long as I was alive..":"Onde fica isso? Se ao menos eu estivesse vivo.. Contanto que eu estivesse vivo..","Where on earth was he doing before he showed up in Moytura?":"Onde diabos ele estava fazendo antes de aparecer em Moytura?","Where's the money for a beggar?":"Onde est\u00e1 o dinheiro para um mendigo?","Wherever a successor appears, mysterious rumors are bound to spread. As long as you have money, research is not difficult.":"Onde quer que apare\u00e7a um sucessor, rumores misteriosos certamente se espalhar\u00e3o. Contanto que voc\u00ea tenha dinheiro, pesquisar n\u00e3o \u00e9 dif\u00edcil.","Wherever he went, he was a person who was not satisfied unless he was a leader...":"Aonde quer que fosse, ele era uma pessoa que n\u00e3o ficava satisfeita a menos que fosse um l\u00edder...","Whether the harvest was good or bad, I was able to survive thanks to the support of the Ernest family.":"Quer a colheita tenha sido boa ou ruim, consegui sobreviver gra\u00e7as ao apoio da fam\u00edlia Ernest.","While blocking":"Durante o bloqueio","While taking a short break in the mine shaft... the animals became so abnormally vicious...":"Enquanto faziam uma pequena pausa no po\u00e7o da mina... os animais tornaram-se t\u00e3o anormalmente cru\u00e9is...","Whirlwind Slash":"Corte do Redemoinho","White bear {":"Urso branco {","Who are you!":"Quem \u00e9 voc\u00ea!","Who are you? I'm really curious.":"Quem \u00e9 voc\u00ea? Estou muito curioso.","Who are you? Why are you trying to run away?":"Quem \u00e9 voc\u00ea? Por que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 tentando