rong like monsters.":"Voc\u00eas s\u00e3o fortes como monstros.","You guys had nothing anyway... At least we gave you a goal in life.":"Voc\u00eas n\u00e3o tinham nada mesmo... Pelo menos n\u00f3s lhes demos um objetivo na vida.","You guys, it's actually easy.":"Pessoal, \u00e9 realmente f\u00e1cil.","You had an adventure. Thank you for your hard work, so I won't thank you for your help.":"Voc\u00ea teve uma aventura. Obrigado pelo seu trabalho \u00e1rduo, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o vou agradecer pela sua ajuda.","You have already secured your maximum bag.":"Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 garantiu sua mala m\u00e1xima.","You have already secured your maximum bag.H":"Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 garantiu sua bagagem m\u00e1xima.H","You have already surpassed human strength, Tyr.":"Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 superou a for\u00e7a humana, Tyr.","You have been the Wade family's most wanted criminal for the past few years. What made you like that?":"Voc\u00ea tem sido o criminoso mais procurado pela fam\u00edlia Wade nos \u00faltimos anos. O que fez voc\u00ea gostar disso?","You have completed registration.":"Voc\u00ea concluiu o registro.","You have completed registration.&":"Voc\u00ea concluiu o registro.&","You have exceeded your limit.":"Voc\u00ea excedeu seu limite.","You have exceeded your limit.+":"Voc\u00ea excedeu seu limite.+","You have inherited the spirit...":"Voc\u00ea herdou o esp\u00edrito...","You have the latest version (":"Voc\u00ea tem a vers\u00e3o mais recente (","You have the latest version.":"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 usando a vers\u00e3o mais recente.","You have to be careful. Those guys don't think they could blockade a village so sloppily.":"Voc\u00ea tem que ter cuidado. Esses caras n\u00e3o acham que conseguiriam bloquear uma aldeia de maneira t\u00e3o desleixada.","You have to be strong minded..":"Voc\u00ea tem que ter uma mente forte..","You have to control it well. If we don't stop it... that's what will happen to us too.":"Voc\u00ea tem que control\u00e1-lo bem. Se n\u00e3o pararmos co